<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Yatɛne Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yatɛne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yatɛne</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nabi Musa Alaa Falan Naxan Sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Tawureta Musa yire naaninden ni i ra. Isirayila kaane to keli Misiran yamanani, siga Kanan bɔxɔni, e feen naxanye liga kira yi, ne nan sɛbɛxi Kitabun yireni ito kui. A xili saxi na kiini nɛn bayo Isirayila kaane yatɛn nan sɛbɛxi a kui naxan findixi dɔxɔde wuyaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila kaane yelin xanbini sariyane birin sɔtɛ Musa ra Ala naxanye fala a xa Sinayi geyaan fari e mini xanbini Misiran yamanani, e yi e yitɔn siga na yamanani Ala naxan nagidixi e ma. E yi siga singen han Kadesi-Barineya yi, Isirayila yamanan so dɛna. Koni e yi gaxu soɛ. Nayi, e yi lu tonbonni ɲɛɛ tonge naanin. Dɔnxɛn na, e yi tɔrɔ wuyaxi sɔtɔ, e yi siga yiifanna ma alogo e xa Moyaba yamanan masɔtɔ Fɔxɔ Daraan sogeteden binni. Kitabun yireni ito sora dɔnxɛne fe wuyaxi gbɛtɛye nan falama naxan liga Moyaba yamanani. Isirayila kaane lu mɛn nin han e yi so Kanan yamanani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabun yireni ito Alaa yamana muxuyaan nan yitama en na. Waxatina nde e lannayaan liga, waxatina nde sikɛna. Waxatina nde e xaxili ragidixi, waxati gbɛtɛ, e yigitɛgɛxi. Koni, hali Alaa yamaan mi tinxin waxatin birin, Alaa tinxinna mi ɲanɲɛ.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane xili sɛbɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1"/>Alatala yi falan ti Musa xa Naralan Bubun kui, Sinayi tonbonni, kike firinden lɔxɔ singeni, e minin ɲɛɛ firindeni Misiran bɔxɔni. A yi a fala, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2"/>“Ɛ nun Haruna xa Isirayila yamaan birin tɛngɛ, ɛ xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3"/>Ɛ xa Isirayila xɛmɛne birin tɛngɛ fata e ganle ra naxanye barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4"/>Bɔnsɔn yo bɔnsɔn, xabila manga keden xa ɛ mali.” <verse eid="NUM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5"/>Na mali muxune xinle ni itoe ra:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:5">Keli Rubɛn bɔnsɔnni, Sedewuri a dii Elisuri.<verse eid="NUM 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6"/>Keli Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnni, Surisadayi a dii Selumiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7"/>Keli Yuda bɔnsɔnni, Aminadabo a dii Naxason.<verse eid="NUM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8"/>Keli Isakari bɔnsɔnni, Suwari a dii Natanɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9"/>Keli Sabulon bɔnsɔnni, Xelɔn ma dii Eliyabi.<verse eid="NUM 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10"/>Yusufu a diine bɔnsɔnne: Keli Efirami bɔnsɔnni, Amixudi a dii Elisama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:10">Keli Manase bɔnsɔnni, Pedasuri a dii Gamaliyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11"/>Keli Bunyamin bɔnsɔnni, Gidewoni a dii Abidan.<verse eid="NUM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12"/>Keli Dan bɔnsɔnni, Amisadayi a dii Axiyeseri.<verse eid="NUM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13"/>Keli Aseri bɔnsɔnni, Okiran ma dii Pagiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14"/>Keli Gadi bɔnsɔnni, Dewuyɛli a dii Eliyasafi.<verse eid="NUM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15"/>Keli Nafatali bɔnsɔnni, Enan ma dii Axira.<verse eid="NUM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16"/>Bɔnsɔn mangani itoe nan yi xilixi yamaan yɛ. Ne yi findixi Isirayila gali kuntigine nan na. <verse eid="NUM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17"/>Musa nun Haruna yi muxuni itoe tongo naxanye xinle yɛbaxi. <verse eid="NUM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18"/>E yi yamaan birin malan kike firinden xii singen ma. Xɛmɛn naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, e yi ne birin xinle sɛbɛ keden keden yɛ ma kɛdin ma, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, <verse eid="NUM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19"/>alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. A yi e tɛngɛ Sinayi tonbonni.<verse eid="NUM 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20"/>E yi xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ keden keden yɛ ma Isirayila a dii singe Rubɛn bɔnsɔnni xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21"/>E muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli sennin kɛmɛ suulun tɛngɛ Rubɛn bɔnsɔnni. <verse eid="NUM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22"/>E yi Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ keden keden yɛ ma, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23"/>E muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli solomanaanin kɛmɛ saxan tɛngɛ Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24"/>E yi Gadi bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25"/>E muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli suulun kɛmɛ sennin tonge suulun tɛngɛ Gadi bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26"/>E yi Yuda bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27"/>E muxu wuli tonge solofere wuli naanin kɛmɛ sennin tɛngɛ Yuda bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28"/>E yi Isakari bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29"/>E muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli naanin kɛmɛ naanin tɛngɛ Isakari bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30"/>E yi Sabulon bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31"/>E yi muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli solofere kɛmɛ naanin tɛngɛ Sabulon bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32"/>Yusufu a diine bɔnsɔnne yɛ: E yi Efirami bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33"/>E muxu wuli tonge naanin kɛmɛ suulun tɛngɛ Efirami bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34"/>E yi Manase bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35"/>E muxu wuli tonge saxan wuli firin kɛmɛ firin tɛngɛ Manase bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36"/>E yi Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37"/>E muxu wuli tonge saxan wuli suulun kɛmɛ naanin tɛngɛ Bunyamin bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38"/>E yi Dan bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39"/>E muxu wuli tonge sennin wuli firin kɛmɛ solofere tɛngɛ Dan bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40"/>E yi Aseri bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41"/>E muxu wuli tonge naanin e nun keden kɛmɛ suulun tɛngɛ Aseri bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42"/>E yi Nafatali bɔnsɔnna xɛmɛne birin xinle sɛbɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43"/>E yi muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli saxan kɛmɛ naanin tɛngɛ Nafatali bɔnsɔnni.<verse eid="NUM 1:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44"/>Musa nun Haruna nun Isirayila yamaan manga fu nun firinna ne xasabin nan yatɛ, bɔnsɔn keden manga keden. <verse eid="NUM 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45"/>Isirayila kaane birin yatɛxin denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye barin bata yi dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye yi nɔɛ sofa wanla kɛ, <verse eid="NUM 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46"/>ne birin malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ sennin wuli saxan kɛmɛ suulun tonge suulun nan yi a ra.<verse eid="NUM 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna a wanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna denbayane tan mi yi tɛngɛxi alo bonne.<verse eid="NUM 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48"/>Alatala a fala nɛn Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49"/>“I nama Lewi bɔnsɔnna nun Isirayila kaan bonne tɛngɛ e bode xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50"/>I xa layiri sereyaan Bubun taxu Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ra e nun a muranne nun a seene birin. E xa batu bubun nun a muranne xali. E yi e ɲɔxɔ lu e xɔn, e yi e yamaan daaxadeni tɔn a rabilinni. <verse eid="NUM 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51"/>Ɛ na keli sigadeni, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan Ala Batu Bubun wayanma, e mɔn yi a yitɔn ɛ na dɔxɔ daaxaden naxan yi. Xa muxu gbɛtɛ a maso a ra, ɛ xa a faxa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52"/>Isirayila kaane birin xa e malan e daaxadeni, birin yi dɔxɔ gali yɛɛn ma a taxamasenna bun. <verse eid="NUM 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune tan xa e bubune ti layiri sereyaan bubun nabilinni, e yi e ɲɔxɔ lu a xɔn alogo n ma xɔlɔn nama godo Isirayila yamaan ma.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54"/>Alatala a yamarin Musa ma kii naxan yi, Isirayila kaane yi na birin liga.<verse eid="NUM 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bɔnsɔnne dɔxɔ kiina yamaan daaxadeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1"/>Alatala yi falan ti Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2"/>“Isirayila kaane birin xa yamaan daaxadeni tɔn Naralan Bubun nabilinni, koni e nama a yigbɛtɛn. E xa dɔxɔ e bɔnsɔnna nun e denbayaan taxamasenne bun.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3"/>“Yuda bɔnsɔnna nun a ganle xa e daaxadeni tɔn sogeteden binni e taxamasenna bun ma. Aminadabo a dii Naxason nan Yuda mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4"/>Muxu wuli tonge solofere wuli naanin kɛmɛ sennin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5"/>Isakari bɔnsɔnna xa e daaxadeni tɔn e dɛxɔn ma. Suwari a dii Natanɛli nan Isakari bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6"/>Muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli naanin kɛmɛ naanin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7"/>Sabulon bɔnsɔnna xa daaxa e fan dɛxɔn ma. Xelɔn ma dii Eliyabi nan Sabulon bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8"/>Muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli solofere kɛmɛ naanin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9"/>Nayi, xɛmɛn naxanye Yuda yamaan daaxaden ganli, ne birin malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ wuli tonge solomasɛxɛ e nun sennin kɛmɛ naanin. Yamaan na keli, e singen nan sigama.”<verse eid="NUM 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10"/>“Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna nun a ganle xa e daaxadeni tɔn yiifari fɔxɔni e taxamasenna bun ma. Sedewuri a dii Elisuri nan Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11"/>Muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli sennin kɛmɛ suulun nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna xa e daaxadeni tɔn a dɛxɔn ma. Surisadayi a dii Selumiyɛli nan Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13"/>Muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli solomanaanin kɛmɛ saxan nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna xa daaxa na fan dɛxɔn ma. Reyuli a dii Eliyasafi nan Gadi bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15"/>Muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli suulun kɛmɛ sennin tonge suulun nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16"/>Nayi, xɛmɛn naxanye Rubɛn yamaan daaxaden ganli, ne malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ wuli tonge suulun e nun keden kɛmɛ naanin tonge suulun. Ne nan sigama a firindeni.”<verse eid="NUM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17"/>“Na xanbi ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi siga ganla bonne tagi, e nun Naralan Bubuna. E birin sigama e daaxa yɛɛn nan ma, muxun birin nun a tidena, a bɔnsɔnna taxamasenna bun ma.”<verse eid="NUM 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18"/>“Efirami bɔnsɔnna nun a ganle xa e daaxadeni tɔn sogegododeni e taxamasenna bun ma. Amixudi a dii Elisama nan Efirami bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19"/>Muxu wuli tonge naanin kɛmɛ suulun nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna xa daaxa a dɛxɔn ma. Pedasuri a dii Gamaliyɛli nan Manase bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21"/>Muxu wuli tonge saxan wuli firin kɛmɛ firin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna xa daaxa na fan dɛxɔn ma. Gidewoni a dii Abidan nan Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23"/>Muxu wuli tonge saxan wuli suulun kɛmɛ naanin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24"/>Nayi, xɛmɛn naxanye Efirami yamaan daaxaden ganli, ne malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ wuli solomasɛxɛ muxu kɛmɛ. E tan nan sigama a saxandeni.”<verse eid="NUM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25"/>“Dan bɔnsɔnna nun a ganle xa e daaxadeni tɔn kɔmɛn fɔxɔni e taxamasenna bun ma. Amisadayi a dii Axiyeseri nan Dan bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26"/>Muxu wuli tonge sennin wuli firin kɛmɛ solofere nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27"/>Aseri bɔnsɔnna xa e daaxadeni tɔn a dɛxɔn ma. Okiran ma dii Pagiyɛli nan Aseri bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28"/>Muxu wuli tonge naanin e nun keden kɛmɛ suulun nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29"/>Nafatali bɔnsɔnna xa daaxa na fan dɛxɔn ma. Enan ma dii Axira nan Nafatali bɔnsɔnna mangan na. <verse eid="NUM 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30"/>Muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli saxan kɛmɛ naanin nan a ganli. <verse eid="NUM 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31"/>Nayi, xɛmɛn naxanye Dan ma yamaan daaxaden ganli, ne malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ wuli tonge suulun e nun solofere kɛmɛ sennin. Ne nan sigan dɔnxɛn na, e taxamasenna bun ma.”<verse eid="NUM 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32"/>Isirayila kaane nan ne ra naxanye tɛngɛ denbaya yɛɛn ma. Gali daaxadene birin malanxina, muxu wuli kɛmɛ sennin wuli saxan kɛmɛ suulun tonge suulun. <verse eid="NUM 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune mi tɛngɛ Isirayila kaan bonne yɛ, alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34"/>Alatala yamarin naxanye birin fi Musa ma Isirayila kaane yi ne birin liga. E yi e daaxaden yɛba e taxamasenne bun ma na kiini, e mɔn yi sigama na kii nin, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma.<verse eid="NUM 2:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna wanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1"/>Haruna nun Musaa denbayaan muxune ni i ra, Alatala falan ti Musa xa waxatin naxan yi Sinayi geyaan fari.<verse eid="NUM 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2"/>Harunaa diine xinle ni itoe ra: a dii singena Nadaba, Abihu, Eleyasari nun Itamara. <verse eid="NUM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3"/>Ne nan yi Harunaa diine ra naxanye masusan alogo e xa dɔxɔ saraxaraliyani, e yi na wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4"/>Koni Nadaba nun Abihu faxa nɛn Alatala yɛtagi Sinayi tonbonni, e to fa tɛɛ daxataren na a xa. Dii mi yi e yii, nanara, Eleyasari nun Itamara nan lu saraxarali wanla kɛ e baba Haruna bun ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6"/>“Lewi bɔnsɔnna maso, i yi e lu saraxarali Haruna sagoni, e lu a wanla ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7"/>E xa Haruna nun yamana wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni, e Ala Batu bubun wanle kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8"/>E yengi dɔxɔma nɛn Naralan Bubun muranne xɔn, e yi Ala Batu Bubun wanle rakamali Isirayila kaane xa. <verse eid="NUM 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9"/>I xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune lu Haruna nun a diine sagoni. E tan nan fima n ma Isirayila kaane yɛ habadan! <verse eid="NUM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10"/>I xa Haruna nun a diine dɔxɔ saraxaraliyani. Muxu gbɛtɛ na a maso yire sariɲanxin na, ɛ xa a faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12"/>“N tan yɛtɛɛn bata Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune sugandi Isirayila kaane yɛ, e findi n gbeen na Isirayila dii singene ɲɔxɔn na. <verse eid="NUM 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13"/>Amasɔtɔ n gbeen nan dii singene birin na. N Misiran dii singene birin faxa lɔxɔni, n yi dii singene birin nasariɲan n yɛtɛ xa Isirayila yi. Muxu ba, xuruse ba, n gbeen nan e ra. Alatala nan n tan na.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna xili sɛbɛ singena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa Sinayi tonbonni, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15"/>“I xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune tɛngɛ, denbaya yɛɛn nun xabila yɛɛn ma. I xa xɛmɛne birin tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata dangu kike kedenna ra.”<verse eid="NUM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16"/>Musa yi e tɛngɛ alo Alatala a yamari kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17"/>Lewi a diine xinle ni itoe ra: Gɛrisɔn, Kehati e nun Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18"/>Gɛrisɔn ma diine findixi xabilani itoe nan benbaye ra: Libini nun Simeyi. <verse eid="NUM 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19"/>Kehati a diine findixi xabilani itoe nan benbaye ra: Amirama, Yisehari, Xebiron e nun Yusiyɛli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20"/>Merari a diine findixi xabilani itoe nan benbaye ra: Maxali nun Musi. Lewi xabilane nan ne ra e nun e denbayane benbane.<verse eid="NUM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21"/>Gɛrisɔn findixi Libini nun Simayi xabilane benban nan na. Ne nan Gɛrisɔn xabilane ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22"/>E xɛmɛn naxanye tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, e muxu wuli solofere kɛmɛ suulun. <verse eid="NUM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23"/>Gɛrisɔn xabilane yi e daaxadeni tɔnma Ala Batu Bubun nan xanbi ra, sogegodode binni. <verse eid="NUM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24"/>Eliyasafi nan yi Gɛrisɔn xabilane mangan na, Layeli a diina. <verse eid="NUM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25"/>Gɛrisɔn xabilane yi e yengi lu Naralan Bubun yireni itoe xɔn: bubun nun a xunna soon kuiin nun a fanna, a so dɛɛn yɛ masansan dugina, <verse eid="NUM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26"/>sansanna taa dugine naxan Ala Batu Bubun nun saraxa ganden nabilinni, dugin naxan singanxi sansanna dɛɛn na, e nun lutine nun e ti seene birin.<verse eid="NUM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27"/>Kehati findixi Amirama nun Yisehari nun Xebiron nun Yusiyɛli xabilane benban nan na. Ne nan Kehati xabilane ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28"/>E xɛmɛn naxanye tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, e muxu wuli solomasɛxɛ kɛmɛ sennin. E tan nan e yengi lu yire sariɲanxin xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29"/>Kehati xabilane yi e daaxadeni tɔnma Ala Batu Bubun yiifari fɔxɔn nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30"/>Elisafan nan yi Kehati xabilane mangan na, Yusiyɛli a diina. <verse eid="NUM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31"/>Kehati xabilane yi e yengi lu muranni itoe xɔn, Layiri Kankirana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fk">3.31</char> <char style="fk">Layiri Kankirana</char> fe mɔn sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 25.10-22 kui.</note> tabanla, lɛnpu dɔxɔ sena, saraxa gandene, goronna naxanye rawalima yire sariɲanxini, yɛ masansan dugina, e nun e rawali seene birin.<verse eid="NUM 3:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32"/>Saraxarali Harunaa dii Eleyasari nan yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune birin mangan na. A tan nan yi dɔxi ne xun na naxanye yi e yengi luxi yire sariɲanxin xɔn ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33"/>Merari findixi Maxali nun Musi xabilane benban nan na. Ne nan Merari xabilane ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34"/>E xɛmɛn naxanye tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, e muxu wuli sennin kɛmɛ firin. <verse eid="NUM 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35"/>Suriyeli nan yi Merari xabilane mangan na, Abixali a diina. E yi e daaxadeni tɔnma Ala Batu Bubun kɔmɛn fɔxɔn nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36"/>Merari xabilane yi e yengi lu Ala Batu Bubun buntine nun gaalane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.36</char> Nde a falama a “galalenne.”</note> nun sɛnbɛtɛnne nun bundɔxɔne nun muranne xɔn e nun e ti seene birin, <verse eid="NUM 3:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37"/>e nun a sansanna sɛnbɛtɛnna naxanye a rabilinni nun e bundɔxɔne nun e gbangban seene nun e lutine.<verse eid="NUM 3:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38"/>Musa nun Haruna nun a diine yi e daaxadeni tɔnma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn nan yɛtagi, sogeteden binni. E yi yire sariɲanxin wanle xun matoma a ra Isirayila kaane xa. Xa muxu gbɛtɛ yi a maso yire sariɲanxin na, a yi faxama nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 3:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune birin Musa nun Haruna naxanye tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn ma fata Alatalaa yamarin na, xɛmɛn naxanye barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin.<verse eid="NUM 3:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Dii xɛmɛ singene birin tɛngɛ Isirayila kaane yɛ, naxanye barin bata dangu kike kedenna ra, i yi e xinle sɛbɛ kɛdin ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune so n yii e ɲɔxɔn na e nun e xuruseene Isirayila kaane xuruse dii singene ɲɔxɔn na. Alatala nan n tan na.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42"/>Musa yi Isirayila kaane dii singene birin tɛngɛ, alo Alatala a yamari kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 3:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43"/>Dii xɛmɛ singen naxanye birin barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, ne xinle sɛbɛxin lan muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin kɛmɛ firin tonge solofere e nun saxan nan ma.<verse eid="NUM 3:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45"/>“Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune tongo Isirayila kaane dii singene ɲɔxɔn na e nun e xuruseene Isirayila kaane xuruse dii singene ɲɔxɔn na. Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa findi n gbeen na. Alatala nan n tan na. <verse eid="NUM 3:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46"/>Bayo Isirayila dii singene wuya Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa han muxu kɛmɛ firin tonge solofere e nun saxan, ne xunba daxin na a ra. <verse eid="NUM 3:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47"/>Muxu kedenna xunba gbeti gbanan suulun na, gbeti gbananna naxan nawalima yire sariɲanxini, naxan lanxi garamu fu ma. <verse eid="NUM 3:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48"/>I xa na gbetin so Haruna nun a diine yii dii singene xunba seen na naxanye yi wuyaxi ayi.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49"/>Naxanye mi yi ɲɔxɔ yibiraxi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ra, Musa yi ne xunba gbetin tongo. <verse eid="NUM 3:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50"/>A yi Isirayila dii singene gbetin tongo han gbeti gbanan wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan tonge sennin e nun suulun, gbeti gbananna naxan nawalima yire sariɲanxini. <verse eid="NUM 3:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51"/>Nayi, Musa yi xunba gbetin so Haruna nun a diine yii, alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 3:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna wanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2"/>“Ɛ Kehati xabilan muxune tɛngɛ Lewi yixɛtɛne yɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3"/>Ɛ xɛmɛne tɛngɛ keli ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna ma han ɲɛɛ tonge suulun, naxanye birin nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4"/>“Kehati xabilan muxune xa wanli ito nan kɛ Naralan Bubuni: E xa e yengi lu se sariɲanxi fisamantenne xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5"/>Yamaan na keli sigadeni, Haruna nun a diine xa yɛ masansan dugin ba, e yi a sa Layiri Sereya Kankiraan fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6"/>E yi sube kidi faɲine sa a fari, e mɔn yi dugi mamiloxini bandun ne fan fari. E yi Kankiraan tongo tamine yitɔn. <verse eid="NUM 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7"/>E xa dugi mamiloxi gbɛtɛ sa Buru Rali Tabanla fari, e yi a goronne nun igelengenne nun minse saraxa saseene dɔxɔ na. Buru Ralixin naxanye na waxatin birin, ne xa lu tabanla fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8"/>E xa dugi gbeela so seene birin xunna, e yi sube kidi faɲine so e birin xunna, e mɔn yi tabanla tongo tamine yitɔn. <verse eid="NUM 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9"/>E xa dugi mamiloxin so lɛnpu dɔxɔ seen nun lɛnpune nun e rawali seene nun tɛɛ kɔ seene nun e radɛgɛ turen xun na. <verse eid="NUM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10"/>E xa ne birin mafilin sube kidi faɲi bitinganni, e mɔn yi e sa e xali wudin fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11"/>E xa dugi mamiloxin so saraxa gande xɛma daxin xun na, e yi sube kidi faɲi bitinganna so na fan xun na. E mɔn yi a tongo tamine yitɔn. <verse eid="NUM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12"/>Muranna naxanye birin nawalima yire sariɲanxini e xa ne malan, e yi e raxidi dugi mamiloxini, e yi kidi faɲi bitinganna so e xun na, e yi e sa e xali wudin fari. <verse eid="NUM 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13"/>E xa xuben ba saraxa gande sula daxin fari, e yi dugi mamiloxin so a xun na. <verse eid="NUM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14"/>E xa a saraxa waliseene birin dɔxɔ na fari: xube sa seene, suben tongo seene, xube kɔ seene, e nun wuli xuya goronne. E xa sube kidi faɲi bitinganna so e xun na, e mɔn yi saraxa ganden tongo tamine yitɔn. <verse eid="NUM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15"/>Haruna nun a diine na yelin muranne nun goron sariɲanxine xunna soɛ, yamaan na keli sigadeni, Kehati xabilan muxune xa fa, e yi e xali. Koni e nama e yiin din se sariɲanxine ra, alogo e nama faxa. Kehati xabilan muxune xa na seene xali naxanye Naralan Bubun kui. <verse eid="NUM 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16"/>Saraxarali Harunaa dii Eleyasari xa a yengi lu lɛnpu turen nun wusulanna nun bogise saraxane nun masusan turen xɔn ma. A yi a yengi lu Ala Batu Bubun yiren birin xɔn ma e nun a kui seene nun muran sariɲanxine nun a goronne birin.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18"/>“Ɛ Kehati xabilan muxune ratanga alogo e nama raxɔri Lewi bɔnsɔnna yɛ. <verse eid="NUM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19"/>Ɛ ito nan liga e xa alogo e nama faxa e na e maso se sariɲanxi fisamantenne ra waxatin naxan yi: Haruna nun a diine singe xa so yire sariɲanxini, e yi birin ti a wali ra, e nun a lan a xa naxan xali. <verse eid="NUM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20"/>Koni Kehati xabilan muxune nama so yire sariɲanxini, e se sariɲanxi fisamantenne to, hali ndedi, alogo e nama faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22"/>“Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne fan tɛngɛ, xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23"/>I xa xɛmɛne tɛngɛ keli ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna ma han ɲɛɛ tonge suulun, naxanye nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni. <verse eid="NUM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne xabilane wanle ni i ra e nun e lan e xa goronna naxanye xali: <verse eid="NUM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25"/>E xa Ala Batu Bubun dugine maxali, e nun Naralan Bubuna, a xunna soona, a kidi faɲin naxanye sama a fari, dugin naxanye singanma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, <verse eid="NUM 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26"/>a sansanna dugin naxanye Ala Batu Bubun nun saraxa ganden nabilinni, dugin naxan singanxi a so dɛɛn na, e nun e lutine nun e singan seene birin. <verse eid="NUM 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27"/>Gɛrisɔn xabilan muxune xa wali Haruna nun a diine yamarin bun. E tan nan a falama e xa e lan e xa naxan xali. <verse eid="NUM 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28"/>Gɛrisɔn xabilan muxune wanle nan ne ra Naralan Bubuni. E xa wali saraxarali Harunaa dii Itamaraa yamarin bun.”<verse eid="NUM 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29"/>“I xa Merari bɔnsɔnna muxune tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30"/>I xɛmɛne birin tɛngɛ keli ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna ma han ɲɛɛ tonge suulunna, naxanye nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31"/>“E wanla ni i ra Naralan Bubuni: E xa Ala Batu Bubun bun tiine xali, a gaalane,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">4.31</char> Nde a falama a “galalenne.”</note> a sɛnbɛtɛnne, a bundɔxɔne, <verse eid="NUM 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32"/>sansanna sɛnbɛtɛnne naxan bubun nabilinni, e bundɔxɔne, e gbangban wudine nun e lutine, e nun waliseene birin. Ɛ xa xɛmɛn birin goronna so a yii a naxan xalima. <verse eid="NUM 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33"/>Merari bɔnsɔnna muxune wanle nan ne ra Naralan Bubuni, saraxarali Harunaa dii Itamaraa yamarin bun.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34"/>Musa nun Haruna nun yamaan mangane yi Kehati xabilan muxune tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye birin bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna sɔtɔ han ɲɛɛ tonge suulunna, naxanye birin yi nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni, <verse eid="NUM 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36"/>ne yi tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn ma, e lan muxu wuli firin kɛmɛ solofere tonge suulun nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37"/>Kehati xabila xɛmɛne yatɛn nan na ra, naxanye yi walima Naralan Bubuni. Musa nun Haruna yi e birin tɛngɛ alo Alatala a yamari e ma kii naxan yi fata Musa ra.<verse eid="NUM 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne fan yi tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye birin bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna sɔtɔ han ɲɛɛ tonge suulun, naxanye birin yi nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni, <verse eid="NUM 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40"/>ne yi tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn ma, e lan muxu wuli firin kɛmɛ sennin tonge saxan nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41"/>Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne yatɛn nan na ra, naxanye yi walima Naralan Bubuni. Musa nun Haruna yi e birin tɛngɛ alo Alatala a yamari kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42"/>Merari yixɛtɛne fan yi tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye birin bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna sɔtɔ han ɲɛɛ tonge suulunna, naxanye birin yi nɔɛ wanla kɛ Naralan Bubuni, <verse eid="NUM 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44"/>ne yi tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn ma, e lan muxu wuli saxan kɛmɛ firin nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45"/>Merari yixɛtɛne yatɛn nan na ra. Musa nun Haruna yi e birin tɛngɛ alo Alatala e yamari kii naxan yi fata Musa ra.<verse eid="NUM 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46"/>Musa nun Haruna nun Isirayila mangane yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune birin tɛngɛ xabila yɛɛn nun denbaya yɛɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47"/>Xɛmɛn naxanye birin bata yi ɲɛɛ tonge saxanna sɔtɔ han ɲɛɛ tonge suulun, naxanye birin yi Naralan Bubun wanla kɛma, e mɔn yi a xali, <verse eid="NUM 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48"/>e malanxin lan muxu wuli solomasɛxɛ kɛmɛ suulun tonge solomasɛxɛ nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49"/>E yi e tɛngɛ alo Alatala e yamari kii naxan yi fata Musa ra. Birin yi ti a wanla ra, e nun a lan a xa goronna naxan maxali, alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 4:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Muxu sariɲantarene fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2"/>“Isirayila kaane yamari a e xa na kanna ramini yamaan daaxaden fari ma fure ɲaxin naxan fatin ma hanma faxunna minima muxun naxan bari boden ma hanma naxanye xɔsixi binbin xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3"/>Xa xɛmɛn na a ra hanma ɲaxanla, ɛ xa e ramini yamaan daaxaden fari ma, alogo e nama daaxaden naxɔsi, n luma ɛ tagi dɛnaxan yi.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4"/>Isirayila kaane yi na liga, e yi e ramini yamaan daaxaden fari ma, e yi a liga alo Alatala a fala Musa xa kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kala tixine xa yitɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa xɛmɛna nde hanma ɲaxanla nde hakɛ yo liga muxu gbɛtɛ ra, a bata tinxintareyaan liga Alatala ra. Na kanna bata findi yulubi tongon na. <verse eid="NUM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7"/>Fɔ a xa a ti a hakɛn na nɛn, a yi a se kalaxin ɲɔxɔn naxɛtɛ a kanna ma, a yi a se kalaxin saren yaganna dɔxɔde firin sa a fari. <verse eid="NUM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8"/>Xa se kanna faxa, a bari bode mi na naxan na gbetin nasuxɛ, na seen lan a xɛtɛ Alatala ma, a so saraxaraliin yii, sa kontonna fari Ala solona seen na a xa. <verse eid="NUM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9"/>Isirayila kaane fama saraxa sariɲanxin naxanye ra, saraxaraliin nan gbee ne ra. <verse eid="NUM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10"/>Muxun na naxan nasariɲan, a na ligaxi a yɛtɛ nan xa. Muxun na naxan so saraxaraliin yii, na luma a tan nan yii.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sariyana lan xɔxɔlɔnna ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12"/>a xa ito fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa xɛmɛna nde a ɲaxanla mi tinxin, a a xɛmɛn yanfa, <verse eid="NUM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13"/>e nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ yi kafu, xa a xɛmɛn mi a to, ɲaxanla yi a yɛtɛ raxɔsi wundoni, koni xa a li sere mi na, a mi suxu na feen xun na, <verse eid="NUM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14"/>xa xɔxɔlɔn xaxinla so na xɛmɛni, a sikɛ a ɲaxanla ma, xa a li a xɔsixi hanma a mi a ligaxi, <verse eid="NUM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15"/>nayi, na xɛmɛn xa a ɲaxanla xali saraxaraliin fɛma. A xa murutu fuɲin kilo saxan xali bogise saraxan na. A nama ture sa na murutuni, a nama wusulan sa a fari, amasɔtɔ xɔxɔlɔnna bogise saraxan na a ra. Marabira seen na a ra hakɛ tongoxin ma. <verse eid="NUM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16"/>Saraxaraliin xa ɲaxanla maso, alogo a xa ti Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17"/>A xa ige rasariɲanxin tongo fɛɲɛna nde kui, a yi Ala Batu Bubun burunburunna sa a yi. <verse eid="NUM 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18"/>Ɲaxanla naxan tima Alatala yɛtagi, a xa na labaranna ba, a yi bogise saraxan so a yii ɲɔxɔ lu seen na a hakɛn xɔn xɔxɔlɔnna bogise saraxan na. Saraxaraliin xa na ige lɔxɔn suxu a yii, naxan fama dangan na. <verse eid="NUM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19"/>A xa ɲaxanla rakɔlɔ, a naxa, ‘Xa ɛ nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ mi kafuxi, i mi i ya xɛmɛn yanfaxi, i mi xɔsi fe rabaxi xabu i dɔxɔ xɛmɛ taa ra, i xa ratanga dangani ito ma ige lɔxɔni ito fama naxan na. <verse eid="NUM 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20"/>Koni xa i bata i ya xɛmɛn yanfa, i yi i yɛtɛ raxɔsi, xa ɛ nun xɛmɛ gbɛtɛ bata kafu xabu i dɔxɔ xɛmɛ taa ra,’ <verse eid="NUM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21"/>nayi, saraxaraliin xa ɲaxanla rakɔlɔ dangani ito ra, ‘Alatala xa a liga, i doyen, i kuiin yi mate i ra, yamaan yi i danga, e yi i mafala. <verse eid="NUM 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22"/>Igeni ito naxan fama dangan na, na xa so i fatini, a yi i kuiin mate i ra, i yi doyen.’ Ɲaxanla xa a ratin, a naxa, ‘Amina, amina!’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23"/>“Saraxaraliin xa dangani itoe sɛbɛ walaxana nde ma, a yi e xa ige yilɔxin na. <verse eid="NUM 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24"/>A xa ige xɔlɛn so ɲaxanla yii naxan fama dangan na, a a min, alogo a xa so a fatin xɔn, a xɔlɔ ayi. <verse eid="NUM 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25"/>Saraxaraliin xa xɔxɔlɔnna bogise saraxan tongo ɲaxanla yii, a a yita Alatala ra a yii, a yi a xali saraxa ganden dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26"/>A xa a yiin yɛ keden ba a ra, ɲɔxɔ lu seen na Ala xɔn, a yi a sa tɛɛni saraxa ganden fari. Na xanbi ra, ɲaxanla yi igen min. <verse eid="NUM 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27"/>Xa a bata a yɛtɛ xɔsi, a a xɛmɛn yanfa, a na igen min naxan fama dangan na, na a tɔrɔma nɛn, a a kuiin mate a ra, a yi doyen. Na ɲaxanla findima nɛn danga muxun na yamaan tagi. <verse eid="NUM 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28"/>Koni, xa na ɲaxanla mi a yɛtɛ xɔsixi, a sariɲan, fefe mi a sɔtɔma, a mɔn nɔɛ diine barɛ nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29"/>Xɔxɔlɔnna sariyan nan na ra ɲaxanla xa naxan bata a xɛmɛn yanfa, a a yɛtɛ xɔsi, <verse eid="NUM 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30"/>hanma xɔxɔlɔn xaxinla na so xɛmɛn naxan yi, a na sogin a ɲaxanla ma. A xa ti Alatala yɛtagi, saraxaraliin yi sariya sɛbɛxini itoe birin nakamali a ma. <verse eid="NUM 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31"/>Xɛmɛn mi hakɛ yo tongoxi, koni ɲaxanla a hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Nasiri dɛ ti fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa xɛmɛna nde hanma ɲaxanla nde a dɛ ti, a a xa lu Alatalaa wanla ra Nasiri muxun na, <verse eid="NUM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3"/>na kanna xa a mɛ dɔlɔn na e nun na minse sifane, hali manpa muluxunxina. A nama minse yo min naxan nafalaxi manpa bogin na, a nama manpa bogi xinden hanma a xaraxin don. <verse eid="NUM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4"/>A nɛma a Nasiri dɛ tiin nakamalima, a nama sese don naxan kelixi manpa binle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wudi binla nde na yi, mɛn kaane naxanye sima, e yi naxanye bogi yitɔnma alo manpana e gbee kiini.</char></note> yi, hali a xɔnne hanma a dagina. <verse eid="NUM 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5"/>A nɛma a Nasiri dɛ tiin nakamalima, biden nama a xunna li. A xa lu Alatalaa wanla ra han na waxati falaxin yi kamali. A xa sariɲan, a xa a xunsɛxɛn lu kuyɛ ayi. <verse eid="NUM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6"/>A nɛma Alatalaa wanla ra, a nama a maso binbin na. <verse eid="NUM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7"/>Hali a baba hanma a nga hanma a ngaxakedenna nde faxa, a nama a yɛtɛ xɔsi, a so binbin xun ma. Amasɔtɔ a xunsɛxɛn findixi taxamasenna nan na, a a tan bata lu Alaa wanla ra. <verse eid="NUM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8"/>A nɛma Alaa wanla ra waxatin naxan birin yi, a sariɲan Alatala yɛtagi.”<verse eid="NUM 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9"/>“Xa muxuna nde faxa a fɛma, a xunsɛxɛ ralixin bata raharamu. A xa a xunna bi a rasariɲan lɔxɔni, xii soloferede lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10"/>Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, a xa ganba firin hanma kolokonde dii firin xali saraxaraliin fɛma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11"/>Saraxaraliin xa keden faxa yulubi xafari saraxan na, bonna saraxa gan daxin na, a Ala solona a xa. Amasɔtɔ a bata lu binbin fɛma. Na lɔxɔni, a mɔn xa a xunna rasariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12"/>Nayi, na kanna mɔn xa a dɛ ti waxatin dɛ suxu, a yi kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna ba yangin saraxan na Alatala xa. Waxatin naxan bata yi dangu, na mi a kui, amasɔtɔ a xɔsi nɛn benun a dɛ tiin xa kamali.”<verse eid="NUM 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13"/>“Sariyan ni ito ra Nasiri dɛ tiin ma. A waxati saxin na kamali, e xa fa a ra Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14"/>A xa fa kiseni itoe ra Alatala yɛtagi: kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna fɛ mi naxan na saraxa gan daxin na, yɛxɛɛ gilɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna fɛ mi naxan na yulubi xafari saraxan na, e nun konton keden fɛ mi naxan na bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15"/>A mɔn yi fa na saraxane bogise nun minse saraxane ra e nun burun sangatanna yɛ keden buru rate seen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">6.15</char> <char style="fk">burun nate sena:</char> Lɛbɛnna na a ra naxan burun nagboma ayi. </note> mi naxan yi, e nun buru xunne naxan nafalaxi murutu fuɲi faɲin na naxan basanxi turen na, e nun buru yilɛnlɛnxine turen saxi naxanye ma. <verse eid="NUM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16"/>Saraxaraliin xa ne yita Alatala ra, a yi yulubi xafari saraxan ba e nun saraxa gan daxina. <verse eid="NUM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17"/>A mɔn xa kontonna ba bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na Alatala xa, e nun buru ratetaren naxanye sangatanna kui e nun bogise saraxane nun minse saraxane. <verse eid="NUM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18"/>Na waxatini, Nasiri muxun xa a xunna bi Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na bayo a bata yi a xunna fi Ala ma. A yi a xun sɛxɛne sa tɛɛni naxan bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan bun. <verse eid="NUM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19"/>Nasiri muxun na a xunna bi, saraxaraliin xa kontonna balaxa ɲinxin so a yii, e nun buru xun keden nun burudi keden keli sangatanna kui, buru rate se mi naxanye yi. <verse eid="NUM 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20"/>Saraxaraliin xa e yita Alatala ra se ralixin na. E sariɲan. Saraxaraliin nan gbee e ra, sa danban nun a kanken fari naxanye daxa e yita Ala ra. Na xanbi ra, Nasiri muxun nɔɛ manpaan minɲɛ nɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21"/>“Sariyan nan na ra lan Nasiri muxuna kiseen ma bayo a bata a dɛ ti a a xa lu Alatalaa wanla ra. Xa fɛrɛna a xa, a mɔn nɔɛ nde sɛ a fari. A xa a dɛ tiin nakamali alo Nasiri muxuna sariyana a falaxi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraliin dubana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23"/>a a xa a fala Haruna nun a diine xa, a e xa duba Isirayila kaane xa ikimaan na:<verse eid="NUM 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24"/>Alatala xa i baraka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:24">a i kantan!<verse eid="NUM 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25"/>Alatala nɔrɔn xa godo i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:25">a kininkinin i ma!<verse eid="NUM 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26"/>Alatala xa a yengi dɔxɔ i xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:26">a bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi i ma!<verse eid="NUM 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27"/>E na duba Isirayila kaane xa n xinli, n tan e barakama nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila mangane kiseene fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1"/>Musa yelin Ala Batu Bubun tiyɛ lɔxɔn naxan yi, a yi a masusan turen na a rasariɲan xinla ma e nun a muranne birin. A mɔn yi saraxa ganden nun a goronne masusan, a e rasariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2"/>Nayi, Isirayila mangane yi fa kiseene ra. Denbaya xunne nan yi ne ra naxanye yamaan tɛngɛ, bɔnsɔn mangane. <verse eid="NUM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3"/>E yi fa e kiseene ra Alatala yɛtagi: Wontoro xunna soxin sennin e nun ɲinge fu nun firin. Manga firin, wontoro keden, manga keden ɲinge keden. E yi fa ne ra Ala Batu Bubun yɛtagi.<verse eid="NUM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5"/>“Kiseene rasuxu e yii alogo e xa Naralan Bubun wanla kɛ. E xa yitaxun Lewi bɔnsɔnna ra, naxan lanɲɛ e wanle ma.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6"/>Nayi, Musa yi wontorone nun ɲingene rasuxu, a yi e yitaxun Lewi bɔnsɔnna ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7"/>A yi ɲinge naanin nun wontoro firin so Gɛrisɔn xabilan yii, alogo e wanla xa sɔnɔya. <verse eid="NUM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8"/>A yi ɲinge solomasɛxɛ nun wontoro naanin so Merari xabilan yii, alogo e wanla xa sɔnɔya. E birin yi walima Itamaraa yamarin bun, saraxarali Harunaa diina. <verse eid="NUM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9"/>Koni, a mi se so Kehati xabilan yii, amasɔtɔ e yi tixi se sariɲanxi fisamantenne maxanla nan na, naxanye tongoma tungunna ma.<verse eid="NUM 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10"/>Saraxa ganden masusan lɔxɔn naxan yi turen na alogo a wanla xa fɔlɔ, mangane yi e kiseene xali saraxa ganden yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ manga keden xa fa a kiseene ra, alogo wanla xa fɔlɔ saraxa ganden yɛtagi.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12"/>Aminadabo a dii Naxason yi fa Yuda bɔnsɔnna kiseene ra xii singe lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan binyen yi lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan binyen lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Aminadabo a dii Naxason ma kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18"/>Suwari a dii Natanɛli, Isakari bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii firinde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Suwari a dii Natanɛli a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24"/>Xelɔn ma dii Eliyabi, Sabulon bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii saxande lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Xelɔn ma dii Eliyabi a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30"/>Sedewuri a dii Elisuri, Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii naaninde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Sedewuri a dii Elisuri a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36"/>Surisadayi a dii Selumiyɛli, Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii suulunde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Surisadayi a dii Selumiyɛli a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42"/>Dewuyɛli a dii Eliyasafi, Gadi bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii senninde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Dewuyɛli a dii Eliyasafi a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48"/>Amixudi a dii Elisama, Efirami bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii soloferede lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Amixudi a dii Elisama kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54"/>Pedasuri a dii Gamaliyɛli, Manase bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Pedasuri a dii Gamaliyɛli a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60"/>Gidewoni a dii Abidan, Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii solomanaaninde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Gidewoni a dii Abidan ma kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66"/>Amisadayi a dii Axiyeseri, Dan bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii fude lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Amisadayi a dii Axiyeseri a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72"/>Okiran ma dii Pagiyɛli, Aseri bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii fu nun kedende lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:75"/><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:76"/><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Okiran ma dii Pagiyɛli a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:77"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78"/>Enan ma dii Axira, Nafatali bɔnsɔnna mangana, na yi fa a kiseene ra xii fu nun firinde lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 7:78"/><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79"/>A kiseene ni i ra: goronna gbeti daxin keden naxan lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ solofere ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan, e birin nafexi murutu fuɲin na naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:79"/><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80"/>xɛma goronna naxan lanxi garamu kɛmɛ ma, a rafexi wusulanna ra, <verse eid="NUM 7:80"/><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81"/>tura bulan keden e nun konton keden nun kontonna ɲɛɛ kedenna saraxa gan daxin na, <verse eid="NUM 7:81"/><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82"/>kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 7:82"/><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83"/>ɲinge firin e nun konton suulun nun kɔtɔ suulun, e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna suulun, bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na. Ne nan findi Enan ma dii Axira a kiseene ra.<verse eid="NUM 7:83"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84"/>Isirayila denbaya xunne birin ma kiseene ni i ra, e naxanye fi saraxa ganden masusan lɔxɔni alogo a wanla xa fɔlɔ: goronna gbeti daxin fu nun firin, wuli xuya goronna gbeti daxin fu nun firin, xɛma goronna fu nun firin. <verse eid="NUM 7:84"/><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85"/>Goronna gbeti daxin keden kedenne birin yi lanxi garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ saxan ma, wuli xuya goronne fan, garamu kɛmɛ solofere. Na seene birin malanxin lanxi gbeti kilo mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan ma naxan nun yire sariɲanxin liga seen binyen lan. <verse eid="NUM 7:85"/><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86"/>Goronna xɛma daxin keden kedenne birin yi lanxi garamu kɛmɛ nan ma. E fu nun firinne malanxina, garamu wuli keden kɛmɛ firin. E yi rafexi wusulanna ra. <verse eid="NUM 7:86"/><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87"/>E fa xuruseen naxanye ra saraxa gan daxin na: tura bulan fu nun firin, konton fu nun firin, yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna fu nun firin, e nun e bogise saraxane. E yi fa kɔtɔ fu nun firin na yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 7:87"/><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88"/>E fa xuruseen naxanye ra bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxan na: tura mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin, konton tonge sennin, kɔtɔ tonge sennin e nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna tonge sennin. Ne nan findi kiseene ra alogo saraxa ganden wanla xa fɔlɔ a masusan xanbini.<verse eid="NUM 7:88"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89"/>Musa nɛma yi soɛ Naralan Bubuni falatideni Ala xa, a yi Ala xuiin mɛma maleka gubugubu kan sawura firinne nan longori ra Layiri Sereya Kankiraan dɛraganla xun ma, Ala solonadena. A yi falan tima a xa.<verse eid="NUM 7:89"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Lɛnpune dɔxɔsena fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2"/>a xa a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “I na lɛnpu soloferene dɔxɔ waxatin naxan yi, e lan e yi lɛnpu dɔxɔ seen yɛtagini yalan.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3"/>Haruna yi na liga. A lɛnpune dɔxɔ alogo e xa e dɔxɔ seen yɛtagini yalan alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4"/>Lɛnpune dɔxɔ seen yi rafalaxi xɛma bɔnbɔxin nan na, keli a sanna ma han a fuge sawurane, alo Alatala a yita Musa ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune rasariɲanna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6"/>“Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ba Isirayila kaan bonne yɛ, i yi e rasariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7"/>I xa e rasariɲan ikiini: I xa marasariɲan igen xuya e ma, na xanbi ra e xa e fati ma xabene birin bi, e yi e dugine xa, alogo e xa sariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8"/>E xa tura bulan keden tongo, e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na a bogise saraxan na, i yi tura bulan gbɛtɛ tongo yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9"/>I yi Isirayila yamaan birin malan, i yi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xili Naralan Bubun yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10"/>I xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune maso Alatala yɛtagi, Isirayila kaane yi e yiine sa e fari. <verse eid="NUM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11"/>Haruna xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yita Alatala ra se ralixin na Isirayila kaane tagi alogo e xa Alatala wanla fɔlɔ. <verse eid="NUM 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12"/>Na xanbi ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa e yiine sa tura firinna xunne fari. Na keden xa ba Alatala xa yulubi xafari saraxan na, bonna saraxa gan daxin na, Ala solona seen na Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa. <verse eid="NUM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13"/>I xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ti Haruna nun a diine yɛtagi, e yi e yita Alatala ra se ralixin na. <verse eid="NUM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14"/>Na kiini, i xa Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ba Isirayila kaan bonne tagi, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi findi n gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15"/>I na Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune rasariɲan i yi e yita n na se ralixin na, e xa fa e wanle kɛ Naralan Bubuni. <verse eid="NUM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16"/>Amasɔtɔ e bata findi n gbeen na mumɛ! N bata e tongo n gbeen na Isirayila dii xɛmɛ singene birin ɲɔxɔn na. <verse eid="NUM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17"/>Amasɔtɔ n gbeen nan Isirayila dii xɛmɛ singene birin na, a muxune nun a subene. Xabu n Misiran yamanan dii singene faxa lɔxɔni, n bata Isirayila dii singene ramara n yɛtɛ xa. <verse eid="NUM 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18"/>Koni n Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan tongoxi alogo e xa Isirayila dii xɛmɛ singene ɲɔxɔ yibira. <verse eid="NUM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19"/>N ne nan soma Haruna nun a diine yii Isirayila kaane tagi, alogo e xa Naralan Bubun wanle kɛ Isirayila kaane xa, e yi Ala solona e xa. Nayi, fitina fe mi Isirayila kaane sɔtɔma, e na e maso yire sariɲanxin na.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20"/>Musa nun Haruna nun Isirayila yamaan birin yi na liga Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi e yɛtɛ rasariɲan, e e dugine xa. Haruna yi e yita Alatala ra se ralixin na, a yi Ala solona e xa alogo e xa sariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22"/>Na xanbi ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yi fa e wanla fɔlɔ Naralan Bubuni, Haruna nun a diine yamarin bun. E yi a liga Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24"/>“Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune luma ikiini: Xɛmɛn naxanye barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun suulunna ra, ne xa fa walideni Naralan Bubuni. <verse eid="NUM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25"/>Koni, e na ɲɛɛ tonge suulunna sɔtɔ siimayaan na, e xa wanla dan. <verse eid="NUM 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26"/>E nɔɛ e ngaxakedenne maliyɛ nɛn walideni Naralan Bubuni, koni e yɛtɛɛn nama a wanla kɛ. I xa wanle taxu Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ra na kiini.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1"/>Alatala yi falan ti Musa xa Sinayi tonbonni, e minin ɲɛɛn firinden kike singeni Misiran yamanani. A yi a fala, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2"/>“Isirayila kaane xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba a waxatini. <verse eid="NUM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3"/>Ɛ xa a liga kikeni ito xii fu nun naaninde lɔxɔn ɲinbanna ra, alo a fe yamarine nun a sariyane kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4"/>Musa yi na rali Isirayila kaane ma, a e xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba. <verse eid="NUM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5"/>E yi na liga kike singen xii fu nun naaninde ɲinbanna ra, Sinayi tonbonni. E yi a birin liga alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6"/>Koni, muxuna nde yi na naxanye bata yi e yiin din binbin na. E yi xɔsixi na lɔxɔni, e mi yi nɔɛ Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla rabɛ. E yi siga Musa nun Haruna fɛma, <verse eid="NUM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7"/>e yi a fala Musa xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata xɔsi binbin xɔn. Koni, nanfera nxu mi nɔɛ nxɔ saraxane bɛ Alatala xa alo Isirayila kaan bonne a waxatini?” <verse eid="NUM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8"/>Musa yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ diɲa han n xa a kolon Alatala naxan yamarima ɛ fe yi.” <verse eid="NUM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ tan nde hanma ɛ yixɛtɛna nde xɔsixi binbin xɔn, hanma xa e sa sigatini, a mɔn nɔɛ Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla rabɛ nɛn Alatala xa. <verse eid="NUM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11"/>E xa sanla raba kike firinden xii fu nun naaninde lɔxɔn ɲinbanna ra. E yɛxɛɛ diin don e nun buru ratetarene nun ɲɔxɔnde xɔlɛne. <verse eid="NUM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12"/>E nama sese lu han xɔtɔnni, e nama a xɔnne yigira. E na Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba, e xa a yamarine birin suxu. <verse eid="NUM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13"/>Koni xa muxuna nde tondi Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla rabɛ a waxatini, anu a mi xɔsixi, a mi sigatini, a kedima nɛn Isirayila yamani, a to mi saraxan baxi Alatala xa a waxatini. Na kanna a yulubin goronna tongoma nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14"/>Xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi ɛ tagi, xa ne wa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba feni Alatala xa, e lan e yi a sariyane nun a yamarine suxu. Sariyane lan birin xa, Isirayila kaan nun xɔɲɛna.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alatala nɔrɔna</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 40.34-38</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15"/>Ala Batu Bubun ti lɔxɔn naxan yi, Layiri Sereya Bubuna, kundaan yi so a xun na. Keli ɲinbanna ma han xɔtɔnni, na kundaan yi dɛgɛma nɛn alo tɛɛna. <verse eid="NUM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16"/>Kundaan yi lu a xun ma, koni kɔɛɛn na, a yi lu alo tɛɛna. <verse eid="NUM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17"/>Na kundaan na yi ba bubun xun ma waxati yo yi, Isirayila kaane yi kelima nɛn sigadeni. Kundaan na ti dɛnaxan yi, Isirayila kaane yi e daaxadeni tɔn mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18"/>Isirayila kaane yi sigama Alatalaa yamarin nan ma, e mɔn yi e daaxadeni tɔnma Alatalaa yamarin nan ma. Fanni kundaan yi Ala Batu Bubun xun ma, e yi luma daaxadeni nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19"/>Xa kundaan yi lu Ala Batu Bubun xun ma waxati xunkuye, Isirayila kaane yi Alatalaa yamarin suxuma nɛn. E mi yi sigama. <verse eid="NUM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20"/>Waxatina nde, kundaan yi luma nɛn Ala Batu Bubun xun ma xii dando. E yi luma daaxadeni Alatalaa yamarin nan ma, e yi sigama a yamarin nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21"/>Waxatina nde kundaan yi luma nɛn yire kedenni keli ɲinbanna ma han na xɔtɔn bode, koni a na yi ba xɔtɔnni tun, e yi sigama nɛn. Kɔɛɛn nun yanyina, kundaan na yi ba, e fan yi kelima nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22"/>Xa a lu Ala batu bubun xun ma xii firin hanma kike keden, hanma ɲɛɛ keden, Isirayila kaane yi luma nɛn daaxadeni. E mi sigɛ mumɛ, fɔ a na ba waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23"/>Isirayila kaane yi daaxama hanma e yi kelima daaxadeni Alatalaa yamarin nan ma. E yi Alatalaa yamarine suxuma, a naxanye fi e ma fata Musa ra.<verse eid="NUM 9:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10"/>
  <para style="s">Gbeti Xɔtane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2"/>“Xɔta firin nafala gbeti bɔnbɔxin na yamaan xili sena malanni e nun yamaan nakeli sena sigadeni. <verse eid="NUM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3"/>Na xɔta firinne na fe waxatin naxan yi, yamaan birin xa e malan i fɛma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4"/>Xa xɔta keden nan fe, mangane nan gbansan xa e malan i fɛma, Isirayila xabila xunne. <verse eid="NUM 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5"/>Xa xɔtaan bata fe, bɔnsɔnna naxanye dɔxi Naralan Bubun sogetedeni, ne xa keli sigadeni. <verse eid="NUM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6"/>Xɔtaan na fe a firindeni, naxanye dɔxi yamaan daaxaden yiifari fɔxɔni, ne xa keli sigadeni. Xɔta xuiin nan yamaan nakelima sigadeni. <verse eid="NUM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7"/>Xɔtaan xa fe kii gbɛtɛ yi alogo yamaan xa e malan.”<verse eid="NUM 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8"/>“Saraxarali Harunaa diine nan lan e xɔtaan fe. Habadan sariyan nan na ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa.”<verse eid="NUM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9"/>“Ɛ na keli ɛ yaxune yɛngɛdeni naxanye ɛ ɲaxankatama ɛ yamanani, ɛ xa xɔtane fe. Alatala a yengi luma nɛn ɛ xɔn ma, ɛ Ala, a yi ɛ rakisi ɛ yaxune ma. <verse eid="NUM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10"/>Ɛ xa xɔtaan fe ɲaxaɲaxa waxatine nun sali lɔxɔne nun kike nɛnɛ sanle birin yi, ɛ nɛma saraxa gan daxine nun bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane bɛ waxatin naxan yi. N yi n yengi lu ɛ xɔn. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">E yi keli Sinayi tonbonni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11"/>Kike firinden xii mɔxɔɲɛdeni, e minin ɲɛɛ firindeni Misiran bɔxɔni, kundaan yi ba Layiri Sereya Bubun xun ma. <verse eid="NUM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12"/>Isirayila kaane yi kiraan suxu, e keli Sinayi tonbonni. Kundaan yi siga han a sa ti Paran tonbonni. <verse eid="NUM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13"/>E keli singen nan yi na ra Alatalaa yamarin ma fata Musa ra. <verse eid="NUM 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna ganle nan singe kiraan suxu, e taxamasenna bun. E ganle yi Aminadabo a dii Naxason ma yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15"/>Isakari bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Suwari a dii Natanɛli a yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16"/>Sabulon bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Xelɔn ma dii Eliyabi a yamarin nan bun.<verse eid="NUM 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17"/>Ala Batu Bubun yi wayan, Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne nun Merari yixɛtɛne yi a xali e yii. <verse eid="NUM 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18"/>Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna ganle yi siga e taxamasenna bun Sedewuri a dii Elisuri a yamarin bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Surisadayi a dii Selumiyɛli a yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Dewuyɛli a dii Eliyasafi a yamarin nan bun.<verse eid="NUM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21"/>Kehati xabilan muxune yi siga se sariɲanxine xalɛ Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxun bonne fɔxɔ ra alogo e xa Ala Batu Bubun ti benun se sariɲanxine xa yamaan daaxaden li. <verse eid="NUM 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnna ganle yi siga e taxamasenna bun Amixudi a dii Elisama yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23"/>Manase bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Pedasuri a dii Gamaliyɛli a yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Gidewoni a dii Abidan ma yamarin nan bun.<verse eid="NUM 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25"/>Dɔnxɛn na, Dan bɔnsɔnna ganle yi siga ganla bonne fɔxɔ rakantanɲɛ e taxamasenna bun, Amisadayi a dii Axiyeseri a yamarin bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26"/>Aseri bɔnsɔnna ganle yi Okiran ma dii Pagiyɛli a yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27"/>Nafatali bɔnsɔnna ganla yi Enan ma dii Axira yamarin nan bun. <verse eid="NUM 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28"/>Isirayila ganle yi yɛbama na kii nin sigatini.<verse eid="NUM 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29"/>Musa yi a fala Reyuli a dii Xobabi xa, Midiyan kaana, Musa bitanna, a naxa, “Nxu sigan yireni Alatala naxan fixi nxu ma. Fa nxu fɔxɔ ra, nxu fe faɲin ligɛ i xa, amasɔtɔ Alatala bata fe faɲine ragidi Isirayila ma.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30"/>Hobabi yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn. N xɛtɛma n konna nin n ma yamaan dɛnaxan yi.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31"/>Musa mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “Yandi, i nama keli nxu fɛma. I daaxade faɲine kolon tonbonni. I luyɛ alo nxu yɛɛna. <verse eid="NUM 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32"/>Xa i nxu mati, en birin nan Alatalaa se faɲine sɔtɔma.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33"/>Isirayila kaane yi keli Alatalaa geyani, e sigan ti xii saxan. Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan yi tixi e yɛɛ ra alogo a xa matabu yirena nde fen e xa. <verse eid="NUM 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34"/>Alatalaa kundaan yi e xun ma yanyin na, e to yi kelima daaxadeni.<verse eid="NUM 10:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35"/>Layiri Kankiraan na yi keli sigadeni waxati yo yi, Musa yi a falama nɛn, a naxa, “Alatala, keli, i xa i yaxune raxuya ayi, i raɲaxu muxune yi e gi i yɛɛ ra!” <verse eid="NUM 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36"/>Layiri Kankiraan yi tima waxatin naxan yi, Musa yi a falama nɛn, a naxa, “Alatala, fa Isirayila kaa wuli wuli wuyaxine tagi!”<verse eid="NUM 10:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Alatalaa tɛɛna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1"/>Lɔxɔna nde yamaan yi lu e mawugɛ e tɔrɔne fe ra. Alatala to na mɛ, a yi xɔlɔ, a yi tɛɛn nafa e tagi naxan yamaan daaxaden dɛ kinkina ndee gan. <verse eid="NUM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2"/>Yamaan yi sɔnxɔ Musa ra. Musa yi Alatala maxandi, tɛɛn yi tu. <verse eid="NUM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3"/>E yi mɛnna xili sa Tabɛra,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.3</char> <char style="fk">Tabɛra</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Tɛɛna.”</note> amasɔtɔ Alatalaa tɛɛn nagodo nɛn mɛnni.<verse eid="NUM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔɔyin yi yamaan suxu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4"/>Lɔxɔna nde xɔɔyin yi muxu kobine suxu yamaan yɛ. Isirayila kaane yɛtɛɛn yi lu wugɛ, e naxa, “En suben don daxin sɔtɛ di? <verse eid="NUM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5"/>Nxu nxu mirima yɛxɛne ma nxu naxanye don Misiran yi naxanye sare mi yi fima e nun kɔkunbane nun ɲanle nun sabi dɛɛne nun yabane nun sabi gbɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6"/>Iki nxu niin bata yiɲaxu nxu ma, donse yo mi toma fɔ Manna donseni ito!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.6</char> <char style="fk">Manna donsena</char> a fe mato Xɔrɔyaan 16.13-15 nun 16.31 kui.</note><verse eid="NUM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7"/>Manna donseen yi luxi alo se xɔri xunxurin naxanye yɛɛ rafixa alo wudi igena. <verse eid="NUM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8"/>Yamaan yi minima na nan makɔdeyi, e yi a kunba gɛmɛn ma hanma e a din wunla kui. Na xanbi ra, e mɔn yi nɔɛ a ɲinɲɛ nɛn hanma e yi a gan burudine ra. A yi ɲaxun alo burun naxan gilinxi turen na. <verse eid="NUM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9"/>Manna donseen yi godoma kɔɛɛn nan na xiila godo waxatini.<verse eid="NUM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10"/>Musa yi Isirayila kaane mawuga xuiin mɛ, e yi malanxi denbaya yɛɛn ma e bubune so dɛɛne ra. Alatala yi xɔlɔ han! Musa fan yi kɔntɔfili, <verse eid="NUM 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11"/>a yi a fala Alatala xa, a naxa, “I n tɔrɔma nanfera? Nanfera n mi fa rafan i ma? Nanfera i yamani ito goronna dɔxi n tan xun ma? <verse eid="NUM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12"/>N tan nan fudi tongoxi yamani ito ra ba? N tan nan e barixi ba? Nanfera i naxa a n xa itoe banba alo dii ngana, han na yamanani i bata e benbane tuli sa naxan na? <verse eid="NUM 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13"/>N suben sɔtɔn minɛn yi yamani ito birin xa? E wugama n fɔxɔ ra, e naxa, ‘Suben so nxu yii!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14"/>N kedenna mi nɔɛ yamani ito goronna tongɛ. A gbo n ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15"/>Benun i xa ito liga n na, n faxa keden na! Xa n nafan i ma, i nama tin n xa n ma tɔrɔn to.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16"/>Alatala yi Musa yabi, a naxa, “Isirayila fonna muxu tonge solofere malan, i naxanye kolon Isirayila yamaan fonne nun kuntigine ra. I fa e ra Naralan Bubuni, alogo e xa ti i dɛxɔn mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17"/>N godoma nɛn i fɛma mɛnni n falan ti i xa. N na n ma Nii Sariɲanxina ndedi bama nɛn i yi, n yi a sa e yi. Nayi, e nɔɛ i maliyɛ nɛn yamani ito goronna tongodeni alogo i kedenna nama fa a tongo. <verse eid="NUM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18"/>I xa a fala yamaan xa, i naxa, ‘Ɛ ɛ yɛtɛ rasariɲan tilaa fe ra ɛ suben donma waxatin naxan yi. Alatala bata ɛ mawuga xuine mɛ ɛ to a fala, ɛ naxa, “En suben sɔtɔma di? Misiran yamanan nan fisa!” Iki, Alatala suben soma nɛn ɛ yii. Ɛ fan a donma nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19"/>Ɛ mi lɔxɔ keden hanma firin daxin sɔtɛ, hali xi suulun, xii fu, hanma xii mɔxɔɲɛ, <verse eid="NUM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20"/>koni ɛ suben donma nɛn kike keden, han a mini ɛ ɲɔɛni, a raɲaxu ɛ ma. Amasɔtɔ ɛ bata ɛ mɛ Alatala ra naxan ɛ tagi, ɛ to wuga a yɛtagi, ɛ naxa: Nanfera nxu minixi Misiran yi?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21"/>Musa yi a fala, a naxa, “N tan be xɛmɛ wuli kɛmɛ sennin tagi naxanye sigatini e sanni, anu, i a falama, a i suben soma e yii nɛn kike keden! <verse eid="NUM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22"/>Xa nxu yɛxɛɛn nun siin nun ɲinge kurune birin faxa, ne a liyɛ ba? Xa nxu baan yɛxɛne birin suxu, ne a liyɛ ba?” <verse eid="NUM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23"/>Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “N sɛnbɛn go, na mi a liyɛ? I fama a todeni n naxan falaxi xa a ligɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin nun fonne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24"/>Musa yi mini, a yi a fala yamaan xa Alatala naxan falaxi. A yi Isirayila fonna muxu tonge solofere malan Naralan Bubun nabilinni. <verse eid="NUM 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25"/>Alatala yi godo kundaan yiyani, e nun Musa yi falan ti. A yi a Nii Sariɲanxina ndedi ba Musa yi, a yi a ragodo fori tonge soloferene ma. Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin to godo e ma, e yi waliyiya falane ti fɔlɔ, koni e mi yanfan.<verse eid="NUM 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26"/>Muxu firin, Elidadi nun Medadi, ne yi daaxadeni. E yi yatɛxi fonne ra, koni e mi siga Ala Batu Bubuni. Koni, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi godo e fan ma, e yi waliyiya falane ti fɔlɔ daaxadeni. <verse eid="NUM 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27"/>Banxulanna nde yi siga, a a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Elidadi nun Medadi nabiya falane tima daaxadeni!” <verse eid="NUM 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28"/>Nunu a dii Yosuwe naxan yi Musa malima xabu a dii ɲɔrɛyani, na yi a xuini te, a naxa, “Musa, n kanna, e rati!” <verse eid="NUM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29"/>Musa yi a yabi, a naxa, “I e maxɔxɔlɔnma n xa nɛn ba? Alatala xa yamaan birin findi nabine ra! Ala xa a Nii Sariɲanxin nagodo e birin ma!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30"/>Nayi, Musa nun Isirayila fonne yi siga daaxadeni.<verse eid="NUM 11:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dɔmɛne fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31"/>Alatala yi foyen nafa keli baani, naxan fa dɔmɛne ra daaxadeni. E yi godo e sa e bode fari e mate ayi han nɔngɔnna yɛ firin, e siga sɛ daaxaden nabilinni han yanyi keden sigati. <verse eid="NUM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32"/>Yamaan yi fɛriɲɛn e suxɛ, e xi e suxɛ. Na xɔtɔn bode e mɔn yi fɛriɲɛn dɔmɛne suxɛ han birin yi e suxu han kilo wuli keden. E yi e sa daaxaden nabilinni alogo e xa xara. <verse eid="NUM 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33"/>Koni suben mɔn yi Isirayila kaane dɛ, benun e xa a ragerun, Alatala yi xɔlɔ e ma, a yi fitina furen nagodo e ma. <verse eid="NUM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34"/>Nanara, e yi mɛnna xili sa Kibiroti-Hatawa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">11.34</char> <char style="fk">Kibiroti-Hatawa</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Xɔɔyidene gaburuna.”</note> Amasɔtɔ xɔɔyidene maluxun mɛnna nin.<verse eid="NUM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35"/>Isirayila kaane yi keli Kibiroti-Hatawa yi, e yi siga Xaserɔti yi.<verse eid="NUM 11:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mariyama nun Harunaa mawugana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1"/>Musa bata yi Kusi ɲaxanla dɔxɔ. Mariyama nun Haruna yi Musa mafala fɔlɔ a ɲaxanla fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Alatala falan tiin Musa nan gbansan xɔn ba? A mi falan tima en fan xɔn ba?” Alatala yi e xuiin mɛ. <verse eid="NUM 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3"/>Anu Musa yi findixi muxu yɛtɛ magodoxin nan na, a yɛtɛ magodoxi dangu birin na bɔxɔ xɔnna fari.<verse eid="NUM 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna nun Mariyama xa, a naxa, “Ɛ saxanna birin xa siga Naralan Bubuni!” E birin yi siga. <verse eid="NUM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5"/>Alatala yi godo kundaan yiyani, a yi ti Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, a yi Haruna nun Mariyama xili. E birin yi fa. <verse eid="NUM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6"/>Alatala yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tuli mati n xuiin na. Xa n ma nabina nde ɛ tagi, n na n yɛtɛ yitama a ra nɛn fe toone yi alo xiye. N yi falan ti a xa xiyene yi. <verse eid="NUM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7"/>Koni na kii mi a ra n ma walikɛɛn Musa xɔn. A tan nan tɔgɔndiyaxi n ma yamaan birin tagi. <verse eid="NUM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8"/>N falan fixɛn tima a xa nɛn kɛnɛn nun kɛnɛn! Sandan mi a ra! A tan bata Alatala misaala to. Nayi, nanfera ɛ mi gaxuma n ma walikɛɛn Musa mafalɛ?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9"/>Alatala xɔlɔxin yi siga. <verse eid="NUM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10"/>Kundaan bama Naralan Bubun xun ma waxatin naxan yi, Mariyama bata yi mafixa gasi fure ɲaxine ra. Haruna yi a mato, furen ɲaxin bata mini a fatin ma. <verse eid="NUM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11"/>A yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “N kanna, yandi, diɲa nxu hakɛn ma nxu naxan ligaxi xaxilitareyani! <verse eid="NUM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12"/>Mariyama nama lu alo diin naxan faxaxi barixi, naxan fatin bata kun fɔlɔ a nga fatini.” <verse eid="NUM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13"/>Nayi, Musa yi a xuini te Alatala ma, a naxa, “E Ala! Yandi, a rakɛndɛya!” <verse eid="NUM 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14"/>Alatala yi a yabi, a naxa, “Xa a baba yi a dɛ igen xuya a yɛtagi nun, a mi yi yagɛ xunsagi keden ba? A xa ramini daaxaden fari ma xii solofere. Na xanbi ra, a mɔn nɔɛ xɛtɛ nɛn.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15"/>Nayi, e yi Mariyama ramini daaxaden fari ma xunsagi keden. Isirayila kaane mi siga han a mɔn yi rasuxu. <verse eid="NUM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16"/>Na xanbi ra, e yi keli Xaserɔti yi, e yi daaxa Paran tonbonni.<verse eid="NUM 12:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Fe rakɔrɔsi fu nun firinne fe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Sariyane 1.19-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2"/>“Fe rakɔrɔsine rasiga Kanan yamanan matodeni n naxan soma Isirayila kaane yii. Bɔnsɔn yo bɔnsɔn, manga keden xa siga.” <verse eid="NUM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3"/>Musa yi e rasiga Alatalaa yamarin ma, keli Paran tonbonni. Isirayila yɛɛratine nan yi e birin na. <verse eid="NUM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4"/>E xinle ni itoe ra,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 13:4">Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna: Sakuru a diin Samuwa.<verse eid="NUM 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5"/>Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna: Xori a diin Safati.<verse eid="NUM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6"/>Yuda bɔnsɔnna: Yefune a diin Kalebi.<verse eid="NUM 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7"/>Isakari bɔnsɔnna: Yusufu a diin Yigali.<verse eid="NUM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8"/>Efirami bɔnsɔnna: Nunu a diin Hoseya.<verse eid="NUM 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9"/>Bunyamin bɔnsɔnna: Rafu a diin Paliti.<verse eid="NUM 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10"/>Sabulon bɔnsɔnna: Sodi a diin Gadiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11"/>Yusufu a dii Manase bɔnsɔnna: Susi a diin Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12"/>Dan bɔnsɔnna: Gemali a diina Amiyɛli.<verse eid="NUM 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13"/>Aseri bɔnsɔnna: Mikeli a diin Seturi.<verse eid="NUM 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14"/>Nafatali bɔnsɔnna: Fofisi a diin Naxabi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15"/>Gadi bɔnsɔnna: Make a diin Gewɛli.<verse eid="NUM 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16"/>Muxune xinle nan ne ra, Musa naxanye xɛ Kanan yamanan matodeni. Musa yi Nunu a dii Hoseya xili sa “Yosuwe.”<verse eid="NUM 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17"/>Musa to yi e rasigama Kanan yamanan matodeni, a yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ mini Negewi nin, siga geya yireni. <verse eid="NUM 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18"/>Ɛ xa yamanan mato. Ɛ a mato xa muxune sɛnbɛn gbo, xa a mi gbo, xa e wuya, xa e mi wuya. <verse eid="NUM 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19"/>Ɛ a mato xa e yamanan fan hanma xa a mi fan, xa e taane findixi banxidɛne nan na hanma xa yinne soxi e ma. <verse eid="NUM 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20"/>Ɛ a mato xa bɔxɔn fan, xa a mi fan, xa wudine na, xa e mi na. Ɛ yixɔdɔxɔ, ɛ fa yamanan wudi bogine ra.” Manpa bili bogi singene waxatin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="NUM 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21"/>Nayi, e yi siga yamanan matodeni, keli Sini tonbonni siga han Rexobo yi, Lebo-Xamata dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22"/>E yi so Negewi yi, e siga han Xebiron yi, Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune yi dɔxi dɛnaxan yi, Aximan, Sɛsayi, e nun Talamayi. Xebiron bata yi ti ɲɛɛ solofere benun Soyan xa ti Misiran yamanani. <verse eid="NUM 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23"/>E yi siga han Esikoli lanbanni, e manpa bili yiin sɛgɛ tɔnsɔn keden yi singanxi naxan na. E na singan tami kuyen na alogo muxu firin xa a xali e nun girenada nun xɔdɛ bogina ndee. <verse eid="NUM 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24"/>E yi mɛnna xili sa “Esikoli lanbanna”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">13.24</char> <char style="fk">Esikoli</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Tɔnsɔnna.”</note> tɔnsɔnna fe ra Isirayila kaane naxan sɛgɛ. <verse eid="NUM 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25"/>Xii tonge naanin to dangu, e yi e xun xɛtɛ, sa keli yamana matoni.<verse eid="NUM 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26"/>E yi xɛtɛ Musa nun Haruna nun Isirayila yamaan fɛma Kadesi yi, Paran tonbonni. E yi e dɛntɛgɛ yamaan xa, e mɔn yi yamanan wudi bogine yita e ra. <verse eid="NUM 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27"/>E dɛntɛgɛni ito nan sa Musa xa, e naxa, “Nxu bata siga yamanani i nxu rasiga dɛnaxan yi. Ɲɔndi na a ra, nɔnɔn nun kumin gbo mɛnni! A bogina ndee ni i ra. <verse eid="NUM 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28"/>Koni mɛn kaane sɛnbɛn gbo! Yinne soxi e taane ma, e gbo mumɛ! Nxu yɛtɛna Anaki bɔnsɔnna muxune toxi nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29"/>Amalɛkine dɔxi Negewi yi. Xitine nun Yebusune nun Amorine dɔxi geya yireni. Kanan kaane dɔxi fɔxɔ igen dɛ e nun Yurudɛn baan xɔn.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30"/>Kalebi yi yamaan masabari Musa xa. A yi a fala, a naxa, “En siga yamanan suxudeni, amasɔtɔ en nɔɛ nɛn yati!”<verse eid="NUM 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31"/>Koni fe rakɔrɔsi bonne yi a fala, e naxa, “En mi nɔɛ siyani itoe yɛngɛ, amasɔtɔ e sɛnbɛn gbo en xa.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32"/>E yamanan naxan mato e na mafala fɔlɔ Isirayila kaane yɛ, e naxa, “Nxu fitina yamanan nan toxi! Mɛn kaane gbo mumɛ! <verse eid="NUM 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33"/>Nxu Nefilimi muxu magaxuxine nan toxi na! Nxu yi luxi nxu yɛtɛ yɛɛ ra yi alo suɲɛne. E fan nxu toxi na kii nin!” E na falaxi nɛn bayo Anaki bɔnsɔnna fataxi Nefilimi nan na.<verse eid="NUM 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Yamaan yi tondi sigɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1"/>Isirayila kaane yi gbelegbele, e xi wugɛ. <verse eid="NUM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2"/>E birin yi Musa nun Haruna mafala, yamaan birin yi a fala e xa, e naxa, “A fisa nxu yi faxa Misiran yi hanma tonbonni ito yi! <verse eid="NUM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3"/>Nanfera Alatala faxi nxu ra yamanani ito yi alogo nxu xa faxa yɛngɛni? Nxɔ ɲaxanle nun nxɔ diine fama nɛn suxudeni yɛngɛni. A mi fisa en xa xɛtɛ Misiran yamanani ba?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4"/>E yi lu a falɛ e bode xa, e naxa, “En yɛɛrati gbɛtɛ sugandi, en yi xɛtɛ Misiran yi!”<verse eid="NUM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5"/>Musa nun Haruna yi e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma Isirayila yamaan birin yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6"/>Nunu a dii Yosuwe nun Yefune a dii Kalebi, naxanye yi xɛxi fe rakɔrɔsine yɛ, ne yi e dugine yibɔ e ma sununi. <verse eid="NUM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7"/>E yi a fala Isirayila yamaan birin xa, e naxa, “Nxu yamanan naxan matoxi, a fan han! <verse eid="NUM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8"/>Xa Alatala sa tin, a tiyɛ nɛn en yɛɛ ra siga na yamanani kumin nun nɔnɔn gbo dɛnaxan yi, a yi a so en yii! <verse eid="NUM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9"/>Koni ɛ nama murutɛ Alatala xili ma tun! Ɛ nama gaxu mɛn kaane yɛɛ ra, amasɔtɔ en fama e nɔdeni nɛn fefe! E kantan seen bata e rabeɲin, anu Alatala en tan xɔn. Nayi, ɛ nama gaxu e yɛɛ ra.”<verse eid="NUM 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10"/>Koni, yamaan birin yi a falama a e xa e magɔlɔn e yi e faxa. Nanunna, Alatala nɔrɔn yi godo Naralan Bubuni Isirayila kaane birin yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Yamani ito luma n naɲaxuɛ han waxatin mundun? E tondima dɛnkɛlɛyɛ n ma han waxatin mundun yi, hali n to bata kabanako fe wuyaxi liga e tagi? <verse eid="NUM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12"/>N fitina furen nafama nɛn e ma, n yi e raxɔri. Koni n ni i tan findima nɛn siya gbeen na, naxan sɛnbɛn gbo e xa.” <verse eid="NUM 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13"/>Musa yi Alatala yabi, a naxa, “Koni Misiran kaane a fe mɛma nɛn, bayo i yamani ito raminixi e tagi i sɛnbɛn nan xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14"/>E fama nɛn na faladeni be kaane xa. E bata yi a mɛ nun, a i tan, Alatala, i yamani ito xɔn. E bata a kolon a yamani ito i toma yɛɛ nun yɛɛ bayo i nɔrɔn luma e xun ma alo kundaan yiyana. Yanyin na, i ti e yɛɛ ra kundani. Kɔɛn na, i ti alo tɛɛna. <verse eid="NUM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15"/>Xa i yamani ito raxɔri sanɲa yi kedenni, siya gbɛtɛn naxanye birin a fe mɛma, ne a falama nɛn, e naxa, <verse eid="NUM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16"/>‘Alatala e tuli sa bɔxɔn naxan na, a mi nɔxi e xalɛ mɛnni, na nan a ligaxi a e faxaxi burunna ra.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17"/>Nayi, Marigina, i sɛnbɛ gbeen mayita alo i bata naxan fala nxu xa, i naxa, <verse eid="NUM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18"/>fa fala Alatala mi xɔlɔn xulɛn, a hinanna gbo, a diɲan hakɛn nun matandin bun. Koni, a mi yulubi kanna yatɛma tinxinden na mumɛ! A fafane hakɛn saranma nɛn e diine ra han mayixɛtɛ saxan hanma naanin. <verse eid="NUM 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19"/>Ala, bayo i ya hinanna gbo, i mɔn xa diɲa i ya yamaan hakɛn ma, alo i e mafeluxi kii naxan yi xabu e sa mini Misiran yamanani han iki.” <verse eid="NUM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20"/>Alatala yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata e mafelu alo i a falaxi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21"/>Koni, habadan Alatala nan n na, n nɔrɔn bɔxɔn birin nafexi, nayi, n bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni: <verse eid="NUM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22"/>Naxanye birin bata n tan nɔrɔn nun n ma kabanako feene to Misiran yi e nun tonbonni, naxanye birin bata n mato bunbani sanɲa yi fu, e tondi n xuiin mɛ, <verse eid="NUM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23"/>ne sese mi na bɔxɔn toma n na e benbane tuli saxi naxan na. Ne sese mi a toɛ naxanye bata n naɲaxu. <verse eid="NUM 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24"/>Koni bayo xaxili gbɛtɛ luxi nɛn n ma walikɛɛn Kalebi yi, a n fɔxɔ ra waxatin birin, n na a xalima nɛn na yamanani, a sigaxi naxan matodeni, n yi a so a yixɛtɛne yii e kɛɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25"/>Bayo Amalɛkine nun Kanan kaane dɔxi lanbanne yi, nayi tila ɛ xɛtɛ, ɛ siga Gbala Baan kiraan xɔn tonbonna binni.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27"/>“Yama ɲaxini ito luma n mafalɛ han waxatin mundun yi? N bata Isirayila kaane mawuga xuiin mɛ, e n mafala. <verse eid="NUM 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28"/>A fala e xa, i naxa, ‘Alatalaa falan ni ito ra. Habadan Ala nan n tan na. N bata n kɔlɔ n yɛtɛni, n na a rabama ɛ ra nɛn alo n na a mɛxi ɛ ra kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29"/>Naxanye birin barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, naxanye tɛngɛ, naxanye birin bata n mafala, ɛ faxama nɛn tonbonni ito yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30"/>Ɛ sese mi soma yamanani, n bata yi ɛ tuli sa naxan na nun, a ɛ dɔxɔma nɛn na, fɔ Yefune a dii Kalebi nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe. <verse eid="NUM 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31"/>Ɛ diine tan, ɛ a falaxi naxanye ma, a e suxuma nɛn yɛngɛni, n ne nan xalima na yamanani ɛ ɛ mɛxi naxan na, e yi dɔxɔ na. <verse eid="NUM 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32"/>Koni ɛ tan faxama nɛn tonbonni ito yi. <verse eid="NUM 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33"/>Ɛ diine e xuruseene rabama nɛn ɲɛɛ tonge naanin tonbonni, e yi ɛ tinxintareyaan goronna tongo, han ɛ birin yi findi binbine ra tonbonni. <verse eid="NUM 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34"/>Ɛ xii tonge naanin nan tixi yamanani ito matodeni. Nayi, ɛ ɲɛɛ tonge naanin nan tima ɛ yulubine goronna bun, lɔxɔ keden, ɲɛɛ keden. Nayi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn a n bata keli ɛ xili ma.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35"/>N bata falan ti, n tan Alatala. N fama na nan ligadeni yama ɲaxini ito ra, naxan murutɛxi n xili ma. E birin ɲanma nɛn tonbonni ito yi, e faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36"/>Musa muxun naxanye rasiga yamanan matodeni, naxanye yamanan mafala ɲaxi ra, e yamaan nadin a xili ma, <verse eid="NUM 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37"/>ne yi faxa. Alatala nan e faxa furen na, bayo e fala ɲaxin ti lan yamanana fe ma. <verse eid="NUM 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38"/>Naxanye siga yamanan matodeni, Nunu a dii Yosuwe nun Yefune a dii Kalebi nan tun lu e nii ra.<verse eid="NUM 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yamaan mɔn yi matandin ti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Sariyane 1.41-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39"/>Musa to Alaa falane birin nali Isirayila kaane ma, e yi nimisa sɔxɔlɛni. <verse eid="NUM 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40"/>Nanara, na xɔtɔn bode, subaxa, e yi kiraan suxu siga geya yireni, e yi a falɛ, e naxa, “En bata keli. En siga na yireni Alatala naxan ma fe falaxi. En bata yulubin liga!” <verse eid="NUM 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41"/>Musa yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ Alatalaa yamarin matandima? Feni ito mi sɔnɔyama! <verse eid="NUM 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42"/>Alatala mi luma ɛ xɔn, nayi ɛ nama siga. Ɛ yaxune nama ɛ nɔ. <verse eid="NUM 14:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43"/>Amasɔtɔ Amalɛkine nun Kanan kaane ɛ yɛɛ ra, e fama nɛn ɛ faxadeni yɛngɛni. Ɛ bata ɛ xun xanbi so Alatala yi, a mi luyɛ ɛ xɔn.” <verse eid="NUM 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44"/>E yi kankan na ma, e yi te geya yireni, koni Alatalaa Layiri Kankiraan nun Musa lu nɛn daaxadeni. <verse eid="NUM 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45"/>Na xanbi ra, Amalɛkine nun Kanan kaane yi godo geyane fari e yi dɔxi dɛnaxanye yi. E yi Isirayila kaane nɔ, e siga e faxɛ han Xoroma yi.<verse eid="NUM 14:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxa gbɛtɛye sariyane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “N yamanan naxan soxi ɛ yii, ɛ na dɔxɔ mɛnni, <verse eid="NUM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3"/>ɛ yi ɲingene hanma siine hanma yɛxɛɛne rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, saraxa gan daxin na hanma naxan dɛ tiin nakamalima hanma ɲɛnige ma saraxane, hanma sali lɔxɔne gbeene, a xirin nafanma nɛn Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4"/>Naxan na fa a saraxan na Alatala yɛtagi, a xa fa bogise saraxan fan na: murutu fuɲi kilo saxan naxan namulanxi turen litiri keden nun a tagi ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5"/>Xa i fa yɛxɛɛ diin na saraxa gan daxin na hanma saraxa gbɛtɛ, i xa wudi bogi igen litiri keden e nun a tagi ba minse saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6"/>Xa kontonna na a ra, murutu fuɲin kilo sennin naxan namulanxi ture litiri firinna ra, na nan bogise saraxan na, <verse eid="NUM 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7"/>e nun wudi bogi igen litiri firin minse saraxan na. A ba alogo a xirin xa rafan n tan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8"/>Xa tura bulanna nan bama n xa saraxa gan daxin na hanma saraxan naxan dɛ tiin nakamalima, hanma bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxana Alatala xa, <verse eid="NUM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9"/>murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin namulanxin turen litiri saxanna, na nan bogise saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10"/>I mɔn xa fa wudi bogi igen litiri saxan na minse saraxan na. Saraxan na a ra naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, a xirin nafan a ma.”<verse eid="NUM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11"/>“Ɲingene hanma kontonne hanma yɛxɛɛne hanma sii diine, e bama na kii nin. <verse eid="NUM 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12"/>Xuruseene na wuya kiki, e keden kedenna birin lan nɛn e ba e nun bogise saraxane. <verse eid="NUM 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13"/>Isirayila bari diine birin xa a liga na kii nin, e nɛma saraxane raliyɛ tɛɛn na, naxanye xirin nafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14"/>Xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi yamanani hanma naxanye danguma ɛ konni hanma naxanye denbaya bata bu na, ne fan na keli saraxa ralideni Alatala ma tɛɛn na naxan xiri rafan a ma, e xa a liga na kii kedenni. <verse eid="NUM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15"/>Sariyane lan yamaan muxune birin xa, ɛ tan Isirayila bari diine alo xɔɲɛne. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa. Ɛ nun xɔɲɛne birin keden Alatala yɛɛ ra yi. <verse eid="NUM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16"/>Sariyane nun yamarine birin lan ɛ nun xɔɲɛne birin xa, naxanye dɔxi ɛ tagi.”<verse eid="NUM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Se xaba singene nun tantanne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na so yamanani, n na ɛ xalin dɛnaxan yi, <verse eid="NUM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19"/>ɛ nɛma na yamanan donseen donɲɛ, ɛ xa saraxan ba a ra Alatala xa. <verse eid="NUM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20"/>Ɛ na ɛ murutu singene din, ɛ yi burudi singen nafala, ɛ na rali n ma saraxan na keli lonna ma. <verse eid="NUM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21"/>Nayi, ɛ xa burudi singen nali Alatala ma saraxan na waxati famatɔne birin yi.”<verse eid="NUM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22"/>“Xa ɛ tantan, ɛ mi yamarini ito nde liga, Alatala naxan falaxi Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23"/>a na findi Alatala yamari yo ra a naxan fixi ɛ ma fata Musa ra, fɔlɔ na lɔxɔn ma a fixi naxan yi han waxati famatɔne yi, <verse eid="NUM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24"/>xa ɛ a ligaxi tantanna nin, yamaan mi a kolon, nayi yamaan birin xa tura bulanna ba saraxa gan daxin na, naxan xiri rafan n tan Alatala ma, e nun bogise saraxan nun minse saraxan naxan lanɲɛ sariyan ma, e nun kɔtɔ keden yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25"/>Saraxaraliin xa Ala solona Isirayila yamaan birin xa, e yi mafelu. Amasɔtɔ tantanna nan yi a ra, e mɔn bata saraxan nali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, e nun yulubi xafari saraxan na e tantanna fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26"/>Isirayila yamaan nun xɔɲɛn naxanye e tagi, e birin mafeluma nɛn, amasɔtɔ e birin yi na tantanna kui.”<verse eid="NUM 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27"/>“Xa muxu kedenna nan yulubin ligaxi tantanni, a xa sii gilɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna ba yulubi xafari saraxan na. <verse eid="NUM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28"/>Saraxaraliin xa Alatala solona na kanna xa naxan yulubin ligaxi tantanni, a mafeluma nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29"/>Isirayila bari diine nun xɔɲɛn naxanye e tagi, naxan na yulubin liga tantanni, na sariya kedenna lan ne birin xa. <verse eid="NUM 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30"/>Koni xa Isirayila bari diin hanma xɔɲɛna a rakeli a ma, a yulubin liga, na bata Alatala rayelefu, a kedima nɛn yamani. <verse eid="NUM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31"/>A bata Alatalaa falan naɲaxu, a a yamarine kala. A xa kedi yamani, a yulubin goronna luma a tan nan ma.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Matabu Lɔxɔn kalana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32"/>Isirayila kaane yi tonbonni waxatin naxan yi, e muxuna nde to yege fenni Matabu Lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33"/>E yi a xali Musa nun Haruna fɛma, e nun yamaan birin. <verse eid="NUM 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34"/>E yi a ramara ki faɲi, alogo sariyan xa sa a yulubin saran feen na a ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35"/>Nayi, Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Muxuni ito xa faxa. Yamaan birin xa a magɔlɔn gɛmɛn na daaxaden fari ma.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36"/>E yi na kanna xali daaxaden fari ma, e yi a magɔlɔn han a faxa alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 15:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luti dɛnbɛxine nun dugine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38"/>a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ ɛ domane rayabu luti dɛnbɛxine ra, ɛ yi e singan ɛ domane dɛ kinkine ra gari mamiloxine ra waxati famatɔne birin yi. <verse eid="NUM 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39"/>Ɛ na luti dɛnbɛxine to, Alatalaa yamarine birin nabirama ɛ ma nɛn, ɛ yi e liga. Nayi, ɛ mi birɛ ɛ bɔɲɛn nun ɛ yɛɛne kunfa feene fɔxɔ ra, naxanye tinxintareyaan liga Ala ra. <verse eid="NUM 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40"/>Nayi, ɛ xaxili luma nɛn n ma yamarine birin xɔn, ɛ yi e suxu, ɛ yi sariɲan ɛ Ala yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41"/>Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala, naxan ɛ raminixi Misiran yamanani alogo n xa findi ɛ Ala ra. Alatala nan n tan na, ɛ Ala.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Murutɛ gbɛtɛ mɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1"/>Xɛmɛna nde yi keli naxan yi xili Kora, Yisehari a diina. Lewi a dii Kehati mamandenna. E nun Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna muxuna ndee nan yi a ra naxanye yi xili Datan nun Abirami, Eliyabi a diine, e nun Hon, Pɛlɛti a diina. <verse eid="NUM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2"/>E nun Isirayila kaan muxu kɛmɛ firin tonge suulun yi keli Musa xili ma, e birin xili kan yamaan fonne tagi. <verse eid="NUM 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3"/>E yi e malan Musa nun Haruna xili ma, e yi a fala e xa, e naxa, “Ɛ bata a radangu ayi! Yamaan muxune birin sariɲan. Alatala e birin tagi. Nanfera ɛ yɛtɛ yitema Alatala yamaan ma?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4"/>Musa to na falane mɛ, a yi a yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5"/>A yi a fala Kora nun a muxune xa, a naxa, “Tila xɔtɔnni, Alatala a yitama nɛn, a gbeen naxan na e nun naxan sariɲan, naxan lan a siga a fɛma. A naxan sugandixi, a na kanna luma nɛn, a yi a maso a ra. <verse eid="NUM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6"/>Nayi, Kora, ɛ nun i ya muxune birin xa ito liga: ɛ wusulan gan seene tongo. <verse eid="NUM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7"/>Tila ɛ tɛɛn sa e kui, ɛ wusulanna sa a fari Alatala yɛtagi. Alatala na naxan sugandi, na nan sariɲan. Ɛ tan Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune bata a radangu ayi!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8"/>Musa mɔn yi a fala Kora xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tuli mati, ɛ tan Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune! <verse eid="NUM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9"/>Na mi ɛ wasɛ a Isirayilaa Ala bata ɛ sugandi Isirayila kaan bonne tagi, a yi ɛ maso a ra, alogo ɛ xa wali a xa Alatala batu bubuni, ɛ yi ti Isirayila yamaan yɛɛ ra ɛ yi e mali Ala batu feen na? <verse eid="NUM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10"/>A bata ɛ maso a ra, ɛ nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune birin. Koni, ɛ mɔn kataxi, a xa ɛ findi saraxaraline ra! <verse eid="NUM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11"/>Ɛ nun i ya muxune bata ɛ malan Alatala xili ma. Nde Haruna ra feni ito yi ɛ to a mafalama?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12"/>Na xanbi ra, Musa yi muxuna nde rasiga Datan nun Abirami xilideni, Eliyabi a diine, koni e yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu mi fama! <verse eid="NUM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13"/>Na mi i wasaxi ba, i to bata nxu ramini Misiran yamanani kumin nun nɔnɔn gbo dɛnaxan yi alogo i xa nxu faxa tonbonni? I mɔn waxi nxu ɲaxankata feen nin ba? <verse eid="NUM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14"/>I mi faxi nxu ra bɔxɔ faɲi yi, kumin nun nɔnɔn gbo dɛnaxan yi! I mi xɛɛne nun manpa bili nakɔne soxi nxu yii nxu kɛɛn na mumɛ! I yengi a ma a i nxu mayendenma nɛn alo danxutɔne ba? Nxu mi fama!” <verse eid="NUM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15"/>Na yabin yi Musa xɔlɔ kati, a yi a fala Alatala xa, a naxa, “I nama tin e saraxane ra! Hali sofanla n mi a tongoxi e yii, n munma muxu yo hakɛ tongo e yɛ.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16"/>Musa yi a fala Kora xa, a naxa, “Ɛ nun i ya muxune birin xa fa Alatala yɛtagi tila e nun Haruna. <verse eid="NUM 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17"/>Ɛ birin xa wusulan gan seene tongo, ɛ yi wusulanna sa e kui, ɛ yi a yita Alatala ra. E birin malanxina, wusulan gan seen kɛmɛ firin tonge suulun. I tan nun Haruna fan xa ɛ wusulan gan seen yita Ala ra.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18"/>E birin yi e wusulan gan seene tongo, e tɛɛn nun wusulanna sa e kui, e ti Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, Musa nun Haruna fɛma. <verse eid="NUM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19"/>Kora to a fɔxɔrabirane birin malan e xili ma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, Alatala nɔrɔn yi godo yamaan birin yɛtagi.<verse eid="NUM 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21"/>“Ɛ masiga yamani ito ra, alogo n xa e halagi iki sa!” <verse eid="NUM 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22"/>Musa nun Haruna yi bira, e yi e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Ala, i tan nan niin saxi muxune birin yi, i xɔlɔma nɛn yamaan birin ma ba, anu muxu keden peen nan yulubin ligaxi?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24"/>“A fala yamaan xa, a e xa e masiga Kora nun Datan nun Abirami bubune ra.” <verse eid="NUM 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25"/>Musa yi keli, a siga Datan nun Abirami binni, Isirayila fonne biraxi a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26"/>A yi a fala yamaan xa, a naxa, “Ɛ masiga yulubi kanni itoe bubune ra! Ɛ nama ɛ yiin din e yii se yo ra, alogo ɛ fan nama raxɔri e yulubine fe ra.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27"/>Nayi, yamaan yi e masiga Kora nun Datan nun Abirami bubune ra. Datan nun Abirami yi mini e bubune kui, e ti e dɛ ra, e nun e ɲaxanle nun e diine birin.<verse eid="NUM 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28"/>Musa yi a fala, a naxa, “Ɛ fama a kolondeni a Alatala nan n nafaxi feni itoe birin ligadeni. N tan mi a ra. <verse eid="NUM 16:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29"/>Xa muxuni itoe faxa alo muxune birin faxan kii naxan yi, xa e dunuɲa yi gidin lu alo adamane dari fena, nayi Alatala xa mi n nafaxi. <verse eid="NUM 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30"/>Koni xa Alatala kabanako feen liga, xa bɔxɔni bɔ, a yi e nun e yii seene birin gerun, xa e ɲɛɲɛn siga laxira yi, ɛ a kolonma nɛn nayi fa fala muxuni itoe bata Alatala raɲaxu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31"/>Musa to yelin falan tiyɛ tun, bɔxɔn yi rabi e bun. <verse eid="NUM 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32"/>A yi a raxutu e ma e nun e denbayane, e nun muxun naxanye birin yi Kora fɔxɔ ra e nun e yii seene birin. <verse eid="NUM 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33"/>E ɲɛɲɛne yi siga laxira yi e nun e yii seene birin. Bɔxɔn yi e yɛ maluxun, e lɔ ayi Isirayila yamaan ma. <verse eid="NUM 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34"/>E to e gbelegbele xuiin mɛ, Isirayila kaan naxanye birin yi e rabilinni, ne yi e gi, e naxa, “Bɔxɔn nama en fan gerun de!” <verse eid="NUM 16:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35"/>Alatala yi tɛɛn nagodo, a yi na muxu kɛmɛ firin tonge suulunne birin gan, naxanye fa wusulanna ra.<verse eid="NUM 16:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2"/>“A fala saraxarali Harunaa dii Eleyasari xa, a a xa wusulan gan seene matongo tɛɛ wolonni, a yi tɛɛ wolonne woli ayi yire makuyeni. Amasɔtɔ na wusulan gan seene bata rasariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3"/>Ne yulubitɔ faxaxine gbee wusulan gan wurene xa findi wure dɛnfɛtɛnxine ra e sa saraxa ganden ma bayo e bata rali Alatala ma e yi findi se rasariɲanxin na. E findima taxamasenna nan na Isirayila kaane xa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4"/>Muxun naxanye faxa tɛɛni, saraxaralina Eleyasari yi ne gbee sulan wurene malan, a yi e bɔnbɔ han e dɛnfɛtɛn, a e sa saraxa ganden ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5"/>Na taxamasenna yi na feen nabirama nɛn Isirayila kaane ma alogo muxu yo nama wusulanna gan Alatala yɛtagi fɔ Haruna yixɛtɛna nde alogo e nama liga alo Kora nun a muxune. A yi liga alo Alatala a fala e xa fata Musa ra kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Isirayila yamaan birin yi lu Musa nun Haruna mafalɛ, e naxa, “Ɛ bata Alatala yamaan faxa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7"/>Koni, Isirayila kaane to e malan Musa nun Haruna xili ma, e yi Naralan Bubun binna mato, nanunna, kundaan yi godo a ma, Alatala nɔrɔn yi mini kɛnɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8"/>Musa nun Haruna yi fa Naralan Bubun yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10"/>“Ɛ masiga yamani ito ra alogo n xa e raxɔri keden na.” Musa nun Haruna yi bira, e yi e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11"/>Musa yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “I ya wusulan gan seen tongo, i wusulanna sa a kui e nun tɛɛ wolonna keli saraxa ganden ma. I i mafura, i siga Ala solonadeni yamaan xa. Alatala xɔlɔn bata yihadin nafa. Fitina furen bata fɔlɔ.” <verse eid="NUM 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12"/>Musa naxan fala Haruna yi na liga, a yi a gi yamaan tagi, fitina furen bata yi fɔlɔ dɛnaxan yi. A yi wusulanna gan, a Ala solona e xa. <verse eid="NUM 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13"/>A yi ti faxa muxune nun a ɲɛɲɛne tagi. Nayi, fitina furen yi dan. <verse eid="NUM 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 17:14"/>Muxu wuli fu nun naanin kɛmɛ solofere yi faxa, e sa Kora a muxu faxaxine yatɛn fari. <verse eid="NUM 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 17:15"/>Yihadin to ɲan, Haruna yi xɛtɛ Musa fɛma Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na.<verse eid="NUM 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Harunaa dunganna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 17:16"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 17:17"/>“Falan ti Isirayila kaane birin xa, bɔnsɔnne mangane birin xa dungan keden so i yii. I dungan fu nun firin nan tongoma. Birin xinla xa sɛbɛ a dunganna ma. <verse eid="NUM 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 17:18"/>Fɔ Lewi bɔnsɔnna, i xa Haruna xinla sɛbɛ na ma. Nayi, dungan keden bɔnsɔn manga keden. <verse eid="NUM 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 17:19"/>I xa na dunganne sa Naralan Bubuni, Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi n naralanma ɛ ra dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 17:20"/>N naxan sugandixi, na dunganna ɲingine minima a ma nɛn. Nayi, Isirayila kaane mafalan naxan tima ɛ xili ma, n yi na dan.”<verse eid="NUM 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 17:21"/>Musa yi falan ti Isirayila kaane xa, bɔnsɔn mangane birin yi dungan keden keden so a yii, dungan fu nun firin. Haruna gbeen yi na yɛ. <verse eid="NUM 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 17:22"/>Musa yi e sa Alatala yɛtagi Layiri Sereya Bubun kui. <verse eid="NUM 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 17:23"/>Na xɔtɔn bode, Musa to siga Layiri Sereya Bubuni, e yi a to a Haruna dunganna nan ɲingiye minixi, Lewi bɔnsɔnna gbeena, a mɔn fugaxi, a yi Amandi bogi mɔxine ramini! <verse eid="NUM 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 17:24"/>Musa yi dunganne birin tongo Alatala fɛma bubuni a e yita Isirayila kaane ra. Birin yi e to, birin yi a gbeen tongo.<verse eid="NUM 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 17:25"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Harunaa dunganna xali Layiri Kankiraan yɛtagi. A xa lu mɛnni taxamasenna ra muxu murutɛxine xa alogo e mafalane xa dan n yɛtagi alogo e nama faxa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 17:26"/>Musa yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari a ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 17:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 17:27"/>Isirayila kaane yi a fala Musa xa, e naxa, “I mi a to, nxu faxamatɔɔn na a ra! Nxu halagima nɛn! Nxu birin halagima nɛn! <verse eid="NUM 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 17:28"/>Naxan yo na a maso Alatala Batu Bubun na, na kanna faxama nɛn! Nxu birin faxama nɛn ba?”<verse eid="NUM 17:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna wanle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “Xa yire sariɲanxin wanla kala, i tan nun i ya diine nun Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, ɛ tan nan a yulubin goronna tongoma. Koni xa saraxarali wanla nan kala, ɛ nun i ya diine nan gbansanna na yulubin goronna tongoma. <verse eid="NUM 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2"/>I ngaxakedenne maso i ra, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune, alogo e xa sa ɛ fari, e ɛ mali, ɛ nun i ya diine nɛma ɛ saraxarali wanla kɛma Layiri Sereya Bubun yɛtagi waxatin naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3"/>E xa ɛ yamarine suxu, e yi e yengi lu bubun wanle birin xɔn. Koni e nama e maso yire sariɲanxin muranne ra hanma saraxa gandena, alogo ɛ birin nama faxa ɛ bode xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4"/>E sama ɛ fari nɛn walideni, e yi e yengi lu Naralan Bubun xɔn e nun a wanle birin. Muxu gbɛtɛ yo nama sa ɛ fari. <verse eid="NUM 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5"/>Ɛ tan yɛtɛɛn nan ɛ yengi dɔxɔma yire sariɲanxin nun saraxa ganden xɔn alogo Isirayila kaane xa ratanga n ma xɔlɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6"/>Ɛ mato, n bata ɛ ngaxakeden Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune sugandi Isirayila kaan bonne yɛ n tan Alatala gbeen na. N bata e taxu ɛ ra alogo e xa Naralan Bubun wanle kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7"/>Koni i tan Haruna nun i yixɛtɛne, ɛ tan nan gbansan na saraxarali wanla kɛma saraxa ganden yɛtagi e nun yire sariɲanxini yɛ masansan dugin xanbi ra. N tan nan na wanla soxi ɛ yii. Xa muxu gbɛtɛ a maso yire sariɲanxin na, ɛ xa a faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saraxaraline gbeen naxanye ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8"/>Alatala yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “N bata Isirayila kaane saraxane fi ɛ ma, e naxanye ralima n ma. N bata e so i yii i gbeen na e nun i yixɛtɛne birin han habadan. <verse eid="NUM 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9"/>Naxan yo mi sama tɛɛni saraxa sariɲanxi fisamantenne yɛ, ɛ gbeen nan ne ra. Isirayila kaane fama naxan birin na, ɛ nun i ya diine gbeen nan ne ra: bogise saraxane nun yulubi xafari saraxane nun yangin saraxane. <verse eid="NUM 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10"/>Ɛ e don alo se sariɲanxi fisamantenne. Xɛmɛne nan e donma. Ɛ xa e yatɛ se sariɲanxine ra.”<verse eid="NUM 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11"/>“Naxanye bama Isirayila kaane se ralixine ra ɛ xa, ɛ gbeen nan ne fan na. N bata na so ɛ nun i ya dii xɛmɛne nun i ya dii tɛmɛne yii habadan! Ɛ denbayaan muxun naxanye mi xɔsixi sena nde xɔn, ne nɔɛ a donɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12"/>N mɔn bata bɔxɔn bogise singene so ɛ yii: oliwi ture faɲin nun manpa faɲi nɛnɛne nun bogise gbɛtɛye, Isirayila kaane naxanye fima n tan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13"/>E fama bɔxɔn bogise singen naxanye ra Alatala xa, ne findima nɛn ɛ gbeene ra. Ɛ denbayaan muxun naxanye mi xɔsixi sena nde xɔn, e nɔɛ a donɲɛ nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14"/>Isirayila kaane na naxanye birin nali Ala ma kiseen na, ne yi findi ɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15"/>Dii singen naxanye birin fixi Alatala ma, muxune nun subene, ɛ gbeen nan ne ra. Koni ɛ xa tin muxune nun sube haramuxine dii singene birin xa xunba gbetin na. <verse eid="NUM 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16"/>Dii xɛmɛn kike kedenna xunba saren lanma gbeti gbanan suulun nan ma, naxan lanɲɛ yire sariɲanxin gbananna ma, naxan binya garamu fu. <verse eid="NUM 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17"/>Koni, ɲingena, yɛxɛɛna, hanma siin dii singen mi xunbama bayo e sariɲan. Ɛ xa e wunla xuya saraxa ganden fari, ɛ yi e ture yirene rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, naxan xiri rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18"/>Na xanbi ra, ɛ gbeen nan e subene ra, alo se ralixine kankene nun e yiifari ma danbane findixi ɛ gbeen na kii naxan yi bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxani. <verse eid="NUM 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19"/>Nayi, Isirayila kaane saraxa sariɲanxin naxanye ralixi Alatala ma, n bata ne birin so ɛ nun i ya dii xɛmɛne nun dii tɛmɛne yii ɛ gbeen na waxatin birin. Habadan layirin na a ra Alatala yɛtagi, ɛ nun ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20"/>Alatala mɔn yi a fala Haruna xa, a naxa, “N yamanan naxan soxi Isirayila kaane yii, i mi bɔxɔ sɔtɔma na yi. N tan nan findima i gbeen na nafunla funfuni.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21"/>Ala mɔn yi a fala, a naxa, “N bata Isirayila birin yaganne so Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii e kɛɛn na, e wali saranna ra, e naxan kɛma Naralan Bubuni. <verse eid="NUM 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22"/>Isirayila kaan bonne nama fa e maso Naralan Bubun na, alogo e nama findi yulubi tongon na, e yi faxa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune nan tun wanle kɛma Naralan Bubuni. Xa wanla kala, e tan nan a yulubin goronna tongoma. Habadan sariyan na a ra ɛ yixɛtɛne birin xa. Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune mi bɔxɔ sɔtɔma alo Isirayila bɔnsɔnna bonne. <verse eid="NUM 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24"/>Koni Isirayila kaane na yaganna naxanye fi Alatala ma, n na soma nɛn Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii. Nanara, n na falaxi a e mi bɔxɔ sɔtɔma alo bɔnsɔnna bonne.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26"/>a xa a fala Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune xa, a naxa, “Isirayila kaane na fa yaganne ra ɛ xɔn, n naxan soxi ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na, ɛ fan xa na seene yaganna ba, ɛ yi a fi Alatala ma ɛ yaganna ra. <verse eid="NUM 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27"/>Na luxi nɛn ɛ yii alo xɛɛ biin naxan bama a se xabaxine ra hanma a manpa nɛnɛne. <verse eid="NUM 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28"/>Nayi, ɛ fan bata saraxan ba Alatala xa fata Isirayila kaane yaganne ra. Ɛ xa Alatala gbeen ba yaganne ra, ɛ yi a so saraxarali Haruna yii. <verse eid="NUM 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29"/>Yagan sɔtɔxin naxan fan dangu a birin na, ɛ na nan fima Alatala ma a gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30"/>Ɛ na a faɲi yiren fi, na yatɛma ɛ xa nɛn alo bonne naxan fima fata e se xabaxine ra hanma e manpa nɛnɛne. <verse eid="NUM 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31"/>Ɛ nun ɛ denbayane nɔɛ a dɔnxɛne donɲɛ nɛn dɛnaxan na ɛ kɛnɛn. Amasɔtɔ ɛ saranna na ra Naralan Bubun wanla kɛdeni. <verse eid="NUM 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32"/>Ɛ a faɲi yiren fi, alogo ɛ nama Isirayila kaane saraxa sariɲanxine raxɔsi n yɛɛ ra yi, alogo ɛ nama faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19"/>
  <para style="s">Marasariɲan igena fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2"/>“Ito nan daxa sariyan xɔn Alatala naxan yamarixi: A fala Isirayila kaane xa, a e xa fa ɲinge gilɛ gbeela ra i fɛma fɛ mi naxan na, xun xidi yegen munma xidi naxan xunna ma. <verse eid="NUM 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3"/>I xa a so saraxarali Eleyasari yii. A xa a xali daaxaden fari ma, e yi a kɔɛ raxaba a yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4"/>Eleyasari xa a wunla nde tongo a yii sonla ra, a yi a xuya Naralan Bubun yɛtagi bɔxɔni dɔxɔɲa ma solofere. <verse eid="NUM 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5"/>E xa ɲinge gilɛn gbindin birin sa tɛɛni a yɛɛ xɔri e nun a kidin nun a suben nun a wunla e nun a gbiine. <verse eid="NUM 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6"/>Saraxaraliin xa suman wudin nun hisopi wudin nun yɛxɛɛ xabe gari gbeela woli tɛɛni ɲinge gilɛn fari. <verse eid="NUM 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7"/>Na xanbi ra, saraxaraliin xa a dugine xa, a yi a maxa benun a xa siga daaxadeni, koni a luma nɛn xɔsixi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="NUM 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8"/>Naxan ɲinge gilɛn sama tɛɛni na fan lan a yi a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, a luma nɛn xɔsixi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="NUM 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9"/>Muxun naxan mi xɔsixi, na xa ɲinge gilɛn xuben malan, a yi a sa yire sariɲanxina nde yi daaxaden fari ma. Isirayila yamaan xa a xuben namara marasariɲan igen nafala seen na. Yulubi xafari seen na a ra. <verse eid="NUM 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10"/>Naxan na ɲinge gilɛn xuben makɔ, na fan lan a yi a dugine xa, a luma nɛn xɔsixi han ɲinbanna. A findima habadan sariyan nan na Isirayila kaane xa e nun xɔɲɛn naxanye dɔxi e tagi.”<verse eid="NUM 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11"/>“Naxan yo na a yiin din faxa muxun na, a xɔsixi han xunsagi keden. <verse eid="NUM 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12"/>Xii saxanden nun xii soloferedeni, a xa a yɛtɛ rasariɲan na igen nan na, a yi sariɲan. Koni xa a mi a yɛtɛ rasariɲan xii saxanden nun xii soloferedeni, a mi sariɲanma. <verse eid="NUM 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13"/>Naxan na a yiin din faxa muxun na, a tondi a yɛtɛ rasariɲanɲɛ, a bata Alatala Batu Bubun naxɔsi. Na kanna kedima nɛn Isirayila yi. Bayo marasariɲan igen mi xuyaxi a ma. A xɔsina a ma.”<verse eid="NUM 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14"/>“Sariyan ni i ra xa muxun faxa bubuna nde kui: Naxan na so na bubuni e nun naxanye yi na, ne xɔsixi xunsagi keden. <verse eid="NUM 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15"/>Xa goronna nde na naxan dɛ mi ragalixi a faɲin na, a kui seene haramuxi. <verse eid="NUM 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16"/>Naxan yo a yiin din muxu binbin na burunna ra, naxan faxaxi silanfanna ra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">19.16</char> <char style="fk">Silanfanna:</char> Sofane yɛngɛso dɛgɛmana.</note> hanma a faxa a yɛtɛ ma, hanma naxan yo a yiin din muxun xɔnne ra hanma gaburuna, na kanna luma nɛn xɔsixi han xii solofere. <verse eid="NUM 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17"/>Muxu xɔsixin xa rasariɲan ikiini: ɲinge gilɛn naxan baxi yulubi xafarin na, na xubena nde nan tongoma, a yi sa igeni goronna kui. <verse eid="NUM 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18"/>Muxu sariɲanxina nde xa hisopi wudi yiin tongo, a yi a sin igeni, a yi a xuya bubun ma muxun faxa dɛnaxan yi, e nun a kuiin birin e nun muxun naxanye yi a kui. A mɔn xa xuya na kanna ma naxan a yiin dinxi muxun xɔnne ra, hanma e muxun naxan faxaxi hanma naxan faxaxi a yɛtɛ ma hanma gaburuna. <verse eid="NUM 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19"/>Muxun naxan sariɲan, na xa na igen xuya muxu xɔsixin ma xii saxande lɔxɔn nun xii soloferede lɔxɔni. A yi a rasariɲan xii soloferede lɔxɔni. A xa a dugine xa, a yi a maxa, ɲinbanna ra, a yi sariɲan. <verse eid="NUM 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20"/>Koni xa muxun naxan xɔsixi, xa na tondi a rasariɲanɲɛ, a kedima nɛn Isirayila yamaan yɛ. Amasɔtɔ a bata Alatala yire sariɲanxin naxɔsi. Amasɔtɔ marasariɲan igen mi xuyaxi a ma, a luma nɛn xɔsixi. <verse eid="NUM 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21"/>Habadan sariyan nan na ra e xa. Naxan na marasariɲan igen xuya gbɛtɛ ma, na kanna lan a yi a dugine xa. Naxan na a yiin din marasariɲan igen na a xɔsixi han ɲinbanna. <verse eid="NUM 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22"/>Muxu xɔsixin na a yiin din sese ra, na haramuma nɛn. Naxan yo na a yiin din na se haramuxin na, na fan yɛtɛɛn xɔsixi han ɲinbanna.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20"/>
  <para style="s">Meriba igena</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 17.1-7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1"/>Isirayila yamaan birin yi fa Sini tonbonni kike singen na, e dɔxɔ Kadesi yi. Mariyama faxa mɛnna nin, e yi a maluxun. <verse eid="NUM 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2"/>Bayo igen bata yi ɲan yamaan yii, e yi e malan Musa nun Haruna xili ma.<verse eid="NUM 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3"/>E yi yɛngɛn fen Musa ra e naxa, “A yi fisa nun Alatala xa nxu fan faxa alo nxu lanfane! <verse eid="NUM 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4"/>Nanfera i faxi nxu ra tonbonni alogo nxu nun nxɔ xuruseene xa fa faxa be, nxu tan Alatalaa yamana? <verse eid="NUM 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5"/>Nanfera i nxu raminixi Misiran yi, i fa nxu ra yire xɔdɛxɛni ito yi? Malo ba, xɔdɛ bili ba, manpa bili ba, girenada bogi ba, sese mi be. Hali igen min daxin yatigina, a mi be!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6"/>Musa nun Haruna yi keli yamaan fɛma, e yi siga Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na, e bira, e yi e yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. Alatala nɔrɔn yi godo e fɛma.<verse eid="NUM 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8"/>“I ya dunganna tongo. Ɛ nun i tada Haruna xa yamaan malan. Ɛ xa falan ti fanyeni ito xa e yɛɛ xɔri, a igen naminima nɛn. I igen naminima nɛn yamaan xa fanyeni ito yi alogo e nun e xuruseene xa e min.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9"/>Musa yi dunganna tongo Alatalaa yire sariɲanxini, alo Ala a yamari kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10"/>E nun Haruna yi yamaan malan fanyen dɛxɔn, Musa yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan murutɛdene, ɛ tuli mati! Fɔ nxu xa igen namini ɛ xa fanyeni ito yi ba?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11"/>Musa yi a yiini te, a fanyen garin a dunganna ra sanɲa ma firin. Ige gbeen yi mini mafurɛn! Yamaan yi e min e nun e xuruseene.<verse eid="NUM 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12"/>Koni Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa, a naxa, “Bayo ɛ mi laxi n na, ɛ mi n binyaxi n ma sariɲanni Isirayila kaane yɛtagi, nanara, ɛ tan xa mi yamani ito xalima yamanani n naxan soxi e yii.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13"/>Meriba igene yi dɛnaxan yi, Isirayila kaane Alatala matandi nɛn mɛnni, e yi a kolon fa fala a sariɲan.<verse eid="NUM 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edɔn mangan yi tondi a Isirayila kaane xa dangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14"/>Musa yi xɛrane rasiga Edɔn yi keli Kadesi yi, e naxa, “I ngaxakedenne, Isirayila kaane naxa, ‘Ɛ bata a kolon tɔrɔn naxanye birin nxu lixi. <verse eid="NUM 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15"/>Nxu benbane godo nɛn Misiran yi, nxu yi dɔxɔ na waxati xunkuye. Misiran kaane yi nxu tɔrɔ e nun nxu benbane. <verse eid="NUM 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16"/>Koni nxu to Alatala maxandi, a yi nxu xuiin namɛ. A yi malekan nafa, a yi nxu ramini Misiran yi. Nxu bata fa Kadesi yi, taan naxan i ya bɔxɔn dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17"/>Tin nxu xa i ya yamanani gidi. Nxu mi danguma xɛɛ bixine yi hanma manpa bili nakɔne yi. Nxu mi xɔɲin ige minɲɛ. Nxu birama kira gbeen nan fɔxɔ ra, nxu mi a fatama nxu yiifanna ma hanma nxu kɔmɛnna ma, han nxu yi i ya yamanan birin yigidi.’ ” <verse eid="NUM 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18"/>Edɔn kaane yi a yabi, e naxa, “Ɛ nama dangu nxu konni. Xa ɛ a liga, nxu ɛ yɛngɛma nɛn.” <verse eid="NUM 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19"/>Isirayila kaane mɔn yi a yabi, e naxa, “Nxu tema kira gbeen nan xɔn! Xa nxu nun nxɔ xuruseene igena nde min ɛ konni, nxu a saren fiyɛ. Nxu waxi a xɔn ma nɛn, a nxu xa dangu nxu sanni ɛ konni gbansan!” <verse eid="NUM 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20"/>E mɔn yi a fala, e naxa, “Ɛ mi danguma!” Edɔn kaane yi mini e ralandeni e nun gali gbee sɛnbɛmana. <verse eid="NUM 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21"/>Nayi, Edɔn kaane mi tin a Isirayila kaane xa dangu e yamanani. Isirayila kaane yi kira gbɛtɛ suxu.<verse eid="NUM 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Haruna faxa fena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22"/>Isirayila yamaan birin yi keli Kadesi yi, siga Horo geyaan ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna xa Horo geyaan ma Edɔn yamanan danna ra, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24"/>“Haruna sigamatɔɔn na a ra laxira yi. N yamanan naxan soxi Isirayila kaane yii, a mi soma na, amasɔtɔ ɛ murutɛ nɛn n ma yamarin ma Meriba igene yi. <verse eid="NUM 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25"/>Nayi, Musa, i xa fa Haruna nun a dii Eleyasari ra Horo geyaan xuntagi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26"/>I xa Harunaa saraxarali dugine ba a ma, i yi e ragodo a dii Eleyasari ma, bayo Haruna laxirayama mɛnna nin.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27"/>Musa yi Alatalaa yamarin suxu. E saxanna birin yi te Horo geyaan fari yamaan yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28"/>Musa yi Harunaa dugine tongo, a yi e ragodo Eleyasari ma. Haruna yi faxa mɛnni, geyaan xuntagi. Na xanbi ra, Musa nun Eleyasari yi godo geyaan ma. <verse eid="NUM 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29"/>Isirayila yamaan to a kolon a Haruna bata yi faxa, e birin yi Haruna wuga xii tonge saxan.<verse eid="NUM 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila yi Kanan kaane nɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1"/>Kanan Manga Aradi naxan yi dɔxi Negewi yi, na yi a mɛ a Isirayila fama Atarimi kiraan xɔn. A yi Isirayila yɛngɛ, a yi muxuna ndee suxu. <verse eid="NUM 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2"/>Nayi, Isirayila kaane yi dɛ xuini ito tongo Alatala xa, e naxa, “Xa i nɔɔn fi nxu ma siyani ito xun na, nxu e taan birin naxɔrima nɛn fefe!” <verse eid="NUM 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3"/>Alatala yi Isirayila kaane xuiin namɛ, a yi Kanan kaane lu e nɔɔn bun ma. Isirayila kaane yi e faxa, e yi e taane kala. E yi mɛnna xili sa Xoroma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">21.3</char> <char style="fk">Horoma</char> bunna nɛɛn fa fala “Kalana.”</note><verse eid="NUM 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4"/>Isirayila kaane yi keli Horo geyaan ma, e yi siga Gbala Baan kiraan xɔn alogo e xa Edɔn yamanan mabilin. Koni yamaan yi tondi kira yi. <verse eid="NUM 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5"/>E yi lu Ala nun Musa mafalɛ e naxa, “Nanfera i nxu raminixi Misiran yamanani alogo nxu xa fa faxa tonbonni ito yi? Donse mi be! Ige mi be! Nxu mi fa tɔrɔ donseni ito xɔn!” <verse eid="NUM 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6"/>Nayi, Alatala yi saɲi xɔlɛne rasiga e xili ma, e Isirayila kaa wuyaxi xin, e faxa. <verse eid="NUM 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7"/>Yamaan yi siga Musa fɛma, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Nxu bata yulubin liga nxu to ɛ mafala, i tan nun Alatala! Nayi, i xa Alatala maxandi a xa saɲi xɔlɛni itoe masiga nxu ra.” Musa yi Alatala maxandi yamaan xa. <verse eid="NUM 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Saɲi sawurana nde rafala, i yi a singan tami kuyena nde ra. Naxan yo xinxi, xa a na mato, a kisima nɛn.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9"/>Nayi, Musa yi sulan saɲin nafala, a yi a singan tami kuyen na. Nayi, saɲin muxun naxan xinxi, xa na kanna yi sulan saɲin mato, a kisima nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila Moyaba yamanani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10"/>Isirayila kaane yi siga, e sa dɔxɔ Oboti yi. <verse eid="NUM 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11"/>E yi keli Oboti yi, e sa dɔxɔ Ye-Abarimi taa xɔnni tonbonni naxan Moyaba yɛtagi, a sogeteden binni. <verse eid="NUM 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e sa dɔxɔ Serede lanbanni. <verse eid="NUM 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e sa dɔxɔ Arinon baan dɛ, naxan danguma tonbonni Amorine konni. Arinon baan findixi Moyaba danna nan na, Moyaba nun Amorine tagi. <verse eid="NUM 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14"/>Nanara, a sɛbɛxi Alatalaa Yɛngɛne Bukun kui, a naxa, “Wahebi taan naxan Sufa yamanani, e nun xudene, Arinon baana, <verse eid="NUM 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15"/>e nun a xudedine naxan tema Ari binni, na findixi Moyaba danna nan na.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e siga xɔɲin yireni. Alatala yi a fala Musa xa mɛnni, a naxa, “Yamaan malan n xa igen so e yii.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17"/>Awa, Isirayila kaane sigini ito sa mɛnna nin:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Xɔɲinna, igen namini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">En na a sigin nasuxu!<verse eid="NUM 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18"/>Mangane bata xɔɲinna ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">yamaan yɛɛratine bata a raba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">e sɛnbɛn nun e mangaya dunganna ra!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">E yi keli tonbonni, e siga Matana yi,<verse eid="NUM 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19"/>E yi keli mɛnni, e siga Naxaliyɛli yi. E mɔn yi keli mɛnni, e siga Bamoti yi. <verse eid="NUM 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20"/>E yi keli Bamoti yi, e siga Pisiga geyaan lanbanni Moyaba yamanani tonbonna binni.<verse eid="NUM 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manga Sixɔn nun Manga Ogo</para>
  <para style="r">Sariyane 2.26-3.11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21"/>Isirayila kaane yi xɛrane rasiga a faladeni Sixɔn xa, Amorine Mangana, e naxa, <verse eid="NUM 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22"/>“Nxu waxi yamanani gidi feni. Nxu mi kiraan fatama, nxu siga xɛɛne yi hanma manpa bili nakɔne. Nxu mi xɔɲin ige minɲɛ. Nxu luun kira gbeen nan xɔn han nxu yi i ya yamanan birin yigidi.”<verse eid="NUM 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23"/>Koni, Sixɔn mi tin e xa dangu a yamanani. A yi a sofane birin malan, e fa Isirayila kaane ralandeni tonbonni. E yi Isirayila yɛngɛ Yahasi yi. <verse eid="NUM 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24"/>Isirayila kaane yi e nɔ, e yi e yamanan tongo, keli Arinon baani han Yaboko xudena siga han Amonine yamanan danna bayo Amonine yamanan danna yi makantanxi ki faɲi. <verse eid="NUM 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25"/>Isirayila yi Amorine taane birin tongo, e dɔxɔ e yi, e nun Xɛsibɔn taan nun a banxidɛne. <verse eid="NUM 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26"/>Amasɔtɔ Xɛsibɔn yi findixi Amorine manga Sixɔn ma taan nan na, xabu a Moyaba manga fonna yɛngɛ, a yi a bɔxɔn birin tongo a yii han Arinon baana. <verse eid="NUM 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27"/>Nanara, yenle naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Ɛ fa Xɛsibɔn yi! A mɔn xa ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Sixɔn taan mɔn xa yitɔn!<verse eid="NUM 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28"/>Amasɔtɔ tɛɛn bata mini Xɛsibɔn yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Sixɔn taan bata tɛɛ dɛgɛn nafa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">a yi Ari taan gan Moyaba yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">e nun mangane Arinon baan faxan na.<verse eid="NUM 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29"/>Gbalona i xa Moyaba bɔxɔna!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Ɛ bata halagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Kemosi suxure batune!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Ɛ banxulanne bata e gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">ɛ dii tɛmɛne bata findi suxu muxune ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Amorine Manga Sixɔn yii.<verse eid="NUM 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30"/>Koni en tan bata e bɔnbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">Xɛsibɔn bata kala siga han Dibon yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">En bata halagin ti siga han Nofa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">siga han Medeba yi.<verse eid="NUM 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31"/>Isirayila kaane yi dɔxɔ Amorine yamanani. <verse eid="NUM 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32"/>Musa yi xɛrane rasiga Yaasɛri taan nakɔrɔsideni wundoni. Isirayila kaane yi na taan suxu e nun a banxidɛne, e yi Amorine kedi na.<verse eid="NUM 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33"/>Na xanbi ra, e yi e firifiri, e siga Basan kiraan xɔn. Basan manga Ogo nun a sofa ganla birin yi mini e ralandeni alogo e xa e yɛngɛ Edere yi. <verse eid="NUM 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “I nama gaxu a yɛɛ ra! N na a soma nɛn i yii, e nun a sofa ganla birin nun a yamanana. I xa a liga alo i Sixɔn liga kii naxan yi, Amorine mangan naxan yi dɔxi Xɛsibɔn yi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35"/>Isirayila kaane yi Ogo faxa, e nun a diine nun a sofa ganla birin. E mi muxu yo lu a nii ra. E yi dɔxɔ a yamanani.<verse eid="NUM 21:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22"/>
  <para style="s">Moyaba mangan yi Balami xili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1"/>Isirayila kaane yi siga, e sa dɔxɔ Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi, Yurudɛn baan kidi ma Yeriko yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2"/>Siporo a dii Balaki yi a to Isirayila kaane naxan birin ligaxi Amorine ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3"/>Moyaba kaane yi gaxu Isirayila ganla yɛɛ ra, e yigitɛgɛ bayo e yi wuya han! <verse eid="NUM 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4"/>Moyaba kaane yi a fala Midiyan fonne xa, e naxa, “Yamani ito fama en nabilinna yamanane birin halagideni nɛn alo ɲingen sɛxɛn ɲanma kii naxan yi.” Siporo a dii Balaki nan yi Moyaba mangan na na waxatini. <verse eid="NUM 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5"/>A yi xɛrane rasiga Beyori a dii Balami xilideni Petori yi, Baa Gbeen dɛxɔn, a konna yi dɛnaxan na. E xa sa a fala a xa iki, e naxa, “Siyana nde bata mini Misiran yi, e bata wuya han e bɔxɔn nafe. E bata dɔxɔ n dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6"/>Yandi, fa, i fa siyani ito danga n xa, amasɔtɔ e sɛnbɛn gbo n xa. Nayi, waxatina nde n nɔɛ e yɛngɛ nɛn, n yi e kedi n ma yamanani. Amasɔtɔ n na a kolon, i na duba naxan xa, na duban sɔtɔma nɛn. I na naxan danga, na dangan sɔtɔma nɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7"/>Moyaba fonne nun Midiyan fonne yi siga e yi yiimatoon saranna xali e yii. E sa Balami fɛman li, e yi Balaki a falane yɛba a xa. <verse eid="NUM 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8"/>A yi e yabi, a naxa, “Ɛ xi be kɔɛni ito ra, n yi ɛ yabi xɔtɔnni alo Alatala na a fala n xa kii naxan yi.” Moyaba kuntigine yi lu Balami konni.<verse eid="NUM 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9"/>Ala yi fa Balami fɛma, a yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Nde muxuni itoe ra naxanye i konni?” <verse eid="NUM 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10"/>Balami yi Ala yabi, a naxa, “Siporo a dii Balaki Moyaba mangan nan e rafaxi a faladeni n xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11"/>‘Siyana nde bata keli Misiran yi, e bata wuya han e bɔxɔn nafe. Nayi, yandi, fa n mali, i yi e danga n xa. Waxatina nde n nɔɛ e yɛngɛ nɛn, n yi e kedi.’ ” <verse eid="NUM 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12"/>Ala yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “I nama siga e fɔxɔ ra. I nama siyani ito danga, amasɔtɔ n bata barakan sa e fe yi.” <verse eid="NUM 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13"/>Balami to keli xɔtɔnni, a yi a fala Balaki a kuntigine xa, a naxa, “Ɛ xɛtɛ ɛ konni, amasɔtɔ Alatala mi tinxi n xa siga ɛ fɔxɔ ra.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14"/>Moyaba kuntigine yi keli, e xɛtɛ Balaki fɛma, e yi a fala, e naxa, “Balami mi tinxi fɛ nxu fɔxɔ ra.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15"/>Balaki mɔn yi kuntigi gbɛtɛye rasiga naxanye yi wuya bonne xa, e binyen mɔn yi gbo e xa. <verse eid="NUM 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16"/>E yi sa Balami fɛman li. E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Siporo a dii Balaki naxa iki: ‘I nama tondi fɛ n konni de! <verse eid="NUM 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17"/>Amasɔtɔ n ni i binyama nɛn han! I na naxan fala n na ligama nɛn. Yandi fa, i yi fa siyani ito danga n xa.’ ” <verse eid="NUM 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18"/>Balami yi Balaki a kuntigine yabi, a naxa, “Hali Balaki a banxin fi n ma naxan nafexi gbetin nun xɛmaan na, n mi nɔɛ Alatalaa yamarin matandɛ fefe ma, n ma Ala. <verse eid="NUM 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19"/>Iki yandi, ɛ fan xa xi be to kɔɛni ito ra, n na a kolonɲɛ Alatala mɔn naxan falama n xa.” <verse eid="NUM 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20"/>Ala yi fa Balami fɛma kɔɛɛn na. A yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “Bayo muxuni itoe faxi i xiliden nin, keli, i yi siga e fɔxɔ ra. Koni n na naxan fala i xa, i xa na nan liga de!” <verse eid="NUM 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21"/>Xɔtɔnni Balami yi keli, a yi a sofali gilɛni tɔn, e nun Moyaba kuntigine birin yi siga.<verse eid="NUM 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22"/>Koni, Alaa xɔlɔn yi gbo ayi, amasɔtɔ a bata siga. Alatalaa malekan yi ti kiraan na alogo a xa a rati. Balami yi dɔxi a sofali gilɛn fari, a walikɛ firinne yi a fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23"/>Sofanla yi Alatalaa malekan to tixi kiraan xɔn, a silanfanna suxi a yii. Sofanla yi kiraan fata a so burunna ra. Balami yi sofanla bɔnbɔ alogo a xa fa kiraan xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24"/>Alatalaa malekan mɔn yi sa ti kiradin xɔn manpa bili nakɔ firinne longonna ra. Sansanna yi kiraan fɔxɔ firinne birin yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25"/>Sofanla to Alatalaa malekan to, a yi a dɛndɛn sansanna ra, a yi Balami sanna gbɛrɛxɛn sansanna ma. Balami mɔn yi a bɔnbɔ. <verse eid="NUM 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26"/>Alatalaa malekan mɔn yi siga yɛɛn na pon! A sa ti yire yigbɛtɛnxini, dangude mi yi dɛnaxan kɔmɛnna ma, a mi yi yiifanna ma. <verse eid="NUM 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27"/>Sofanla to Alatalaa malekan to, a yi a yigodo Balami bun ma. Balami yi xɔlɔ, a yi sofanla bɔnbɔ a dunganna ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28"/>Alatala yi sofanla dɛɛn fulun, sofanla yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “N nanse ligaxi i ra, alogo i xa n bɔnbɔ han sanɲa ma saxan?” <verse eid="NUM 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29"/>Balami yi sofanla yabi, a naxa, “Amasɔtɔ i bata n matandi! Xa silanfanna yi n yii nun, n yi i faxama nɛn iki sa!” <verse eid="NUM 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30"/>Sofanla yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “I ya sofanla xa mi n tan na ba, i darixi dɔxɛ naxan fari han to? N darixi ito ligɛ i ra ba?” A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Ɛn-ɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31"/>Alatala yi Balami yɛɛne rabi, a yi Alatalaa malekan to tixi kiraan na, a silanfanna a yii. Balami yi a xinbi sin, a yi a yɛtagin lan bɔxɔn ma. <verse eid="NUM 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32"/>Alatalaa malekan yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanfera i i ya sofanla bɔnbɔxi sanɲa ma saxan? N bata fa, n xa i rati, amasɔtɔ kirani ito i xalin gbalon nin. <verse eid="NUM 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33"/>Sofanla bata n to, a yi n dɛ masara sanɲa ma saxan. Xa na mi yi a ra nun, n bata yi i faxa nun, koni n yi a tan luma nɛn a nii ra.” <verse eid="NUM 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34"/>Balami yi a fala Alatalaa malekan xa, a naxa, “N bata yulubin liga! N mi yi a kolon a i tixi n yɛɛ ra kiraan na. Iki, xa sigatini ito mi rafan i ma, n xa xɛtɛ.” <verse eid="NUM 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35"/>Alatalaa malekan yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “Siga muxuni itoe fɔxɔ ra. Koni n na naxan fala i xa, i xa na nan fala tun!” Balami nun Balaki a kuntigine yi siga.<verse eid="NUM 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36"/>Balaki to a mɛ a Balami bata fa, a yi siga a ralandeni Moyaba taana nde yi naxan Arinon baan dɛ, a yamanan danna ra. <verse eid="NUM 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37"/>Balaki yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “N mi yi i xilima ba? Nanfera i mi fa n fɛma? I yi mirixi nɛn a n mi nɔɛ i binyɛ ba?” <verse eid="NUM 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38"/>Balami yi a fala Balaki xa, a naxa, “I mi n to? N bata fa. Koni n nɔɛ nanse falɛ i xa? Ala na naxan fala n xa, fɔ n xa na nan fala.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39"/>Balami nun Balaki yi siga Kiriyati-Husoti yi. <verse eid="NUM 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40"/>Balaki yi ɲingene nun yɛxɛɛne ba saraxan na, a yi a subena nde so Balami nun kuntigine yii naxanye yi a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="NUM 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41"/>Xɔtɔnni, Balaki yi Balami tongo a yi te a ra Bamoti-Baali geyaan fari, a yamaan fɔxɔ kedenna toɛ dɛnaxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 22:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1"/>Balami yi a fala Balaki xa, a naxa, “Saraxa gande solofere rafala n xa be, i yi tura solofere nun konton solofere yitɔn n xa.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2"/>Balami naxan fala, Balaki yi na liga. Balaki nun Balami yi tura keden nun konton keden ba saraxan na saraxa gandene birin fari. <verse eid="NUM 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3"/>Balami yi a fala Balaki xa, a naxa, “Ti i ya saraxa gan daxine fɛma be. N tan xa n masiga i ra. Waxatina nde Alatala fama nɛn n fɛma. A na naxan yita n na, n na a ralima i ma nɛn.” A yi siga geyana nde xuntagi. <verse eid="NUM 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4"/>Ala yi fa Balami ralan. Balami yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “N bata saraxa gande solofere rafala, n bata tura keden nun konton keden ba saraxan na e birin fari.” <verse eid="NUM 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5"/>Alatala yi falan so Balami dɛ, a naxa, “Xɛtɛ Balaki fɛma, i yi ito fala a xa.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6"/>A yi xɛtɛ a fɛma. A yi tixi a saraxa gan daxine dɛxɔn e nun Moyaba kuntigine birin. <verse eid="NUM 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7"/>Balami yi waliyiya falane ti, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Balaki bata n nafa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">sa keli Arami yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Moyaba mangan bata n nafa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">sa keli sogeteden geyane ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">A yi a fala, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Fa, i fa Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna danga n xa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">I fa gbalo falane ti Isirayila bɔnsɔnna xili ma!”<verse eid="NUM 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8"/>Koni, n tan xa ne danga di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Ala mi naxanye dangaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">N tan xa gbalo falane ti ne xili ma di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Alatala mi gbalon nagidixi naxanye ma?<verse eid="NUM 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9"/>N tixi gɛmɛne xuntagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">n na e toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">N tixi geyane fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">n na e matoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Yamani ito a danna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">a mi siyaan bonne yɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna gbo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">alo gbangbanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">nde nɔɛ Isirayila kaane fɔxɔ kedenna naaninden yatɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">N fan xa faxa tinxin muxune yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">N naɲanna xa liga alo e gbeena!<verse eid="NUM 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11"/>Balaki yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “I nanse ligaxi n na? N faxi i ra nɛn alogo i xa n yaxune danga, koni i dubama e xa nɛn tun!” <verse eid="NUM 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12"/>A yi a yabi, a naxa, “Alatala naxan soxi n dɛ, n mi lan n na fala ba?” <verse eid="NUM 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13"/>Balaki yi a fala a xa, a naxa, “En siga yire gbɛtɛ yi, i mɔn sa e toɛ dɛnaxan yi. I e fɔxɔ kedenna toma nɛn. I mi a birin toɛ. I yi e danga n xa mɛnni.”<verse eid="NUM 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14"/>A yi a xali Sofimi a xɛɛn ma Pisiga geyaan xuntagi. A yi saraxa gande solofere rafala mɛnni, a yi tura keden nun konton keden ba saraxa gandene birin fari. <verse eid="NUM 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15"/>Balami yi a fala Balaki xa, a naxa, “Ti i ya saraxa gan daxine dɛxɔn be, n tan xa siga Ala ralandeni mɛnni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16"/>Alatala yi fa Balami yɛtagi, a yi falan so a dɛ, a naxa, “Xɛtɛ Balaki fɛma, i yi ito fala a xa.” <verse eid="NUM 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17"/>A yi xɛtɛ a fɛma, a yi tixi a saraxa gan daxine dɛxɔn e nun Moyaba kuntigine. Balaki yi a maxɔdin, a naxa, “Alatala nanse falaxi?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18"/>Balami yi waliyiya falane ti, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">Balaki keli, i n xuiin mɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">I tuli mati n na Siporo a dii xɛmɛna!<verse eid="NUM 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19"/>Muxu mi Ala ra, a wulen fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Adamadi mi a ra, a nimisa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">A naxan falaxi, a mi na ligɛ ba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">A na falan naxan ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">a mi na rakamalɛ ba?<verse eid="NUM 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20"/>A duban nan soxi n yii lan e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">A barakan sa e yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">N mi nɔɛ na maxɛtɛ.<verse eid="NUM 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21"/>A mi fe ɲaxin toma Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">A mi fe xɔlɛn toma Isirayila yi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Alatala, e Ala e tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">E fan a mangayaan matɔxɔma.<verse eid="NUM 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22"/>Ala nan faxi e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">sa keli Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">a nɔɔn tima e xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">alo burunna ɲingena.<verse eid="NUM 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23"/>Kɔɛrayaan mi sese nɔɛ Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Serikariyaan mi nɔɛ sese ra Isirayila xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">A falama nɛn e ma na waxatini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">“A mato, Ala naxan ligama!”<verse eid="NUM 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24"/>Siyani ito kelima nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">alo yatana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">E bata e yitɔn alo yatana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">naxan mi a sama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">fɔ a na xɔɔyi seen don,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">fɔ a na sube suxine wunla min.<verse eid="NUM 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25"/>Balaki yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “Xa i mi a dangama, hali i nama duba a xa de!” <verse eid="NUM 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26"/>Balami yi Balaki yabi, a naxa, “N mi yi a fala i xa ba, n naxa, ‘Alatala na naxan fala, n na nan ligama?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27"/>Balaki yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “En siga yire gbɛtɛ yi. Yanyina nde Ala tinma nɛn i xa e danga n xa mɛnni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28"/>Balaki yi Balami xali Peyori geyaan xuntagi, dɛnaxan yɛɛ rafindixi tonbonna ma. <verse eid="NUM 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29"/>Balami yi a fala Balaki xa, a naxa, “Saraxa gande solofere rafala n xa be, i yi tura keden nun konton keden yitɔn n xa.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30"/>Balami naxan fala, Balaki yi na liga. A yi turaan nun kontonna ba saraxan na saraxa gandene birin fari.<verse eid="NUM 23:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1"/>Balami yi a to fa fala a yi rafan Alatala ma a xa duba Isirayila xa. Nayi, a mi kɔɛraya feene rawali alo waxatin danguxine yi. Koni a yi a yɛɛ rafindi tonbonna binni. <verse eid="NUM 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2"/>Balami to a yɛɛne rakeli, a yi Isirayila kaane to malanxi bɔnsɔn yɛɛn ma. Nayi, Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin yi godo a ma. <verse eid="NUM 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3"/>Balami yi waliyiya falane ti, a naxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">N tan Balami, Beyori a dii xɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">n tan naxan feene fixɛn toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">n ma falan ni i ra:<verse eid="NUM 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4"/>N ni ito nan falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">n tan naxan Alaa falane mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">naxan fe toon tima alo xiyene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">fata Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">naxan a xinbi sinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">a yɛɛne yi rabi.<verse eid="NUM 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5"/>Yaxuba bɔnsɔnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">ɛ tan Isirayila kaane!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">Ɛ dɔxɔdene tofan!<verse eid="NUM 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6"/>E wuya bɔxɔn fari alo baane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">alo nakɔne baan dɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">alo Alatala sansi xiri faɲin naxanye sixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">alo suman wudine igene dɛ.<verse eid="NUM 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7"/>E ige ramaradene rafema nɛn ken!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">E sansine ige sa a faɲin na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">E mangan gboma nɛn Manga Agaga xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">a mangayaan sɛnbɛn gboma ayi nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8"/>Ala nan faxi e ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">sa keli Misiran yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">a nɔɔn tima e xa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">alo burunna ɲingena.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">E siyane nɔma nɛn</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">naxanye e yɛngɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">e yi e bun e xalimakunle ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">e yi e xɔnne yigira.<verse eid="NUM 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9"/>E e sama nɛn alo yatane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Nde susuɛ e rakelɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Naxan na duba i xa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Ala xa na kanna baraka!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Naxan na i danga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Ala xa na kanna danga!<verse eid="NUM 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10"/>Balaki yi xɔlɔ Balami ma han! A yi a yiine bɔnbɔ, a yi a fala Balami xa, a naxa, “N ni i xilixi nɛn alogo i xa n yaxune danga, koni i tan bata duba e xa sanɲa ma saxan. <verse eid="NUM 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11"/>Iki keli be, siga i konni. N yi a ragidixi nɛn n xa i saren fi han, koni Alatala bata i kuma!” <verse eid="NUM 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12"/>Balami yi Balaki yabi, a naxa, “Anu, n na a fala nɛn i ya xɛrane xa, n naxa, <verse eid="NUM 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13"/>‘Hali Balaki a banxin so n yii naxan nafexi gbetin nun xɛmaan na, n mi nɔɛ Alatalaa yamarin matandɛ fefe ma. Alatala na naxan fala, fɔ n xa na nan fala.’ <verse eid="NUM 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14"/>Awa iki, n bata siga n kon kaane fɛma. Koni ɛ tuli mati. N xa i rakolon siyani ito naxan ligama i ya yamaan na waxati famatɔni.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15"/>Balami yi waliyiya falane ti, a naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">N tan Balami, Beyori a dii xɛmɛna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">n tan naxan feene fixɛn toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">n ma falan ni i ra:<verse eid="NUM 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16"/>N ni ito nan falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">n tan naxan Alaa falane mɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">naxan Kore Xɔnna Ala wundo feene kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">naxan fe toon tima alo xiyena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">fata Ala Sɛnbɛ Kanna ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">naxan a xinbi sinma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">a yɛɛne yi rabi.<verse eid="NUM 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17"/>N na a toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">koni iki mi a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">N na a toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">koni a mɔn makuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Sarena nde minima nɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">mangan kelima nɛn Isirayila yamanani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">A Moyaba yamanan mangane yɛngɛma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">a Seti bɔnsɔnna nɔ.<verse eid="NUM 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18"/>A Edɔn yamanan tongoma nɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">e nun Seyiri yamanana, a yaxuna.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Koni Isirayila sɛnbɛn gboma ayi nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19"/>Nɔ tiin minima nɛn Yaxuba bɔnsɔnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">a yi e taane muxu dɔnxɛne raxɔri.<verse eid="NUM 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20"/>Balami yi Amalɛkine to. A yi waliyiya falan ti, a naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Amalɛki nan yi yamana singen na dunuɲa yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">koni dɔnxɛn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">a tununma nɛn habadan!<verse eid="NUM 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21"/>A mɔn yi Keni kaane to. A yi waliyiya falan ti, a naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">I dɔxɔden natangaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">alo xɔliin naxan a tɛɛn saxi faranna ra.<verse eid="NUM 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22"/>Koni Asuri na ɛ suxu konyiyani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Kenine ɲanma nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23"/>A mɔn yi waliyiya falan ti, a naxa:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">Ee! Ala na ito liga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">nde luyɛ a nii ra?<verse eid="NUM 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24"/>Kunkine kelima nɛn Sipiri yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">e yi Asuri rayarabi, e nun Eberi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">Koni e fan faxama nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25"/>Balami yi keli, a xɛtɛ a konni. Balaki fan yi siga.<verse eid="NUM 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane yi suxurene batu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1"/>Isirayila kaane yi dɔxi Sitimi yi waxatin naxan yi, xɛmɛne yi lu yalunyaan ligɛ e nun Moyaba ɲaxanle. <verse eid="NUM 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2"/>E yi xɛmɛne xilima e suxure kideni. Yamaan yi e dɛge, e yi e xinbi sin e suxurene bun ma. <verse eid="NUM 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3"/>Nayi, Isirayila kaane yi Baali-Peyori batu. Nanara, Alatala yi xɔlɔ e ma han!<verse eid="NUM 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Yamaan yɛɛratine birin suxu, i yi e faxa, i yi e singan Alatala yɛtagi sogen na, alogo Alatala xa ba xɔlɔxi Isirayila ma.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5"/>Musa yi a fala Isirayila kitisane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ birin xa muxune faxa naxanye Baali-Peyori batuxi.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6"/>Isirayila xɛmɛna nde yi fa Midiyan ɲaxanla nde ra a konni, Musa nun Isirayila yamaan birin yɛtagi. Yamaan birin yi wugama Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7"/>Na ma, Finexasi, Eleyasari a dii xɛmɛna, saraxarali Harunaa dii xɛmɛna, na yi keli yamaan yɛ, a yi tanban tongo. <verse eid="NUM 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8"/>A yi siga Isirayila kaan fɔxɔ ra a bubuni. A yi e firinna sɔxɔn tanban na sanɲa ma kedenni e kuini. Fitina furen naxan yi Isirayila yi, na yi dan. <verse eid="NUM 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9"/>Muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun naanin nan faxa na furen ma.<verse eid="NUM 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11"/>“Finexasi, Eleyasari a dii xɛmɛna, saraxarali Harunaa dii xɛmɛna, na bata n ma xɔlɔn ba Isirayila ma. Amasɔtɔ n ma xɔxɔlɔnna nan soxi a yi. Na ma, n mi Isirayila kaane raxɔrima xɔxɔlɔnni. <verse eid="NUM 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12"/>Nanara, i xa a fala a xa, n bata tin bɔɲɛ xunbenla layirin tongɛ a xa. <verse eid="NUM 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13"/>Na layirin luma a tan xa nɛn e nun a yixɛtɛne, n yi e findi saraxaraline ra habadan. Amasɔtɔ a kunfa nɛn a Ala xɔn, a yi n solona Isirayila xa.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14"/>Isirayila xɛmɛn naxan nun Midiyan ɲaxanla faxa, a yi xili nɛn Simiri, Salu a dii xɛmɛna. Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnna denbayana nde kuntigin nan yi a ra. <verse eid="NUM 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15"/>Midiyan ɲaxanla naxan faxa, a yi xili nɛn Kosibi, Suru a dii tɛmɛna. Midiyan xabilana ndee mangan nan yi a ra.<verse eid="NUM 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17"/>“Ɛ xa Midiyan kaane yatɛ ɛ yaxune ra, ɛ yi e yɛngɛ. <verse eid="NUM 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18"/>Amasɔtɔ e bata findi ɛ yaxune ra e to ɛ yanfa Peyori yi, Kosibi a fe yi, e xabila mangana nde a dii tɛmɛna, ɛ naxan faxa, na feen to fitina furen nafa.” <verse eid="NUM 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 25:19"/>Na fitina furen yi dangu.<verse eid="NUM 25:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1"/>A to dangu, Alatala yi a fala Musa nun Haruna dii Eleyasari xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2"/>“Ɛ Isirayila yamaan tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, e denbaya yɛɛn ma, naxanye birin nɔɛ yɛngɛn soɛ.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari yi falan ti e xa Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛni Yurudɛn baan dɛ Yeriko taan yɛtagi. E naxa, <verse eid="NUM 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4"/>“Xɛmɛne xa tɛngɛ naxanye barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, alo Alatala a yamarixi Musa ma kii naxan yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Isirayila kaan naxanye minixi Misiran yamanani, ne ni itoe ra:<verse eid="NUM 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5"/>Isirayila dii singe Rubɛn yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Xanɔki xabilana, Xanɔki yixɛtɛne; Palu xabilana, Palu yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6"/>Xesirɔn xabilana, Xesirɔn yixɛtɛne; e nun Karimi xabilana, Karimi yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7"/>Rubɛn xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge naanin e nun saxan kɛmɛ solofere tonge saxan. <verse eid="NUM 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8"/>Eliyabi nan yi Palu a dii xɛmɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9"/>Eliyabi a dii xɛmɛne nan itoe ra: Nemuweli, Datan e nun Abirami. Datan nun Abirami yi findixi yamaan kuntigine nan na naxanye murutɛ Musa nun Haruna xili ma, e sa Kora muxune fari, e to murutɛ Alatala xili ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10"/>Bɔxɔn yi rabi, a yi e nun Kora gerun e bode xɔn. Tɛɛn yi a fɔxɔ ra birane muxu kɛmɛ firin tonge suulun gan. Na yi findi misaala ra yamaan xa. <verse eid="NUM 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11"/>Koni, Kora yixɛtɛne birin mi faxa.<verse eid="NUM 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12"/>Simeyɔn yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Nemuweli xabilana, Nemuweli yixɛtɛne; Yamin xabilana, Yamin yixɛtɛne; Yakin xabilana, Yakin yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13"/>Sera xabilana, Sera yixɛtɛne; e nun Sayuli xabilana, Sayuli yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14"/>Simeyɔn xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun firin kɛmɛ firin.<verse eid="NUM 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15"/>Gadi yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Sefɔn xabilana, Sefɔn yixɛtɛne; Xagi xabilana, Xagi yixɛtɛne; Suni xabilana, Suni yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16"/>Osini xabilana, Osini yixɛtɛne; Eriya xabilana, Eriya yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17"/>Arodi xabilana, Arodi yixɛtɛne; e nun Areli xabilana, Areli yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18"/>Gadi xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge naanin kɛmɛ suulun.<verse eid="NUM 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19"/>Eri nun Onan nan yi Yuda a dii xɛmɛne ra, koni Eri nun Onan bata yi faxa Kanan yamanani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20"/>Yuda yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Selaxa xabilana, Selaxa yixɛtɛne; Peresi xabilana, Peresi yixɛtɛne; e nun Sera xabilana, Sera yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21"/>Peresi yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Xesirɔn xabilana, Xesirɔn yixɛtɛne; e nun Xamuli xabilana, Xamuli yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22"/>Yuda xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge solofere wuli sennin kɛmɛ suulun.<verse eid="NUM 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23"/>Isakari yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Tola xabilana, Tola yixɛtɛne; Puwa xabilana, Puwa yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24"/>Yasubu xabilana, Yasubu yixɛtɛne; e nun Simiron xabilana, Simiron yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25"/>Isakari xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge sennin wuli naanin kɛmɛ saxan.<verse eid="NUM 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26"/>Sabulon yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Seredi xabilana, Seredi yixɛtɛne; Elon xabilana, Elon yixɛtɛne; e nun Yalele xabilana, Yalele yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27"/>Sabulon xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge sennin kɛmɛ suulun.<verse eid="NUM 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28"/>Yusufu yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Manase nun Efirami. <verse eid="NUM 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29"/>Manase yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Makiri xabilana, Makiri yixɛtɛne. Makiri nan Galadi sɔtɔ. E nun Galadi xabilana, Galadi yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30"/>Galadi yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Yeseri xabilana, Yeseri yixɛtɛne; Xeleki xabilana, Xeleki yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31"/>Asirɛli xabilana, Asirɛli yixɛtɛne; Siken xabilana, Siken yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32"/>Sɛmida xabilana, Sɛmida yixɛtɛne; e nun Xeferi xabilana, Xeferi yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33"/>Selofexadi, Xeferi a dii xɛmɛn mi dii xɛmɛ sɔtɔ, koni a dii tɛmɛne sɔtɔ nɛn. Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne xinle ni itoe ra: Maxala, Noha, Xɔgala, Milika e nun Tirisa. <verse eid="NUM 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34"/>Manase xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli firin kɛmɛ solofere.<verse eid="NUM 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35"/>Efirami yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Sutela xabilana, Sutela yixɛtɛne; Bekeri xabilana, Bekeri yixɛtɛne; e nun Taxani xabilana, Taxani yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36"/>Sutela yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Eran xabilana, Eran yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37"/>Efirami xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge saxan wuli firin kɛmɛ suulun. Yusufu yixɛtɛne nan ne ra xabila yɛɛn ma.<verse eid="NUM 26:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38"/>Bunyamin yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Bela xabilana, Bela yixɛtɛne; Asibeli xabilana, Asibeli yixɛtɛne; Axirami xabilana, Axirami yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39"/>Sufami xabilana, Sufami yixɛtɛne; e nun Xufami xabilana, Xufami yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40"/>Bela yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Arade nun Naman. Arade xabilana, Arade yixɛtɛne; e nun Naman xabilana, Naman yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41"/>Bunyamin xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli suulun kɛmɛ sennin.<verse eid="NUM 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42"/>Dan yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Suxami xabilana, Suxami yixɛtɛne. Dan xabila keden nan yi na ra. <verse eid="NUM 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43"/>Suxami xabilan nan na ra, e malanxina muxu wuli tonge sennin wuli naanin kɛmɛ naanin.<verse eid="NUM 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44"/>Aseri yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Yimina xabilana, Yimina yixɛtɛne; Yisiwi xabilana, Yisiwi yixɛtɛne; e nun Beriya xabilana, Beriya yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45"/>Beriya yixɛtɛne ni i ra: Xeberi xabilana, Xeberi yixɛtɛne; e nun Malikili xabilana, Malikili yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46"/>Aseri a dii tɛmɛn yi xili nɛn Sera. <verse eid="NUM 26:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47"/>Aseri xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge suulun wuli saxan kɛmɛ naanin.<verse eid="NUM 26:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48"/>Nafatali yixɛtɛne ni i ra xabila yɛɛn ma: Yaseli xabilana, Yaseli yixɛtɛne; Guni xabilana, Guni yixɛtɛne; <verse eid="NUM 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49"/>Yeseri xabilana, Yeseri yixɛtɛne; e nun Silen xabilana, Silen yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50"/>Nafatali xabilane nan ne ra, e malanxina, muxu wuli tonge naanin wuli suulun kɛmɛ naanin.<verse eid="NUM 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51"/>Isirayila xɛmɛn naxanye yatɛ, muxu wuli kɛmɛ sennin e nun keden kɛmɛ solofere tonge saxan.<verse eid="NUM 26:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53"/>Yamanani taxunma nɛn e tagi e kɛɛn na, fata muxune yatɛn na. <verse eid="NUM 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54"/>Naxanye wuya, i xa kɛɛ gbeen so ne yii. Naxanye mi wuya, i xa kɛɛ xurin so ne yii. Birin kɛɛn xa lan muxune yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 26:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55"/>Koni yamanan xa yitaxun masɛnsɛnna nan xɔn. E a sɔtɔma nɛn e kɛɛn na fata e benbane bɔnsɔnne xinle ra. <verse eid="NUM 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56"/>Birin kɛɛ bɔxɔni taxunma masɛnsɛnna nan xɔn, bɔnsɔn gbeene nun bɔnsɔn xurine yɛ.<verse eid="NUM 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxuni itoe nan tɛngɛ e xabila yɛɛn ma: Gɛrisɔn xabilana, Gɛrisɔn yixɛtɛne; Kehati xabilana, Kehati yixɛtɛne; e nun Merari xabilana, Merari yixɛtɛne. <verse eid="NUM 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58"/>Lewi bɔnsɔnna xabila gbɛtɛn ni i ra: Libini xabilana, Xebiron xabilana, Maxali xabilana, Musi xabilana, e nun Kora xabilana. Kehati nan Amirama sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59"/>Amirama a ɲaxanla yi xili nɛn “Yokebedi,” Lewi a dii tɛmɛna, naxan bari Misiran yi. E nun Amirama nan Haruna nun Musa sɔtɔ, e nun Mariyama, e magilɛna. <verse eid="NUM 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60"/>Haruna nan Nadaba nun Abihu nun Eleyasari nun Itamara sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61"/>Koni Nadaba nun Abihu faxa nɛn, e to tɛɛ daxataren xali Alatala yɛtagi.<verse eid="NUM 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62"/>E Lewi xɛmɛn naxanye tɛngɛ, naxanye barin bata yi dangu kike kedenna ra, ne lan muxu wuli mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan nan ma. E mi tɛngɛ Isirayila kaan bonne yɛ, amasɔtɔ e mi yi lan e xa kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔ e yɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari ne nan tɛngɛ Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi Yurudɛn baan dɛ Yeriko taan yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64"/>Musa nun saraxarali Haruna Isirayila kaan naxanye tɛngɛ Sinayi tonbonni, na sese mi yi itoe yɛ. <verse eid="NUM 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65"/>Amasɔtɔ Alatala bata yi a fala ne ma, a e faxama nɛn tonbonni. Keden mi lu fɔ Yefune a dii Kalebi nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe.<verse eid="NUM 26:65"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27"/>
  <para style="s">Kɛɛ fena sariyan dii tɛmɛne xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1"/>Awa, Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne yi fa, Xeferi a dii xɛmɛna, Galadi mamandenna. Manase a dii Makiri nan Galadi sɔtɔ Manase bɔnsɔnni, Yusufu a dii xɛmɛna. E xinle ni itoe ra: Maxala nun Noha nun Xɔgala nun Milika e nun Tirisa. <verse eid="NUM 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2"/>E yi fa Naralan Bubun so dɛɛn na Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari nun mangane nun yamaan birin yɛtagi. E naxa, <verse eid="NUM 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3"/>“Nxu baba bata faxa tonbonni. A mi yi Kora ganla yɛ naxanye yi murutɛxi Alatala xili ma, koni a faxaxi a yɛtɛɛn yulubin nan ma, dii xɛmɛ mi yi a yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4"/>Nanfera nxu baba xinla lɔyɛ ayi a xabilani, bayo dii xɛmɛ to mi a yii ba? Ɛ kɛɛna nde so nxu yii nxu baba ngaxakedenne tagi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5"/>Musa yi siga e kiti feen maxɔdinna tideni Alatala ma.<verse eid="NUM 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7"/>“Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne ɲɔndi. Kɛɛ bɔxɔna nde so e yii e baba ngaxakedenne tagi. I lan i yi e baba kɛɛn so e yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8"/>A fala Isirayila kaane xa, i naxa, ‘Xa muxuna nde faxa a mi dii xɛmɛ lu, ɛ xa a kɛɛn so a dii tɛmɛn yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9"/>Xa dii tɛmɛ mi a yii, ɛ xa a kɛɛn so a ngaxakeden xɛmɛmane yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10"/>Xa a ngaxakeden mi na, ɛ xa a kɛɛn so a baba ngaxakeden xɛmɛmane yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11"/>Xa a baba ngaxakeden mi na, ɛ xa a kɛɛn so a bari bodena nde yii a xabilani, a yi findi a gbeen na. A findima kiti sa sariyan nan na Isirayila kaane xa, Alatala naxan yamarixi Musa ma.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yosuwe yi sugandi yamaan yɛɛratiin na</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Sariyane 31.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Te Abarimi geyani ito fari, i yi bɔxɔn mato n naxan so Isirayila yii. <verse eid="NUM 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13"/>I na a mato, i laxirayama nɛn, alo i tada Haruna. <verse eid="NUM 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14"/>Amasɔtɔ ɛ bata n ma yamarin matandi, yamaan murutɛ waxatin naxan yi Sini tonbonni igen dɛ. I mi n ma sariɲanna binya e yɛtagi, e to yi igen maxɔdinma.” Meriba igene nan yi ne ra Kadesi yi Sini tonbonni.<verse eid="NUM 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15"/>Musa yi a fala Alatala xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16"/>“Alatala, Ala naxan niin biraxi adamadiine birin yi, i xa muxuna nde ti yamani ito xun na <verse eid="NUM 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17"/>naxan nɔɛ tiyɛ a yɛɛ ra a feen birin yi. Alatalaa yamaan nama lu alo xuruseene xuruse raba mi naxanye xun na.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, “Nunu a dii Yosuwe tongo, n ma Nii Sariɲanxin naxan yi, i yi i yii sa a fari. <verse eid="NUM 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19"/>I yi a ti saraxarali Eleyasari nun yamaan birin yɛtagi, i yi a findi yɛɛratiin na e yɛɛ xɔri. <verse eid="NUM 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20"/>I yi i sɛnbɛna nde so a yii, alogo Isirayila yamaan birin xa a xuiin suxu. <verse eid="NUM 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21"/>A ti saraxarali Eleyasari yɛtagi, alogo a xa kiti sa feen maxɔdinne ti a xa, Yurima masɛnsɛn ti seen na Alatala yɛtagi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">27.21</char> <char style="fk">Yurima nun Tumin</char> masɛnsɛn ti seene fe sɛbɛxi Xɔrɔyaan 28.30 kui. Saraxaraline yi masɛnsɛnna tima ne nan na alogo e xa Ala sagoon kolon.</note> Yosuwe nun Isirayila yamaan birin Eleyasari a yamarine suxuma nɛn e feene birin yi.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22"/>Musa yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari kii naxan yi. A yi Yosuwe tongo, a yi a ti saraxarali Eleyasari nun yamaan birin yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23"/>A yi a yiine sa a fari, a yi a findi yɛɛratiin na, alo Alatala a fala e xa kii naxan yi fata Musa ra.<verse eid="NUM 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28"/>
  <para style="s">Sanle nun waxatine saraxane</para>
  <para style="r">Xɔrɔyaan 29.38-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2"/>“Yamarini ito fi Isirayila kaane ma, i naxa, ‘Ɛ fa n kise donseene ra e waxati saxine yi, naxanye ralima n ma tɛɛn na naxanye xirin nafan n ma.’ <verse eid="NUM 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3"/>Ito fala e xa, i naxa, ‘Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, ɛ fa yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna firin na Alatala xɔn, fɛ mi naxanye ra saraxa gan daxin na naxan nalima a ma tɛɛn na waxatin birin. <verse eid="NUM 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4"/>Yɛxɛɛ keden xa ba xɔtɔnni, a firindena fitirin ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5"/>A bama nɛn e nun a bogise saraxana, murutu fuɲin kilo saxan naxan namulanxi oliwi bogi dinxine turen litiri keden nun a tagiin na. <verse eid="NUM 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6"/>Saraxa gan daxini ito bama nɛn waxatin birin alo a liga Sinayi geyaan fari kii naxan yi. A ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn nan na, a xirin yi rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7"/>Yɛxɛɛn bama nɛn e nun a minse saraxana, wudi bogi igen litiri keden e nun a tagi. I xa minse saraxan bɔxɔn Alatala xa yire sariɲanxini. <verse eid="NUM 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8"/>Yɛxɛɛn firinden bama fitirin nan ma, e nun a bogise saraxana e nun a minse saraxana alo i naxan bama xɔtɔnni. A ralima Alatala ma tɛɛn nan na, a xirin yi rafan a ma.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9"/>“ ‘Matabu Lɔxɔni, yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ kedenna firin xa ba saraxan na, fɛ mi naxanye ra, e nun e bogise saraxane, murutu fuɲin kilo sennin naxan namulanxi turen na e nun e minse saraxana. <verse eid="NUM 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10"/>Na saraxa gan daxine xa ba Matabu Lɔxɔne birin yi, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun a minse saraxana.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11"/>“ ‘Kike nɛnɛn fɔlɔna, ɛ xa tura bulan firin ba saraxa gan daxin na Alatala xa, e nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere, fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12"/>Xuruseene birin bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲina naxan namulanxi turen na, bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden lanma murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin nan ma. Kontonna, kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13"/>Konton bulanna, kilo saxan naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxan na. Saraxa gan daxin na a ra naxan nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, a xirin yi rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14"/>Ɲinge keden bama nɛn e nun a minse saraxana, wudi bogi igen litiri saxan. Kontonna gbeena, litiri firin. Yɛxɛɛ diina, litiri keden nun a tagi. Saraxa gan daxin na a ra naxan bama kike nɛnɛne birin na ɲɛɛn bun. <verse eid="NUM 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na Alatala xa, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Saraxaraline 23.5-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16"/>“ ‘Ɲɛɛn kike singen xii fu nun naaninna, ɛ xa Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla raba Alatala xa.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17"/>“ ‘Kikeni ito xii fu nun suulunde lɔxɔni, sanla yi fɔlɔ. Ɛ xa buru ratetaren don xii solofere. <verse eid="NUM 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18"/>Sanla xii singe lɔxɔni, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ na lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19"/>Ɛ xa tura bulan firin nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere ba saraxa gan daxin na fɛ mi naxanye ra. E rali Alatala ma tɛɛn nan na. <verse eid="NUM 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20"/>Xuruseene bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na, bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden lanma murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin nan ma. Kontonna, kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21"/>Yɛxɛɛ soloferene, kilo saxan saxan. <verse eid="NUM 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na Ala solona seen na ɛ xa. <verse eid="NUM 28:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23"/>Na birin sama lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxan nan fari naxan bama xɔtɔnni. <verse eid="NUM 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24"/>Sanla xii soloferene birin yi, ɛ xa na kise donseene nan nali tɛɛn na, e xirin yi rafan Alatala ma, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxane nun minse saraxane fari. <verse eid="NUM 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25"/>Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, ɛ mɔn yi yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ na lɔxɔni.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Saraxaraline 23.15-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26"/>“ ‘Se Xaba Singen sali lɔxɔni, ɛ na fa bogise singene saraxane ra Alatala xɔn Xunsagine Sanla waxatini, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 28:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27"/>Ɛ xa tura bulan firin nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere ba saraxa gan daxin na, a xirin yi rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 28:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28"/>Xuruseene bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na, bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden lanma murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin nan ma. Kontonna, kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29"/>Yɛxɛɛ soloferene, kilo saxan saxan. <verse eid="NUM 28:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na Ala solona seen na ɛ xa. <verse eid="NUM 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31"/>Na saraxane bama nɛn e nun e minse saraxane. E sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine nun e bogise saraxane fari. Ɛ xa xuruseene ba fɛ mi naxanye ra e nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29"/>
  <para style="s">Saraxane Xɔtane Sanli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Saraxaraline 23.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1"/>“ ‘Kike solofereden xi singe lɔxɔni, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ, koni ɛ xa xɔtane fe na lɔxɔni. <verse eid="NUM 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2"/>Ɛ xa tura bulan keden nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere ba saraxa gan daxin na, fɛ mi naxanye ra. A xirin yi rafan Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3"/>Xuruseene bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na, bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden lanma murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin nan ma. Kontonna, kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4"/>Yɛxɛɛ soloferene, kilo saxan saxan. <verse eid="NUM 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na Ala solona seen na ɛ xa. <verse eid="NUM 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6"/>Saraxan ne sama kike nɛnɛn saraxane nun lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxane nan fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun minse saraxane naxan falaxi sariyani. Saraxane nan ne ra naxanye nalima Alatala ma tɛɛn na, e xirin yi rafan a ma.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ala solona lɔxɔn saraxane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Saraxaraline 23.26-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7"/>“ ‘Kike solofereden xii fude lɔxɔni, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ yi sun. Ɛ nama wali yo kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8"/>Ɛ xa tura bulan keden nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere ba saraxa gan daxin na Alatala xa fɛ mi naxanye ra, a xirin yi rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9"/>Xuruseene bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na, bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden lanma murutu fuɲin kilo solomanaanin nan ma. Kontonna, kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 29:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10"/>Yɛxɛɛ soloferene, kilo saxan saxan. <verse eid="NUM 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa Ala solona saraxan fari e nun lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bubu Kui Sanla</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Saraxaraline 23.33-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12"/>“ ‘Kike solofereden xii fu nun suulunde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa yamaan xili malan sariɲanxini. Ɛ nama ɛ wanle kɛ. Ɛ xa sanla raba Alatala xa xii solofere. <verse eid="NUM 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13"/>Xii singe lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan fu nun saxan nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba saraxa gan daxin na Alatala xa, fɛ mi naxanye ra. A ralima a ma tɛɛn nan na, a xirin yi rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14"/>E bama nɛn e nun murutu fuɲin naxan namulanxi turen na bogise saraxana. Ɲinge keden kilo solomanaanin, kontonna kilo sennin. <verse eid="NUM 29:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15"/>Yɛxɛɛ fu nun naaninne, kilo saxan saxan. <verse eid="NUM 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17"/>“ ‘Xii firinde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan fu nun firin nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20"/>“ ‘Xii saxande lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan fu nun keden nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23"/>“ ‘Xii naaninde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan fu nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26"/>“ ‘Xii suulunde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan solomanaanin nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛne ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29"/>“ ‘Xii senninde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan solomasɛxɛ nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32"/>“ ‘Xii soloferede lɔxɔni, ɛ xa tura bulan solofere nun konton firin nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna fu nun naanin ba fɛ mi naxanye ra. <verse eid="NUM 29:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35"/>“ ‘Xii solomasɛxɛde lɔxɔni, ɛ xa ɛ malan. Ɛ nama ɛ wanla kɛ. <verse eid="NUM 29:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36"/>Ɛ xa tura keden nun konton keden nun yɛxɛɛn ɲɛɛ keden kedenna solofere ba saraxa gan daxin na fɛ mi naxanye ra. E xa rali Alatala ma tɛɛn na, naxan xiri rafan a ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37"/>E bama nɛn e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane, naxanye lanɲɛ turane nun kontonne nun yɛxɛɛne yatɛn ma. <verse eid="NUM 29:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38"/>Ɛ mɔn xa kɔtɔ keden ba yulubi xafari saraxan na, sa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ saraxa gan daxine fari e nun e bogise saraxane nun e minse saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39"/>“ ‘Saraxane nan ne ra ɛ lan ɛ xa naxanye ba Alatala xa sali lɔxɔne yi. E sama nɛn ɛ saraxa gan daxine fari, e nun ɛ bogise saraxane nun ɛ minse saraxane nun ɛ bɔɲɛ xunbeli saraxane, ɛ naxanye ba dɛ tiina fe ra hanma ɛ ɲɛnige ma saraxane.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 29:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30"/>
  <para style="s">Dɛ tiine sariyana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1"/>Alatala Musa yamari naxanye birin ma, a yi ne birin fala Isirayila kaane xa.<verse eid="NUM 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2"/>Musa yi falan ti Isirayila bɔnsɔnne mangane xa, a naxa, “Alatalaa yamarini ito nan fixi: <verse eid="NUM 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3"/>Xa xɛmɛna nde a kɔlɔ hanma a a dɛ ti a a xa saraxan ba Alatala xa hanma a xa fena nde raba, a nama a falan kala. A naxan birin falaxi, a xa na raba.”<verse eid="NUM 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4"/>“Xa sungutunna nde a kɔlɔ hanma a a dɛ ti a a saraxan bama Alatala xa, hanma a fena nde rabama nɛn, a mɔn a baba konni, <verse eid="NUM 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5"/>a baba na a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa a mi sese fala, a lan a yi a kɔlɔne nun a dɛ ti xuine birin nakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6"/>Koni a baba na a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa a mi tin, a mi lan a yi a kɔlɔne nun a dɛ ti xuine rakamali. Alatala diɲama nɛn a ma, bayo a baba mi tinxi.”<verse eid="NUM 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7"/>“Xa sungutunna nde a kɔlɔ hanma a a dɛ ti xaxilitareyani, na xanbi ra a yi futu, <verse eid="NUM 30:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8"/>a xɛmɛn na a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa a mi sese fala, a lan a yi a kɔlɔne nun a dɛ ti xuine rakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9"/>A xɛmɛn na a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa a mi tin, a xa a kɔlɔne nun a xaxilitareya dɛ xuine yikala. Alatala diɲama nɛn ɲaxanla ma.”<verse eid="NUM 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10"/>“Kaɲa gilɛɛn hanma ɲaxanla naxan xɛmɛn bata a mɛ a ra, xa na nde a kɔlɔ hanma a a dɛ ti a fena nde rabama nɛn, a lan a yi na birin nakamali.”<verse eid="NUM 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11"/>“Xa ɲaxanla bata dɔxɔ xɛmɛ taa ra, a a kɔlɔ hanma a a dɛ ti a fena nde rabama nɛn, <verse eid="NUM 30:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12"/>a xɛmɛn na a mɛ, xa a mi sese fala a mi tondi, a lan a yi a kɔlɔne nun dɛ ti xuine birin nakamali. <verse eid="NUM 30:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13"/>Koni a xɛmɛn na a mɛ waxatin naxan yi, xa a mi tin, a mi lan a yi a kɔlɔne nun dɛ ti xuine rakamali. Alatala diɲama nɛn a ma, amasɔtɔ a xɛmɛn bata a kala. <verse eid="NUM 30:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14"/>Nayi, a xɛmɛn nɔɛ tinɲɛ nɛn hanma a tondi a kɔlɔne nun a dɛ ti xuine ma. <verse eid="NUM 30:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15"/>A na a mɛ, xa a xɛmɛn mi sese fala a ɲaxanla xa, a bata tin a kɔlɔne nun dɛ ti xuine birin ma a dunduni. <verse eid="NUM 30:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16"/>Koni xa lɔxɔn bata dangu a xɛmɛna a fe mɛxi naxan yi, a yi fa a ɲaxanla dɛ ti xuine kala, xɛmɛna a ɲaxanla hakɛn goronna tongoma nɛn.”<verse eid="NUM 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 30:17"/>Alatala na sariyane nan falaxi Musa xa dɛ tiina fe yi ɲaxalan futuxina fe yi hanma dii tɛmɛn naxan a baba konni.<verse eid="NUM 30:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31"/>
  <para style="s">Midiyan kaane yi ɲaxankata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 31:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2"/>“Midiyan kaane fe ɲaxin saran e ra, e naxan ligaxi Isirayila kaane ra. Na xanbi ra, i laxirayama nɛn.” <verse eid="NUM 31:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3"/>Nayi, Musa yi a fala yamaan xa, a naxa, “Muxuna ndee xa e yitɔn yɛngɛ so xinla ma ɛ yɛ. E sigama Midiyan kaane nan yɛngɛdeyi, alogo Alatala xa e fe ɲaxine saran e ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4"/>Nayi, ɛ xa yɛngɛ soon muxu wuli keden keden tongo Isirayila bɔnsɔnne birin yi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5"/>E yi muxu wuli fu nun firin tongo Isirayila ganle yɛ yɛngɛ so xinla ma. Bɔnsɔn keden, wuli keden. <verse eid="NUM 31:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6"/>Musa yi e rasiga yɛngɛni, bɔnsɔn yo bɔnsɔn muxu wuli keden, e nun Finexasi, saraxarali Eleyasari a dii xɛmɛna, naxan se rasariɲanxina ndee xali e nun xɔtaan naxanye fema yɛngɛni.<verse eid="NUM 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7"/>E yi siga Midiyan yamanan yɛngɛdeni alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. E yi xɛmɛne birin faxa. <verse eid="NUM 31:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8"/>E Midiyan manga suulun fan faxa, Efi nun Rekemi nun Suru nun Xuru nun Reba. E Beyori a dii Balami fan faxa silanfanna ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9"/>E yi Midiyan ɲaxanle nun e diine tongo, e nun e xuruseene nun e yii seene birin. <verse eid="NUM 31:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10"/>E yi e taane nun e dɔxɔdene birin gan. <verse eid="NUM 31:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11"/>E yi se tongoxine birin xali e nun muxune nun xuruseene. <verse eid="NUM 31:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12"/>E yi fa suxu muxune nun se tongoxine ra Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari nun Isirayila yamaan fɛma daaxadeni Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛni Yurudɛn baan dɛxɔn Yeriko yɛtagi.<verse eid="NUM 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari nun yamaan mangane yi siga e ralandeni daaxaden fari ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14"/>Musa yi xɔlɔ gali kuntigine ma naxanye muxu wuli xun na e nun naxanye muxu kɛmɛ xun na naxanye yi kelima na yɛngɛni. <verse eid="NUM 31:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15"/>Musa yi e maxɔdin, a naxa, “Nanfera ɛ ɲaxanle luxi e nii ra? <verse eid="NUM 31:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16"/>E tan nan Balami a kawandin namɛ, e Isirayila kaane bira tinxintareyani Alatala ra Peyori yi, fitina furen yi so Alatala yamani. <verse eid="NUM 31:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17"/>Iki ɛ dii xɛmɛne birin faxa, e nun ɲaxanla naxanye xɛmɛ feen kolon. <verse eid="NUM 31:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18"/>Koni ɛ nɔɛ sungutun nasɔlɔnxine ramarɛ nɛn ɛ yɛtɛ xa. <verse eid="NUM 31:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19"/>Naxanye birin faxan tixi ɛ yɛ hanma e yiin din muxu faxaxin na, ne xa lu daaxaden fari ma xii solofere. Ɛ lan ɛ yi ɛ rasariɲan xii saxanden nun xii soloferede lɔxɔni e nun ɛ suxu muxune. <verse eid="NUM 31:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20"/>Ɛ mɔn xa dugine rasariɲan, e nun seen naxanye rafalaxi kidin na hanma sii xaben na hanma wudin na.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21"/>Sofaan naxanye keli yɛngɛni, saraxarali Eleyasari yi a fala ne xa, a naxa, “Alatala ito nan yamarixi Musa ma a sariyani: <verse eid="NUM 31:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22"/>Xɛmaan nun gbetin nun sulan nun wuren nun yɔxɔna, <verse eid="NUM 31:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23"/>e nun tɛɛn mi naxanye birin ganma, ɛ xa ne rasariɲan tɛɛn nan na. Na xanbi ra, ɛ yi e rasin marasariɲan igeni. Naxanye ganma, ɛ ne rasin marasariɲan igeni gbansan. <verse eid="NUM 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24"/>Ɛ na ɛ dugine xa xii soloferede lɔxɔni, ɛ sariɲanma nɛn. Nayi, ɛ nɔɛ soɛ nɛn daaxadeni.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26"/>“I tan nun saraxarali Eleyasari nun yamaan xabila mangane, ɛ muxune nun xuruseene birin tɛngɛ naxanye tongoxi yɛngɛni. <verse eid="NUM 31:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27"/>Na xanbi ra, i xa e yitaxun firinna ra, fɔxɔ kedenna sofane nan gbeen na ra naxanye siga yɛngɛni, fɔxɔ kedenna yamaan dɔnxɛn nan gbeen na ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28"/>I xa ndedi ba sofane gbeen na mudun na Alatala xa: i muxu keden ba muxu kɛmɛ suulunna ra hanma xuruse kɛmɛ suulun e nun ɲingene nun sofanle nun yɛxɛɛne nun siine birin. <verse eid="NUM 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29"/>I xa muduni ito ba e gbeen na, i yi a so saraxarali Eleyasari yii Alatala gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 31:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30"/>Isirayila yamaan dɔnxɛn gbeen tan, i xa muxu keden ba muxu tonge suulunna ra, hanma xuruse tonge suulun e nun ɲingene nun sofanle nun yɛxɛɛne nun siine birin. I yi e so Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii, Alatala Batu Bubun taxuxi naxanye ra.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 31:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32"/>Sofane seen naxanye tongo yɛngɛni, itoe nan lu yɛngɛn xanbini: xuruse xunxuri wuli kɛmɛ sennin wuli tonge solofere wuli suulun, <verse eid="NUM 31:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33"/>ɲinge wuli tonge solofere wuli firin, <verse eid="NUM 31:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34"/>sofali wuli tonge sennin wuli keden, <verse eid="NUM 31:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35"/>e nun sungutun nasɔlɔnxi wuli tonge saxan wuli firin.<verse eid="NUM 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36"/>Naxan yitaxun yɛngɛsone ra na ni i ra: xuruse xunxuri wuli kɛmɛ saxan wuli tonge saxan e nun solofere kɛmɛ suulun, <verse eid="NUM 31:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37"/>xuruse xunxurin kɛmɛ sennin tonge solofere e nun suulun yi ba a ra mudun na Alatala xa, <verse eid="NUM 31:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38"/>e nun ɲinge wuli tonge saxan wuli senninne, ɲinge tonge solofere e nun firin yi ba a ra mudun na Alatala xa, <verse eid="NUM 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39"/>e nun sofali wuli tonge saxan kɛmɛ suulunna, sofali tonge sennin e nun keden yi ba a ra mudun na Alatala xa, <verse eid="NUM 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40"/>e nun muxu wuli fu nun senninna, muxu tonge saxan e nun firin yi ba a ra mudun na Alatala xa. <verse eid="NUM 31:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41"/>Musa yi na mudun so saraxarali Eleyasari yii Alatala gbeen na, alo Alatala a yamari a ma kii naxan yi.<verse eid="NUM 31:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42"/>Isirayila yamaan gbeen ni i ra Musa naxan dɔxɔ a danna. <verse eid="NUM 31:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43"/>Yamaan gbeena: xuruse xunxuri wuli kɛmɛ saxan wuli tonge saxan wuli solofere kɛmɛ suulun, <verse eid="NUM 31:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44"/>e nun ɲinge wuli tonge saxan wuli sennin, <verse eid="NUM 31:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45"/>e nun sofali wuli tonge saxan kɛmɛ suulun, <verse eid="NUM 31:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46"/>e nun muxu wuli fu nun sennin. <verse eid="NUM 31:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47"/>Naxan soxi Isirayila kaane yii, Musa yi muxu keden ba muxu tonge suulunna ra, a xuruse keden ba xuruse tonge suulunna ra, alo Alatala a yamari a ma kii naxan yi. A yi e so Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii, Ala Batu Bubun yi taxuxi naxanye ra.<verse eid="NUM 31:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48"/>Ganla kuntigine yi siga Musa fɛma naxanye muxu wuli xun na e nun naxanye muxu kɛmɛ xun na. <verse eid="NUM 31:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49"/>E yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Sofaan naxanye nxɔ yamarine bun, nxu bata ne tɛngɛ. Hali keden mi baxi nxu ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50"/>Nanara, nxu xɛma seen naxanye sɔtɔxi, nxu bata fa ne ra Alatala xɔn a kiseen na nxu niin xunba saranna ra: kɔɛ birane, yii kɔɛ rasone, yii soli rasone, tunla sone, e nun ɲɛrɛne.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari yi na xɛma muranne birin nasuxu e ra. <verse eid="NUM 31:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52"/>Kuntigin naxanye muxu wuli xun na e nun naxanye muxu kɛmɛ xun na, ne xɛma seene binyan yi sigɛ han kilo kɛmɛ tonge solofere, e naxanye fi Alatala ma. <verse eid="NUM 31:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53"/>Sofane tan yi e se tongoxine ramara e yii. <verse eid="NUM 31:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54"/>Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari yi kuntigine xɛmaan tongo, e yi a xali Naralan Bubuni, alogo Alatala xa a ɲɔxɔ lu Isirayila kaane xɔn.<verse eid="NUM 31:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaana ndee yi dɔxɔ Yurudɛn sogeteden binni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Sariyane 3.12-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1"/>Xuruse wuyaxi yi Rubɛn nun Gadi bɔnsɔnne yii. E yi a to a Yaasɛri nun Galadi bɔxɔn yi fan e xuruseene xa. <verse eid="NUM 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2"/>Nayi, Gadi kaane nun Rubɛn kaane yi fa Musa nun saraxarali Eleyasari nun yamaan mangane fɛma, e yi a fala, e naxa, <verse eid="NUM 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3"/>“Alatala yamanan naxanye nɔxi Isirayila yamaan xa, Ataroti nun Dibon nun Yaasɛri nun Nimira nun Xɛsibɔn nun Eleyale nun Sebami nun Nebo nun Bewoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4"/>na yamanane fan xuruseene xa, anu xuruseene nxu tan yii han, nxu tan ɛ walikɛne.” <verse eid="NUM 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Xa ɛ tinɲɛ nxɔ falan ma, na bɔxɔn xa so nxu yii, ɛ nama nxu xali Yurudɛn baan kidi ma.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6"/>Musa yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Ɛ tan dɔxɔn nɛn be ba, ɛ ngaxakedenne yi siga yɛngɛ sodeni? <verse eid="NUM 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7"/>Nanfera ɛ Isirayila kaane tunnaxɔlɔma sigadeni yamanani Alatala naxan soxi e yii? <verse eid="NUM 32:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8"/>Ɛ fafane fan na nan liga bonni, n to e rasiga yamanan matodeni keli Kadesi-Barineya yi. <verse eid="NUM 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9"/>E te nɛn han Esikoli mɛrɛmɛrɛni. E to yelin yamanan matoɛ, e yi Isirayila kaane tunnaxɔlɔ e ma alogo e nama siga yamanani Alatala naxan soxi e yii. <verse eid="NUM 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10"/>Na lɔxɔni Alatala yi xɔlɔ, a yi a kɔlɔ, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11"/>‘Muxuni itoe naxan minixi Misiran yi, naxanye barin bata dangu ɲɛɛ mɔxɔɲɛn na, ne mi bɔxɔn toma n na n kɔlɔxi naxan so fe ra Iburahima nun Isiyaga nun Yaxuba yii, amasɔtɔ e mi luxi n fɔxɔ ra ki faɲi. <verse eid="NUM 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12"/>Fɔ Yefune a dii Kalebi, Kenisi kaana, e nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe, bayo e lu nɛn Alatala fɔxɔ ra ki faɲi.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13"/>Alatalaa xɔlɔ gbeen keli nɛn Isirayila kaane xili ma, a yi e rasiga tonbonna xun xɔn ɲɛɛ tonge naanin, han na waxatin muxune birin yi ɲan naxanye fe ɲaxin liga Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14"/>Iki ɛ tan yulubi kanne, ɛ faxi ɛ fafane nan ma. Ɛ Alatala raxɔlɔma nɛn Isirayila xili ma dangu e ra. <verse eid="NUM 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15"/>Anu, xa ɛ xɛtɛ a fɔxɔ ra, a mɔn yamani ito birin luma nɛn tonbonni, ɛ yi findi yamaan birin halagi xunna ra.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16"/>Na muxune mɔn yi e maso Musa ra e yi a fala a xa, e naxa, “Nxu waxi sansanne sa feni be nxɔ xuruseene xa nxu yi taane ti nxɔ denbayane xa. <verse eid="NUM 32:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17"/>Na xanbi ra, nxu yɛngɛ so seene tongɛ, nxu yi ti Isirayila kaan bonne yɛɛ ra, nxu yi e xali e yirene yi. Nayi, nxɔ denbayane luma nɛn taa makantanxine kui, e ratanga yamanani ito muxune ma. <verse eid="NUM 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18"/>Nxu mi xɛtɛ nxu konne yi, fɔ Isirayila kaane birin na dɔxɔ e bɔxɔne yi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19"/>Nxu mi bɔxɔn sɔtɔma Yurudɛn baan fɔxɔ kedenni alo e tan, bayo nxu bata nxɔ bɔxɔn sɔtɔ be binni baan sogeteden binni.” <verse eid="NUM 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20"/>Musa yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa ɛ falani ito liga, xa ɛ yɛngɛ so seene tongo Alatala xa, <verse eid="NUM 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21"/>xa ɛ sofane birin Yurudɛn baan gidi Alatala yɛtagi han a yi a yaxune birin kedi, <verse eid="NUM 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22"/>xa yamanan lu Alatala nɔɔn bun, nayi Alatala nun Isirayila tinma nɛn ɛ yi xɛtɛ be. Nayi, yamanani ito findima nɛn ɛ gbeen na Alatala yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23"/>Koni xa ɛ mi na liga, ɛ bata yulubin liga Alatala ra. Ɛ xa a kolon, fa fala ɛ yulubin saranna ɛ lima nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 32:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24"/>Awa, ɛ xa taane ti ɛ denbayane xa, e nun sansanne ɛ xuruse kurune xa, koni ɛ xa ɛ dɛ ti xuine rakamali de!”<verse eid="NUM 32:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25"/>Gadi kaane nun Rubɛn kaane yi a fala Musa xa, e naxa, “Nxu tan, i ya walikɛne a ligama nɛn alo i a yamarixi kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 32:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26"/>Nxɔ diine nun nxɔ ɲaxanle nun nxɔ xuruseene birin luma nɛn Galadi taane yi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27"/>Koni nxu tan i ya walikɛne birin yɛngɛ so seene tongoma nɛn, nxu siga yɛngɛ sodeni Alatala yɛtagi, alo nxu kanna a falaxi kii naxan yi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28"/>Musa yi yamarin fi saraxarali Eleyasari ma e nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe ma, e nun Isirayila bɔnsɔn mangane ma e fe ra. <verse eid="NUM 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29"/>Musa yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Xa Gadi kaane nun Rubɛn kaane Yurudɛn baan gidi ɛ fɔxɔ ra, e birin yi yɛngɛ so seene tongo Alatala xa, nayi yamanan na lu ɛ nɔɔn bun, ɛ Galadi yamanan so e yii e gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 32:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30"/>Koni xa e birin mi gidi ɛ fɔxɔ ra yɛngɛ so seene ra e yii, e xa dɔxɔ ɛ tagi Kanan bɔxɔni.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31"/>Gadi kaane nun Rubɛn kaane yi a fala, e naxa, “Alatala bata naxan fala, nxu tan i ya walikɛne na ligama nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32"/>Nxu gidima nɛn Kanan yamanani Alatala xa yɛngɛ so seene ra nxu yii, koni nxu kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔma nɛn Yurudɛn baan be binni.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33"/>Musa yi Amorine manga Sixɔn ma yamanan nun Basan manga Ogo a yamanan so Gadi kaane nun Rubɛn kaane nun Yusufu a dii Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna yii, e nun e taane nun bɔxɔn naxanye e rabilinni.<verse eid="NUM 32:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34"/>Gadi kaane yi Dibon nun Ataroti nun Aroyeri nun <verse eid="NUM 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35"/>Atiroti-Sofani nun Yaasɛri nun Yogboha nun <verse eid="NUM 32:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36"/>Beti-Nimira nun Beti-Haran ti taa makantanxine ra, e yi xuruse sansanne sa.<verse eid="NUM 32:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37"/>Rubɛn kaane yi Xɛsibɔn ti, e nun Eleyale nun Kiriyatayimi nun <verse eid="NUM 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38"/>Nebo nun Baali-Meyɔn, e naxanye xiliye masara, e nun Sibima. E taan naxanye ti e yi ne xili sa.<verse eid="NUM 32:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39"/>Manase a dii Makiri yixɛtɛne yi siga Galadi yi, e yi a suxu, e yi Amorine kedi naxanye yi dɔxi na. <verse eid="NUM 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40"/>Nayi, Musa yi Galadi so e yii alogo e xa dɔxɔ na. <verse eid="NUM 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41"/>Yayiri, Manase yixɛtɛna nde yi siga, a yi taadina ndee suxu, a yi e xili sa “Yayiriya.” <verse eid="NUM 32:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42"/>Noba yi siga, a yi Kenata suxu e nun a banxidɛne, a yi a xili sa “Nobaya.”<verse eid="NUM 32:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33"/>
  <para style="s">Isirayila kaane sigatina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1"/>Isirayila kaane sigadene ni i ra e to mini Misiran yi e gali yɛɛn ma, Musa nun Haruna yamarin bun. <verse eid="NUM 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2"/>Musa yi tidene sɛbɛma Alatalaa yamarin nan ma. E sigadene ni i ra, e tide yɛɛn ma.<verse eid="NUM 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3"/>E keli Ramisesi yi kike singen xii fu nun suulundeni Halagi Tiin Dangu Lɔxɔn Sanla kuye baani. Isirayila kaane xɔrɔyaxin yi mini Misiran kaane birin yɛtagi, <verse eid="NUM 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4"/>Misiran kaane yi e dii singene binbine maluxunma waxatin naxan yi Alatala naxanye faxa e yɛ. Amasɔtɔ Alatala e alane yalagi nɛn.<verse eid="NUM 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5"/>Isirayila kaane yi keli Ramisesi yi, e sa daaxa Sukɔti yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6"/>E yi keli Sukɔti yi, e sa daaxa Etama yi tonbonna danna ra. <verse eid="NUM 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7"/>E yi keli Etama yi, e yi xɛtɛ han Pihahiroti yi, Baali-Sefɔn yɛtagi, e yi sa daaxa Migidoli dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8"/>E yi keli Pihahiroti yi, e yi baan gidi tonbonna binni, e yi xii saxan siga ti Etama tonbonni, e yi sa daaxa Mara yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9"/>E yi keli Mara yi, e siga Elimi yi, tigi fu nun firin e nun tugu bili tonge solofere yi dɛnaxan yi. E yi daaxa mɛnni. <verse eid="NUM 33:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10"/>E yi keli Elimi yi, e sa daaxa Gbala Baan dɛxɔn. <verse eid="NUM 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11"/>E yi keli Gbala Baani, e sa daaxa Sin tonbonni. <verse eid="NUM 33:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12"/>E yi keli Sin tonbonni, e sa daaxa Dofika yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13"/>E yi keli Dofika yi, e sa daaxa Alusi yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14"/>E yi keli Alusi yi, e sa daaxa Refidimi yi, yamaan mi min igen sɔtɔ dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15"/>E yi keli Refidimi yi, e sa daaxa Sinayi tonbonni.<verse eid="NUM 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16"/>E yi keli Sinayi tonbonni, e sa daaxa Kibiroti-Hatawa yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17"/>E yi keli Kibiroti-Hatawa yi, e sa daaxa Xaserɔti yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18"/>E yi keli Xaserɔti yi, e sa daaxa Ritima yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19"/>E yi keli Ritima yi, e sa daaxa Rimɔn-Peresi yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20"/>E yi keli Rimɔn-Peresi yi, e sa daaxa Libina yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21"/>E yi keli Libina yi, e sa daaxa Risa yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22"/>E yi keli Risa yi, e sa daaxa Kehelata yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23"/>E yi keli Kehelata yi, e sa daaxa Saferi geyaan ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24"/>E yi keli Saferi geyaan ma, e sa daaxa Harada yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25"/>E yi keli Harada yi, e sa daaxa Makeloti yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26"/>E yi keli Makeloti yi, e sa daaxa Taxati yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27"/>E yi keli Taxati yi, e sa daaxa Tera yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28"/>E yi keli Tera yi, e sa daaxa Mitika yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29"/>E yi keli Mitika yi, e sa daaxa Hasimona yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30"/>E yi keli Hasimona yi, e sa daaxa Moseroti yi.<verse eid="NUM 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31"/>E yi keli Moseroti yi, e sa daaxa Bene-Yakani yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32"/>E yi keli Bene-Yakani yi, e sa daaxa Horo-Gidigadi yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33"/>E yi keli Horo-Gidigadi yi, e sa daaxa Yotobata yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34"/>E yi keli Yotobata yi, e sa daaxa Abirona yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35"/>E yi keli Abirona yi, e sa daaxa Esiyon-Gebere yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36"/>E yi keli Esiyon-Gebere yi, e sa daaxa Kadesi yi Sini tonbonni. <verse eid="NUM 33:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37"/>E yi keli Kadesi yi, e sa daaxa Horo geyaan ma, Edɔn yamanan danna.<verse eid="NUM 33:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38"/>Saraxarali Haruna yi te Horo geyaan ma, Alatalaa yamarin ma. A sa faxa mɛnni, Isirayila kaane minin ɲɛɛ tonge naanindeni Misiran yi a kike suulunden xii singeni. <verse eid="NUM 33:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39"/>Haruna bata yi ɲɛɛ kɛmɛ mɔxɔɲɛn nun saxan sɔtɔ siimayaan na a faxa waxatin naxan yi Horo geyaan fari.<verse eid="NUM 33:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40"/>Kanan Manga Aradi naxan yi dɔxi Negewi yi Kanan yamanani, na yi Isirayila kaane fa feen mɛ.<verse eid="NUM 33:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41"/>E yi keli Horo geyaan ma, e sa daaxa Salimona yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42"/>E yi keli Salimona yi, e sa daaxa Punon yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43"/>E yi keli Punon yi, e sa daaxa Oboti yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44"/>E yi keli Oboti yi, e sa daaxa Ye-Abarimi yi Moyaba danna ra.<verse eid="NUM 33:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45"/>E yi keli Iyimi yi, e sa daaxa Dibon-Gadi yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46"/>E yi keli Dibon-Gadi yi, e sa daaxa Alamɔn-Dibilatayimi yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47"/>E yi keli Alamɔn-Dibilatayimi yi, e sa daaxa Abarimi geyane yi Nebo yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 33:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48"/>E yi keli Abarimi geyane yi, e sa daaxa Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi, Yurudɛn baan dɛxɔn, Yeriko yɛtagi. <verse eid="NUM 33:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49"/>E yi daaxa Yurudɛn baan dɛxɔn Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi, keli Beti-Yɛsimoti yi han Abeli-Sitimi.<verse eid="NUM 33:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi Yurudɛn baan dɛxɔn Yeriko yɛtagi, <verse eid="NUM 33:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51"/>a Musa xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na Yurudɛn baan gidi, ɛ so Kanan yamanani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52"/>ɛ xa yamanan muxune birin kedi. Ɛ e suxure gɛmɛne nun suxure wurene kala, e nun e taane kidene. <verse eid="NUM 33:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53"/>Ɛ e yamanan tongo ɛ yi dɔxɔ na, amasɔtɔ n bata a so ɛ yii ɛ gbeen na. <verse eid="NUM 33:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54"/>Ɛ masɛnsɛnna ti, ɛ yamanani taxun bɔnsɔnne ra. Naxanye wuya, ɛ kɛɛ bɔxɔ gbeen so ne yii. Naxanye mi wuya ɛ xa a xurin so ne yii. E na naxan sɔtɔ masɛnsɛnna xɔn, e gbeen nan na ra. Kɛɛ bɔxɔne yitaxunma ɛ fafane bɔnsɔn yɛɛn nan ma. <verse eid="NUM 33:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55"/>Koni xa ɛ mi yamanan muxune birin kedi, ɛ na naxanye lu na, ne ɛ tɔrɔma nɛn alo tansinna ɛ yɛɛne xɔn hanma ɲanla naxanye ɛ fatin masɔxɔnma. E ɛ tɔrɔma nɛn yamanani ɛ dɔxɔma dɛnaxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 33:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56"/>Nayi, n naxan nagidixi e ma, na ligama ɛ tan nan na.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34"/>
  <para style="s">Kanan bɔxɔn danna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2"/>a a xa a yamari Isirayila kaane ma, a naxa, “Ɛ na so Kanan yamanani, n bɔxɔn naxan soma ɛ yii ɛ kɛɛn na, na danne ni i ra: <verse eid="NUM 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3"/>Ɛ yamanan yiifari fɔxɔn danna findima Sini tonbonna nan na, Edɔn yamanan danna ra. Na danna fɔlɔma Fɔxɔ Daraan yiifari fɔxɔn nin sogeteden binni. <verse eid="NUM 34:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4"/>A bilinma nɛn Akaribimi geyaan yiifari fɔxɔni, siga Sini binni, dangu Kadesi-Barineya yiifari fɔxɔn ma han Xasari-Adari han Asimon. <verse eid="NUM 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5"/>Keli Asimon yi, danna mɔn danguma nɛn sa dɔxɔ Misiran xuden na, a sa dɔxɔ fɔxɔ igen na. <verse eid="NUM 34:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6"/>Sogegodode binni, danna findima fɔxɔ ige gbeen nan na. <verse eid="NUM 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7"/>Kɔmɛnna ma, ɛ xa danna sa fɔxɔ ige gbeen nun Horo geyaan tagi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8"/>Keli Horo geyaan ma, ɛ yi a radangu Lebo-Xamata han Sedadi yi. <verse eid="NUM 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9"/>A yi siga han Sifiron, sa dɔxɔ Xasari-Enan na. Ɛ kɔmɛn ma danna nan na ra. <verse eid="NUM 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10"/>Sogeteden binni, ɛ xa danna sa keli Xasari-Enan yi siga Sefami binni. <verse eid="NUM 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11"/>Keli mɛnni, a yi siga Ribila binni, Ayin sogeteden binni, sa dɔxɔ tintin yiren na Kinɛrɛti Daraan sogetedeni. <verse eid="NUM 34:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12"/>Danna yi sa dɔxɔ Yurudɛn Baan na siga Fɔxɔ Darani. Ɛ yamanan danne findin ne nan na.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13"/>Musa yi na yamarine rali Isirayila kaane ma. A mɔn yi a fala e xa, a naxa, “Alatala yamanani ito nan yitaxunma bɔnsɔn solomanaanin nun a tagiin na masɛnsɛnna xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14"/>Amasɔtɔ Rubɛn bɔnsɔnna nun Gadi bɔnsɔnna nun Manase bɔnsɔnna fɔxɔ kedenna bata yi e kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15"/>Bɔnsɔn firin nun a tagini ito bata e kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔ Yurudɛn Baan sogeteden binni, Yeriko yɛtagi.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yɛɛratine xa bɔxɔni taxun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17"/>“Saraxarali Eleyasari nun Nunu a dii Yosuwe xa yamanani taxun. <verse eid="NUM 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18"/>I mɔn xa bɔnsɔn manga keden keden sa e fari e malideni.”<verse eid="NUM 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19"/>E xinle ni itoe ra: Yefune a dii Kalebi Yuda bɔnsɔnni,<verse eid="NUM 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20"/>Amixudi a dii Semuyɛli Simeyɔn bɔnsɔnni,<verse eid="NUM 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21"/>Kisilon ma dii Elidadi Bunyamin bɔnsɔnni,<verse eid="NUM 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22"/>Yogili a dii Buki, Dan bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23"/>Efodi a dii Xaniyeli, Yusufu a dii Manase bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24"/>Sifitan ma dii Kɛmuyɛli, Yusufu a dii Efirami bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25"/>Parinaki a dii Elisafan, Sabulon bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26"/>Asan ma dii Palitiyɛli, Isakari bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27"/>Selomi a dii Axixudi, Aseri bɔnsɔn mangana,<verse eid="NUM 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28"/>e nun Amixudi a dii Pedaheli Nafatali bɔnsɔn mangana.<verse eid="NUM 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29"/>Alatala ne nan yamarixi e xa Kanan yamani taxun Isirayila kaane ra.<verse eid="NUM 34:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35"/>
  <para style="s">Lewi a taane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi Yurudɛn Baan dɛxɔn Yeriko yɛtagi, a naxa, <verse eid="NUM 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2"/>“Isirayila kaane yamari a e xa taane ba e kɛɛ bɔxɔne ra e yi e fi Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune ma, alogo e xa dɔxɔ na. E mɔn yi na taane rabilin xɛɛne so e yii. <verse eid="NUM 35:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3"/>Nayi, Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune taane sɔtɔma nɛn e dɔxɔdene ra, e yi bɔxɔne sɔtɔ e rabilinni e ɲingene nun e seene nun e xuruseene xa. <verse eid="NUM 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4"/>Ɛ bɔxɔn naxanye soma Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii, ne danne nun taane yinne xa makuya e bode ra han nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli keden. <verse eid="NUM 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5"/>Taan fɔxɔ naaninne kuyan xa lan, nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli firin sogeteden binni, nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli firin yiifari fɔxɔni, nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli firin sogegododen binni, e nun nɔngɔnna yɛ wuli firin kɔmɛnna ma. Taan xa lu a tagini. E xɛɛne danne sama na kii nin. <verse eid="NUM 35:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6"/>Ɛ taan naxanye soma Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii, ɛ xa sennin sugandi ne yɛ marakisi taane ra alogo muxun naxan na faxan ti, a xa a gi, a siga mɛnna nde yi. Ɛ mɔn xa taa tonge naanin nun firin gbɛtɛye so e yii. <verse eid="NUM 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7"/>A malanxina, ɛ taa tonge naanin nun solomasɛxɛ nan soma Lewi bɔnsɔnna muxune yii e nun e rabilinne xɛɛne. <verse eid="NUM 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8"/>Isirayila bɔnsɔnna birin xa taana ndee so e yii naxan nun a bɔnsɔnna lan. Taa gbegbe xa ba bɔnsɔn gbeene bɔxɔne ra, ndedi yi ba bɔnsɔn xurine bɔxɔne ra.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Marakisi taane</para>
  <para style="r">Sariyane 4.40-43 nun 19.1-13 nun Yosuwe 20.1-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9"/>Alatala yi a fala Musa xa, <verse eid="NUM 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10"/>a a xa a fala Isirayila kaane xa, a naxa, “Ɛ na Yurudɛn baan gidi ɛ so Kanan yamanani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11"/>ɛ xa taana ndee sugandi marakisi taane ra. Naxan na faxan ti a mi a rakelixi a ma, a a gima nɛn a siga mɛnna nde yi. <verse eid="NUM 35:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12"/>A yi ratanga faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun ma mɛnni, alogo a nama faxa benun yamaan yi a makiti. <verse eid="NUM 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13"/>Ɛ taan naxanye soma e yii, taa sennin nan findima marakisi taane ra ne yɛ. <verse eid="NUM 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14"/>Marakisi taa saxan xa lu Yurudɛn baan sogeteden binni, saxan Kanan yamanani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15"/>Muxune ratangama nɛn taa senninni itoe yi, Isirayila kaana hanma xɔɲɛn naxan dɔxi Isirayila kaane yɛ. Naxan na faxan ti, a mi a rakeli a ma, fɔ a xa a gi, a siga mɛnna nde yi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16"/>“Xa muxuna nde faxan ti wure ma seen na, faxa tiin nan na kanna ra. A lan a yi faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17"/>Xa a gɛmɛn tongo naxan muxun faxɛ, a muxuna nde gɔlɔn a ra, a yi a faxa, faxa tiin nan na kanna ra. A lan a yi faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18"/>Xa a wudin tongo naxan muxun faxɛ, a yi muxuna nde bɔnbɔ a ra, a faxa, faxa tiin nan na kanna ra. A lan a yi faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19"/>Faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun nan faxa tiin faxama. A na a to, a xa a faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20"/>Xa muxuna nde a boden nabira, a bata yi a yitɔn xɔnnantenyani, hanma a a rakeli a ma, a yi a gɔlɔn, a yi a faxa, <verse eid="NUM 35:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21"/>hanma a yi a bɔnbɔ xɔnnantenyani, a yi a faxa, faxa tiin nan na kanna ra. A lan a yi faxa. Faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun na a to, a xa a faxa.”<verse eid="NUM 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22"/>“Koni xa muxuna nde a boden nabira tantanni, xɔnnantenyaan mi a ra, hanma a a gɔlɔn, a mi a rakeli a ma, <verse eid="NUM 35:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23"/>hanma a mi a toxi, a yi gɛmɛn nabira a ma naxan a faxɛ, a yi faxa, nayi bayo a yaxu mi a ra, a mi yi waxi fe ɲaxin liga feni a ra, <verse eid="NUM 35:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24"/>yamaan xa faxa tiin nun faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun makiti na sariyane xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 35:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25"/>Yamaan xa faxa tiin xun mafala faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun xɔn, e mɔn yi a xali marakisi taani a yi dɛnaxan yi. Faxa tiin xa lu marakisi taani han saraxarali kuntigin yi faxa, naxan masusan ture sariɲanxin na. <verse eid="NUM 35:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26"/>Koni xa faxa tiin mini marakisi taan danna ra, a yi dɛnaxan yi <verse eid="NUM 35:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27"/>faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun yi a to marakisi taan bɔxɔn fari ma, faxa muxun gbeeɲɔxɔ muxun nɔɛ nɛn a faxadeni, a mi yatɛma faxa tiin na. <verse eid="NUM 35:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28"/>Amasɔtɔ faxa tiin lan nɛn a lu marakisi taani han saraxarali kuntigin yi faxa. Fɔ na na faxa a yi nɔ xɛtɛ a bɔxɔne yi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29"/>“Ɛ sariyane nan ne ra waxati famatɔne birin yi, ɛ nɛma dɔxi dɛdɛ yi. <verse eid="NUM 35:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30"/>Naxan na muxun faxa, e xa a faxa xa sereyane sereyaan ba a a funfun na a ra. Koni ɛ nama muxu yo faxa sereya kedenna fala xuiin ma.”<verse eid="NUM 35:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31"/>“Ɛ nama gbetin nasuxu faxa tiin xunba saren na naxan lan a faxa. Ɛ xa a faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32"/>Ɛ nama gbetin nasuxu muxun yii naxan bata a gi, a siga marakisi taani, alogo a mɔn xa xɛtɛ, a dɔxɔ a bɔxɔni benun saraxarali kuntigin xa faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33"/>Ɛ nama yamanan naxɔsi ɛ dɔxi dɛnaxan yi. Anu, muxu faxan yamanan xɔsima nɛn. Bɔxɔn mi rasariɲanma faxa tixin ma fɔ faxa tiin na faxa. <verse eid="NUM 35:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34"/>Ɛ nama yamanan naxɔsi ɛ dɔxi dɛnaxan yi, e nun n tan fan dɔxi dɛnaxan yi. Amasɔtɔ Alatala nan n tan na, naxan dɔxi Isirayila kaane tagi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36"/>
  <para style="s">Kɛɛna fe sariyan dii tɛmɛne xa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1"/>Denbaya xunna ndee yi fa fala tideni Musa nun Isirayila bɔnsɔnne yɛɛratine xa keli Makiri a dii Galadi bɔnsɔnni, Manase mamandenna, Yusufu yixɛtɛne xabilane. <verse eid="NUM 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2"/>E yi a fala, e naxa, “Alatala to a yamari nxu kanna Musa ma a a xa kɛɛ bɔxɔne yitaxun Isirayila kaane ra masɛnsɛnna xɔn, a mɔn a yamarixi a ma nɛn a a xa nxu ngaxakedenna Selofexadi kɛɛn so a dii tɛmɛne yii. <verse eid="NUM 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3"/>Iki xa Isirayila bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛ xɛmɛna e futu, e kɛɛ bɔxɔn bama nɛn nxu bɔnsɔnna gbeen na, a sa e bɔnsɔn nɛnɛna bɔxɔn fari. Nayi, kɛɛ bɔxɔn naxan soxi nxu bɔnsɔnna yii masɛnsɛnna xɔn, na nde bama a ra nɛn. <verse eid="NUM 36:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4"/>Nayi, Isirayila Xɔrɔya Ɲɛɛn na a li, e kɛɛ bɔxɔn bama nɛn nxɔ bɔnsɔnna gbeen na, a sa e bɔnsɔn nɛnɛn gbeen fari.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5"/>Musa yi Alatalaa yamarine rali Isirayila kaane ma, a naxa, “Yusufu a diine bɔnsɔnna muxune ɲɔndi. <verse eid="NUM 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6"/>Alatalaa yamarin ni i ra Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne fe yi: Xɛmɛn naxan na e kɛnɛn e xa dɔxɔ na xɔn, koni a xa findi e baba bɔnsɔnna xabilan muxuna nde nan na, <verse eid="NUM 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7"/>alogo Isirayila kɛɛ bɔxɔne nama keli bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛ yi siga bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛ yi. Isirayila kaane birin xa e benbane bɔnsɔnna kɛɛ bɔxɔn nan sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8"/>Xa ɲaxalan yo bɔxɔn sɔtɔ kɛɛn na Isirayila bɔnsɔnna nde yi, a xa dɔxɔ a baba bɔnsɔnna xabilan muxuna nde xɔn, alogo Isirayila kaane birin xa e benbane kɛɛ bɔxɔn sɔtɔ. <verse eid="NUM 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9"/>Isirayila kɛɛ bɔxɔne nama keli bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛ yi siga bɔnsɔn gbɛtɛ yi, Isirayila bɔnsɔnne birin kɛɛ bɔxɔne xa lu e yii.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10"/>Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne yi a liga alo Alatala a yamari Musa ma kii naxan yi. <verse eid="NUM 36:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11"/>Maxala nun Tirisa nun Xɔgala nun Milika nun Noha nan Selofexadi a dii tɛmɛne ra. E yi dɔxɔ e baba ngaxakedenne dii xɛmɛne xɔn. <verse eid="NUM 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12"/>E dɔxɔ nɛn e baba Yusufu a dii Manase bɔnsɔnna xabilane muxuna ndee xɔn. Na ma, e kɛɛ bɔxɔne yi lu e baba bɔnsɔnna xabilani.<verse eid="NUM 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13"/>Yamarine nun sariyane nan ne ra Alatala naxanye fala Isirayila kaane xa fata Musa ra Moyaba mɛrɛmɛrɛne yi Yurudɛn baan dɛxɔn Yeriko yɛtagi.<verse eid="NUM 36:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36"/>
</usx>
